<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUKA</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu Kirisitu nga ko Luka aandikaa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="mt2">nga ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">aandikaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Bwingiro</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka aandikaa aMwatsi Mubuya ngakuno ko Matayo ne Mariko baandikaa:</para>
  <para style="io1">- Amulimo wa Yohana Murubiki yahikaa kwetemulira Yesu yo nchira (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref></char>), akulikirwe na burubike na reerekwa ra Yesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:21">3:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:13">4:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Amiberere ya Yesu mwa bandu i Ngalilaya, ha hubiri nelamya makoni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14">4:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:50">9:50</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Aluendo lwa Yesu ihuluka i Ngalilaya ihikira i Yerusalemu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:28">9:51–19:28</ref></char>). Wetuwe Luka aongerere bindi binwa bingi kwa maandiko ma Mariko, ngakuno, amushinga wa Musamariya mubuya, amuxoki kiashaasha, amwana yaheraa. Na bindi binwa ngakuno aretangula ro Yesu atangulaamo Mariya ne Marita.</para>
  <para style="io1">- Amulimo wa Yesu mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:29">19:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:38">21:38</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Iendera kwa minubo mitsindu na repfa ra Yesu; kiche kya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22-23">22–23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Akitabo kiendere kwa lwire lwa Pasaka (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24">24</ref></char>), Yesu yamepfuka haxungirwaako na bemitsa be Emau lubere akukumibwe mu mbingu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wetuwe, amaandiko ma Luka matashushene na ma Mariko. Hanyuma wa rebwerekya akitabo kiwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char>), iye atangire amaandiko mewe na bwingiro bwa lubuto lwa Yesu Kirisitu ne Yohana Murubiki (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1-2">1–2</ref></char>). Aho ho banasoma amwatsi wo bapfuliraa Mariya, na rebutwa ra Yohana Murubiki, na lumoo na reimanikira ra basumba, lunabe na lwimbo lwa Mariya, na lwa Sakariya na lwa Simiyoni. Mwa bwingiro umo, Luka aahulamo abinwa binene byaumpfaa: Alubuto lwa Yesu nga Ongo na Muisiraeli wa kuli. Na lehika liwe aliletera abandu yo munguruko. Luka abwerekitse mwa kitabo kiwe kandi antsii ya Ongo ku bobanenirwe (abalompfu, bo batabaanchwa, abakatsi, abachene na baeni), amirimo ya Mutima Akomire, na kandi ya lumoo na mahemo byo bihereketsa arebaho ra Mwatsi Mubuya.</para>
  <para style="is">Luka</para>
  <para style="ip">Akikiriki kya Luka kyo kirengitse kya bandi baandiki ba Inchiri. Akikiriki ikyo, kikyere kweasikya bo batechikyo na bo batechi kushe andungo ya Baisiraeli. Akitabo ikyo kyo kiumpfibwa kushe na bandu ba mwa biro bino. Ukekulikira akitabo kya Luka kushe, ni ukatimanamo aMuufutsi wa bandu boshe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Bwingiro bwa Mwatsi Mubuya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Waliha Teofile, bandu bangi baerekire iandika mwatsi wa binwa byo byatsukaa mwa kati ketu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Abakotsi abobabaa tuliho twa mikolere yoshe ya Yesu ihuluka mwa ndangiro. Iboho bobanatupfuliraa aMwatsi Mubuya wa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nani nabere namehulilitsa, niumpfa nemenya amikolere ya Yesu ihuluka mwa ndangiro ihikira tsene. Nekyo kyo kituma nikuandikira, waliha Teofile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Namekuandikira kwebula mbu umenye akuli ya binwa byoshe byo waiisibwaa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arebutwa ra Yohana Murubiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mwa kianiro Herote abaa mwami wa kyango kye Yuteya, kwabaa mulume muuma ni ye Sakariya. Ne Sakariya uyo abaa muuma wa mwa <char style="w" lemma="Mukungu wa hekalu">bakungu</char> ba hekalu ya Ongo na ba mwa kikanga kya shebakungu Abiya. Ne muka Sakariya ni ye Lisabeti, wa mwa lubuto lwa Aroni, amukungu mubere wa Baisiraeli. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Sakariya ne Lisabeti babaa batunganene mwa mbere sa Ongo. Ni baimitse kushe amateeko moshe ma Ninakuwetu nekola nga ko maneenire. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Wetuwe, ni batawete mwana, kureba Lisabeti abaa ngumba. Na babiri boshe ni bamekunguha kutsibu.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lwire luuma, Sakariya abaa ni akola mulimo wa bukungu mwa hekalu ya Ongo kubwishi lwabaa lukoro lwa kikanga kiwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Na kwa ndungo ya bukungu yabaa mwa lwire umo, Sakariya ni yatoerwa na mbayi kweingira mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char> ya Ninakuwetu na kwepfumbya abubani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 30:7-8.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Na mwa kashangi Sakariya abaa apfumbya <char style="w" lemma="Bubani">abubani</char>, amubuanano wa bandu boshe babaa ni bali hambua ni abahema Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Kwetsibya netsibula, <char style="w">malaika</char> wa Ninakuwetu amukimira. Amalaika uyo nianaimana kwa munda wa malyo wa <char style="w" lemma="butanda bwa mitulo">butanda bwa mitulo</char> bwa repfumbetsako abubani.<verse eid="LUK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sakariya abere amuxunga, nianaishalima, neubaha kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Wetuwe, <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">amalaika</char> uyo nianamubwira mbu: «Sakariya, utaubahaa kubwishi Ongo ameumpfa amahemo mawe. Mukatsi wawe Lisabeti akakubutira mwana wa butsana yo ukaluka mbu ye Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Amwana uyo akakuletera lumoo na kishaaluko, na bandu bangi bakamoera arebutwa liwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Kureba endeba mukulukulu mwa mbere sa Ninakuwetu. Atendexoma <char style="w">tifai</char> neri mandi mapfu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Muancho 6:3.</char></note>. Akinali mwa bula bwa nina, endeuchutsibwa aMutima Akomire. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Endetuma Baisiraeli bangi bafulukira Ongo Ninakuwabo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Malaki 2:6.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Endehika nga ndumwa ya Ongo. Na kandi, endeba na mutima na maala nga mutahwa Eliya. Endetuma ababuti barongana na bana babo. Na kandi, endebindula bo batenguha abinwa bya Ongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Malaki 3:23-24.</char></note>, kwebula mbu baate buteateanya nga bandu batunganene, mwa mbere sa Ongo. Kubatyo, endeba ni ameteanyira Ninakuwetu yo luanda lulingiriranyibwe kwemukokera.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Wetuwe, Sakariya nianabutsa <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">amalaika</char> uyo mbu: «Kiki kyo kinganibwerekya ku akinwa kyo wameneena ikyo, kya kuli? Tsene ku mbera mungumwa ne mwichemwani naye mukekulu.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ne malaika nianabula mbu: «Ingye, ngye Kabuliyere, ngye ninaimana mwa mbere sa Ongo. Iye yamenituma kwiwe mbu nikupfulire aMwatsi Mubuya uyu. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Abinwa ibyo byendebererera mwa kianiro kyabyo. Wetuwe ko utaimirirebyo, kunchi, ukaba mutsiru. Utikikocheneena ihikira alwire lwa binwa ibyo byendeberereramo.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mwa kashangi umo, abandu bobabaa balindirire Sakariya, bashishala kweleama liwe mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char> ya Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Abere ahulukamo, ni atangakikocha ineena nabo. Ni yerekohetsabo mwa minwe kureba ni ameba mutsiru. Kubatyo, abandu niabanakengula ku amehumananira mwa hekalu ya Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Sakariya, abere amemala abiro biwe bya mulimo wa mwa hekalu, nianafuluka ira mwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Inyuma ya biro bike, mwichemwe Lisabeti nianaheka bukule. Abandaa myetsi itano ni atahuluka. Ni yerebula mbu: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Mutangalola kwa bibuya byo Ninakuwetu amenikolera! Amenitengya mwa xoni sa buumba mwa kati ka bandu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arebutwa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-23">Mat 1:18-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Abukule bwa Lisabeti bwabere bwamehika ku myetsi ndatu, Ongo nianatuma <char style="w">malaika</char> Kabuliyere mwa mulungu we Nasareti, wa mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ku munyere muuma yalukwa mbu ye Mariya. Amunyere uyo abaa atatsamenya mulume, wetuwe ni ahangirwe na mutabana muuma mbu ye Yosefu wa mwa kipfunga kya mwami Ndauti. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Malaika uyo nianahikira Mariya, amuketsa mbu: «Bwakyere, Mariya! Umoe, kureba Ninakuwetu amekuashanira kutsibu, ali na kuuma nawe.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariya, abere ameumpfa angetsi iyo, nianaishalima neibutsa tikuno angetsi iyo ibwire ite.<figure style="fig" alt="L'ange Gabriel apparu à marie" file="DN00401b.tif" size="span" ref="1:29">Malaika Kabuliyere nianahikira Mariya</figure> <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Wetuwe, malaika nianamubwira mbu: «Mariya, utaubahaa kureba wamebonekya alukoo lwa Ongo . <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Talola, ku ukaheka bukule. Nawe ukabuta mwana wa butsana, ukamuluka mbu ye Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Uyo, endeba mukulukulu, endelukwa Muala wa Ongo Nina-mu-mbingu, ne Ninakuwetu Ongo yewene endemuha abwime bwa shekulitsa Ndauti. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Endeima abiro byoshe kwa lubuto lwa Yakobo. Na bwime buwe butendeba na ntsindiro.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariya nianabutsa <char style="w">malaika</char> mbu: «Akinwa ikyo kyendebererera kite naho ndechi mulume?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Malaika nianamuxubitsa mbu: «aMutima Akomire akakukimira, na maala ma Ongo Nina-mu-mbingu makakuxwika mu kipfutsa. Kubwishi bwekyo, amwana youkabuta, endeba ni akomire, bendemuluka mbu Muala wa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Talola ku yahara myetsi ndatu iyi ni munyakyenyu Lisabeti ahete bukule bwa mwana wa butsana, nakuba ni ahara mukekulu na kandi ngumba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kureba hataba kinwa kifundene ira mwa Ongo.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Niyo Mariya abula mbu: «Ingye ndi mucha wa Ninakuwetu, nikolerwe nga kowameneena.» Inyuma wa binwa byoshe ibyo, <char style="w">malaika</char> nianaiendera.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mariya atangula Lisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mwa biro umo, Mariya nianaya chuba mu mutsi muuma wa mwa kyango kye Yuteya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Abere ahika iyo, nianaingira mwa nyumba ya Sakariya, neketsa Lisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Lisabeti abere mbu anaumpfa angetsi ya Mariya, amwana nianashata mwa bula bwa Lisabeti. Ne Lisabeti nianauchutsibwa aMutima Akomire. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Niananeena mu mulenge mule mbu: «Ongo amekuashanira ilengya abakatsi boshe. Na mwana yo ukabuta naye ameashanirwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nani ngyende kwebula mbu nina wa Ninakuwetu anitangule? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Kubwishi shaniba nanaumpfa angetsi yawe, amwana yarali mwa bula bwani, ashata mu kishaaluko. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Uashanirwe kubwishi waimiriraa kwa mwatsi wo wapfulirwaa itoka ira mwa Ninakuwetu endebererera.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mariya nianabula mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Amwete wani asingya Ninakuwetu kutsibu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />na mutima wani amoera Ongo Muufutsi wani;<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />kureba amexunga abulompfu bwani, ngye mucha uwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Mwa kuli, ihuluka tsene, abandu boshe bendereniluka mbu naashanirwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />kureba Ongo Nina amaala moshe amenikolera binwa binene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Aretsina liwe ye Ongo Akomire.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ko biro byoshe, enderebwerekya abubuya buwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">ku bobamuubahire.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Amekola mulimo munene mwa maala ma kuboko kuwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Bobali na myete ya kingami, ameshanchabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Abami, amekunulabo kwa ndebe sabo sa bwami;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">abalompfu, amebatulabo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ayube 5:11; 12:19.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Bobabaa bakukwitse, amexokyabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">wetuwe abaxoki, amefulukyabo minwe misha.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Ametabara Isiraeri mukotsi uwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">ataibirire imubwerekya abubuya buwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />nga koahaa manihisa botatakulitsa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">Iburahimu na lubuto luwe, ku biro byoshe.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mariya nianaikala ne Lisabeti yo kianiro akishembashemba myetsi ishatu. Inyuma kwaho, nianafuluka ira mwabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arebutwa na remonibwa ra Yohana Murubiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Akashangi ka rebuta ra Lisabeti kabere kaeraho, nianabuta mwana wa butsana. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Abahuwenwe bewe na banyakyabo babere bahulikya ku Ninakuwetu amemupfira boncho bungi, niabanashaaluka kuuma naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Amwana, abere ahara na biro munane abutirwe, <char style="w" lemma="Imonia">bamumonia</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Balawi 12:3.</char></note>. Babaa abaxonda imutola aretsina ra ishe Sakariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Wetuwe, nina nianatinda. Abula mbu: «Akalukwa mbu ye Yohana.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Nabo niabanamubwira mbu: «Era! Ku mwa kipfunga kyenyu mutali mundu yanalukwa mwetsina iri?»<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Niyo babutsa ishe mwimukohetsa mwa minwe mbu: «Lihe tsina rouxonda itola amwana?» <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakariya nianahemabo kashayi, nianaandikako, mbu: «Aretsina ra mwana, ye Yohana.» Na bandu boshe bashishala. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Mu kashalimo, abunu buwe niabunabumbukala, na lulimi luwe luobokala. Nianaxubeneena nesingya Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Mulo, abahuwenwe boshe batsimbwa na buba bungi. Na mwatsi uyo nianashanchana mwa bitwa byoshe bya mwa kyango kye Yuteya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Na bandu boshe bobahulikyaa mwatsi uyo, baibutsiritsa mwa myete yabo mbu: «Mbeni amwana yamebutwa, endeba munduki?» Naki, mwa kuli, amaala ma Ninakuwetu manabaa kuuma naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sakariya asingya Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Ne Sakariya, ishe wa mwana, nianauchutsibwa aMutima Akomire. Niananeena mwikola butahwa mbu:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Ninakuwetu Ongo wa Isiraeli, asingibwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Kureba ametabara abandu bewe netongotsabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Ametuxunguxulira Muufutsi wa maala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">wa mwa kipfunga kya mwami Ndauti, mukotsi uwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ngakuno kwa neenaa ihuluka mira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:70">itsukira kwa <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> bewe bakomire mbu<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />endetutumira yakendetuufula mwa balenda betu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">Na mwa minwe sa boshe bobanatubaa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Kwapfiraa atyo botatakulitsa yo lukoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">ataibiriraa <char style="w" lemma="Ndaane">andaane</char> iwe ikomire.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Nga koalahiritsiraa Iburahimu tatakulitsa,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />mbu endetuufula mwa minwe sa balenda betu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">kwebula mbu tumukolere butsira buba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />mu bukome na mwikola byobitunganene mwa mbere siwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">Mu biro byoshe bya buingo bwetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nawe, we mwanani, wenderelukwa <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char> wa Ongo Nina-mu-mbingu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Kureba iwe wowendehika buxondotsi Ninakuwetu awiche</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">kwetunganyanya asanchira siwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:76 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Malaki 3:1.</char></note>,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Na kwepfulirao aluanda luwe ku ahika iufulalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">Mweshashiralo <char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">asantsambi</char> salo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kweimitsanya na kwe Ongo wetu anapfa boncho bungi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">akatutumira akyaka kya ira luulu mbu kitukoletse.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Kwekoletsa bobaikere mwa mutsimya na mwa nchira ya lupfu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">kwetuendya mwa nchira ya buholo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:79 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ituendya mwa nchira ya buholo ituasikya kwa bandu batsiire buholo, kwerongana. Soma Isaya 9:1; 42:7.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Amwana uyo nianauxuka nebiriita mu maala mwa mutima. Nianaikala mwa bweru ihikira alwire loaibwerekyaamo kwa luanda lwa Isiraeri.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Arebutwa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mwa kianiro umo, Kaisari Kosite amwami mukulu we Roma, nianabula mbu abandu ba mwa bihuo byoshe byateekire baye kwa fishi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">fishi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Kaisari Kosite akolesaa afishi kwebula mbu kutabaa kiro na mundu yangatindehora akoli ya Kaisari.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Afishi nchondotsi iyo yaibwaako mwa kianiro Kiriniusi abaa mukulukulu wa kyango kye Suriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Abandu boshe niabanaya kwa fishi, kintsi mundu kwa mutsi uwe wa bubutwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosefu naye nianatoka i Nasareti mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya. Nianaya i Yuteya, mwa mutsi wo mwami Ndauti abutirwaamo, walukwa mbu Betelehemu. Ayaeyo, kubwishi ni wa mwa kipfunga kya mwami Ndauti. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Mweya kwa fishi, aenda ne Mariya yabaa amehangira, naye ni mukule wa kalembelembe. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Babere bahika i Betelehemu, akashangi ka rebuta ra Mariya niakanaeraho. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Nianabuta mwana uwe mubere wa butsana. Nianamutondeka mu ngobi, abanemuonchitsa mu kitsinga, kureba bahushaa buonchiro mwe chumbi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaika apfulirao abasumba ku Yesu amebutwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Na mwa kihuo umo ho ni muli basumba. Abasumba abo ni bali mwa bihya ni abakereresa mwe kiro kwelanga abihyo byabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Mu kashalimo <char style="w">malaika</char> wa Ninakuwetu nianapfumbukira kubo, na ngulu ya Ninakuwetu niainakoletsabo kwa myunda yoshe. Niabanatsimbwa na buba bungi. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Wetuwe, malaika nianabwirabo mbu: «Mutaubahaa kubwishi nibahetere Mwatsi Mubuya wakamoya abandu boshe kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Munolwire, mwamebutirwa <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Muufutsi</char> mwa mutsi wa Ndauti, naye ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char>, Ninakuwetu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Na kano ko kalolero kokakababwerekya ku yoyo: mukashingana ancholyana ni itondekirwe mu ngobi neonchitsibwa mu kitsinga.»<figure style="fig" alt="On annonce la nouvelle de la naissance de Jesus aux bergers" file="WA03803b.tif" size="span" ref="2:12">Abasumba bapfulirwa amwatsi wa rebutwa ra Yesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Mu kashalimo, <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">amalaika</char> uyo nianaxungwa kuuma na kichiri kinene kya bandi bamalaika bo batenga mu mbingu, ni abasingya Ongo mbu:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Ongo ahabwe ngulu mu mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">na bandu baranatsiira mwa kihuo babe na buholo.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abasumba baya i Betelehemu kwetangula ancholyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Inyuma kwaho, <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">abamalaika</char> niabanasiya abasumba, bafuluka mu mbingu. Niyo abasumba babutsabutsanya mbu: «Eo! tuye Betelehemu, nge twayexunga akinwa kyokyameba iyo, kyo Ninakuwetu ametubwira.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Niabanaihuta kweyayo, batimana Mariya ne Yosefu na ncholyana yoionchitsibwe mu kitsinga. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Babere bamexunga ancholyana, baya ipfula amwatsi wo malaika abwiraabo kuluenda amwana uyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Na bandu boshe bobahulikyaa amwatsi wa basumba bapfulaa, niabanashishala kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Wetuwe, Mariya nianabika abinwa byoshe ibyo mwa mwete uwe, ni yereanikirabyo lingi.<verse eid="LUK 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Inyuma kwaho, abasumba abo niabanafuluka. Baenda niabaha Ongo yo ngulu nemusingya kwa byoshe byo bahulikyaa nelolako. Bairaa batyo kubwishi ni bameshingana abyoshe ni binali nga ko malaika abwiraabo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atolwa itsina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Yesu abere amebanda biro munane abutirwe, <char style="w" lemma="Imonia">niabanamumonia</char>. Niabanamuluka mbu ye Yesu. Neroho, renetsina <char style="w">malaika</char> amuhaa lubere Mariya akulehe.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aletwa mwa hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Inyuma kwaho, alwire lwa <char style="w" lemma="Ihotsa, ihotsibwa">rehotsibwa</char> ra Mariya ne Yosefu nialunaeraho nga ko <char style="w" lemma="Muomba">aMuomba</char> wa Musa ananeena. Niabanatwala amwana i Yerusalemu kwemubwerekya mwa mbere sa Ninakuwetu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Balawi 12:2-6.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />kureba, kiandikirwe mwa Muomba wa Ninakuwetu mbu: «Kintsi lubere lwa mwana wa butsana, lwendekomibwa mwa mbere sa Ninakuwetu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 13:2,12,15.</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Niabanaleta kandi mutulo kwa Muomba wa Ninakuwetu uyo aneenire mbu: «Mautu mabiri neri byana bibiri bya makuku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Balawi 12:8.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abutahwa bwa Simiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu mwabaa muli mulume muuma ni ye Simiyoni. Ne Simiyoni uyo ni mundu wa butunganane, ni aubahire Ongo. Abaa alindire yakendechira aluanda lwe Isiraeli lo mikocho. Abaa ni aendibwa na Mutima Akomire. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Na kandi, aMutima Akomire abaa ameotola imubwira mbu atendepfa buxondotsi axunge <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char> yakendetumwa ne Ninakuwetu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Simiyoni nianaingira mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu ya Ongo</char> ni ameendibwa na Mutima Akomire. Mwa kashangi umo, ababuti ba Yesu bamuletamo kwebereretsa kwa <char style="w" lemma="Muomba">amuomba</char> ateekire. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simiyoni nianaangirira amwana, nianatangira isingya Ongo, mbu:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Ninakuwetu, amanihisa mo wanihaa wamebereretsao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">Tsene, ngye mukotsi wawe, wanganilika niipfire mu buholo!<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kubwishi nameilolera kwa Muufutsi yowametuma.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Yowaiteanyaa mbu abe Muufutsi mwa mbere sa bandu boshe.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Amuufutsi uyo yo kyaka kyarekoletsa kwa bandu ba sindi nganda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">Na kandi, ya kendeha alubuto lwawe Isiraeri yo ngulu.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Abinwa byoshi byo Simiyoni aneenaa kuluenda Yesu bishishatsa ababuti ba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simiyoni nianaashanirabo, nianabwira Mariya, nina wa mwana, mbu: «Talola: Amwana uyu amebutwa kwetoya bandu bauma na kwebatula bandi bandu mwa Isiraeli. Endeba kalolero katengire ira mwa Ongo, wetuwe abandu bendeya buhaka kubwishi bwaye. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Kubatyo, amianikire ya bandu bangi yo ibishirwe yendebishulwa kyenene. Nawe, Mariya, wendenuba ngakuno mundu yamexootwa bupanga mwa mwete.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amutahwakatsi Ana, asima Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Habaa <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwakatsi</char> muuma ni ye Ana. Ana uyo, Abaa mwali wa Fanuere, wa mwa kipfunga kya Ashere. Ana uyo abaa mukekulu. Anaikalaa myaka irindaho ne iba. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Iba abere amepfa, nianashiba mwa buxumbakatsi mo myaka lunane nene. Abaa atatoka mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char> ya Ongo kwemukolera, kiro na mwishi, mwihema na mwiihangira ilya. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Mwa kashangi umo, naye ahika, netangira isingya Ongo. Abaa anapfula amwatsi wa Yesu kwa bandu boshe bobabaa balindirire kwe Ongo akaufula becha i Yerusalemu mwa minubo yabo.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ababuti ba Yesu baxuba i Nasareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ababuti ba Yesu babereretsa abyoshe bya <char style="w">Muomba</char> wa Ninakuwetu abaa ateekire. Kubatyo, niabanafuluka ira mwabo, mwa mulungu we Nasareti, mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Yesu nianauxuka nebiriita. Abaa muteateanya, na lukoo lwa Ongo ni luli kuuma naye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwa hekalu ya Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kintsi mwaka, ababuti ba Yesu babaa banaya i Yerusalemu mwa lwire lukulu lwa <char style="w">Pasaka</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu abere ahara na myaka ikumi nebiri, nianaya i Yerusalemu kuuma na babuti bewe mwa lwire lukulu ulo kweimitsanya na ndungo ya Bayahuti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa Bayahuti, amwana wa butsana ameba na myaka ikumi nebiri, ni ahara ali mwa luero lwa bandu bo bangaingira mwa hekalu. Soma Muubuko 6:1–8:16; Isaya 11:1-2; Miani 20:11.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Abiro bya Pasaka byabere byametsuka, ababuti ba Yesu niabanafuluka kwa wabo. Wetuwe, amwana Yesu, iye, nianasiala i Yerusalemu. Na babuti bewe batakengula ku amesiala. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Nabo bereanikira mbu ali kwa muoba. Babere bamekola luendo lwa mubitsi, niabanatangira imuxondera mwa banyakyabo na mu bobechene nabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Wetuwe, bamuhusha. Kubatyo, niabanaxubula i Yerusalemu ni abamuxonda.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Inyuma ya biro bishatu, bamutimana mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char> ya Ongo ni aikere mwa kati ka beisa ba Muomba, ni ahulikyabo nebutsabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Aboshe bobabaa abamuhulikya niabashishala kutsibu kubwishi bwa bwenge buwe na mixubitse iwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ababuti babere bamuxunga, niabanashishala kutsibu. Niyo nina amubwira mbu: «We mwana wani iwe! Kubwishi bwaki wangatukolera iki? Talola kwingye ne ixo twamekuxonda mu mushiki mungi!» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Naye nianabula mbu: «Amunixonderaki? Mbeni mutechi ku nishushire iba mwa nyumba ya Tata?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Wetuwe, abinwa byabaa abwirabo, batamenyabyo.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Niyo Yesu afuluka kuuma nabo i Nasareti. Naye abaa anakola abyoshe bya babuti bewe babaa banamubwira. Abinwa byoshe ibyo, nina nianabikabyo mwa mwete uwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu nianauxuka nebiriita mu buteateanya, nemoya Ongo na bandu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Murubiki atangira amulimo uwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mwa mango Kaisari Tibere, mwami mukulu we Roma, abaa amemala myaka ikumi netano kwa bwime, abaa anakola kuuma ne Pondiyo Pilato, mukulukulu wa kyango kye Yuteya, ne Herote Andipasi, mukulukulu wa kyango kye Ngalilaya. Ne Firipo, mualabo, ni ye mukulukulu wa kyango kye Iturea na kye Tarakoniti. Ne Lisania naye ni ye mukulukulu wa kyango kye Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ne Anasi ne Kayafa, ni <char style="w" lemma="shebakungu">boshebakungu</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:2">Na mwa biromo, akinwa kya Ongo kihikira Yohana, muala wa Sakariya, mwa mango abaa ali mwa bweru. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohana Murubiki uyo nianatsuka mwa kyango kyoshe kya kwa musike we Yorotani, ni ahubiri abandu mbu bahingye amiberere yabo, barubikwe ne Ongo akashashirabo asantsambi sabo. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kubatyo, niabinabererera abinwa bya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char> Isaya aandikaa mwa kitabo kiwe mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Mundu muuma yaneena mu mulenge mule mwa bweru mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‹ Mutunganyanye anchira ya Ninakuwetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Mulingiriranye anchira yakatsukamo!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kubatyo kintsi mueri akauchutsibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Na kintsi kitwa na kintsi katwa bikabinduka malambo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Na sanchira sa bionye seirwa sa butalu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">na sosirimo bikuka, sikalambamibwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na bandu boshe bexunga kwe Ongo atuufula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 40:3-5.</char></note>!›»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Bandu bangi bahikira Yohana mbu arubikebo. Wetuwe, Yohana ni yerebwirabo mbu: «Imwe muli nga bwoko bwa nchoka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bwoko bwa nchoka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano, Yohana abula mbu abandu abo bakalange.</char></note>! Inde yababwiraa mbu mukenge abutsibuke bwa Ongo bobuwicha? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Munerebwerekya mwa mikolere yenyu ku <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">mwamehingya amiberere</char> kwetenga mwa ntsambi senyu. Mutereihalilitsa mbu: ‹Iburahimu ye tatakulitsa wetu!› Anibabwira ku Ongo angakocha ihingya amabale aya, neirao bana ba Iburahimu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ambasha yameotolwa ihirwa mwa bisina bya miti kwekondayo. Kintsi muti watahetako bipfuma bikwirire akakondwa nelekerwa mwa muchanwa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Niyo amubuanano wa bandu abo bamubutsa mbu «Tukolekino?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ngye wa Yohana, mbu: «Yawete myambalo ibiri ahe yatawete yo muuma. Na yawete ku bilyo, naye akolatyo.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Abafutishi ba koli nabo bahikira Yohana mbu arubikebo. Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Mwiyisa, netwe tuireki?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Naye axubitsabo mbu: «Muterelengya komuteekirwe ifutisha.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Abasura nabo bamubutsa mbu: «Netwe tuireki?» Yohana axubitsabo mbu: «Muterenyaa mundu faranga siwe neri imuhambika kinwa. Wetuwe ni mwamoera aluhembo lwenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Abandu babaa balindirire arehika ra <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char>. Aboshe bereanikira mbu kuti Yohana angaba ni ye Kirisitu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Kubatyo, Yohana nianabwira aboshe mbu: «Ingye anibarubika mu mechi. Wetuwe, yahika ira nyuma kwingye, anilengitse maala. Nitalirene iminula amiriki ya kwa bilyato biwe. Iye yakabarubika mu Mutima Akomire na mu muchanwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Awete kwa lweri mwa minwe siwe kweulula abifufu mwa ngano. Angano iyo, akatumayo nebikayo mwa kitunda kiwe. Wetuwe, abifufu ibyo, endeshityabyo mu muchanwa watatsima.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yohana abaa ni apfula aMwatsi Mubuya kwa bandu nehabo mandi mahano mangi.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herote akabula Yohana mwa muliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Mukulukulu Herote abaa ametsimba Herotiya, muka muala wabo, kwemuira mukatsi uwe. Na kandi, abaa anakola bindi bibi bingi. Kubwishi bwa byoshe ibyo, Yohana nianamukemera. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Nekyo, kituma Herote aongerera bundi bubi kwa bubi buwe, bwarehira Yohana mwa nyumba ya muliki.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Burubike bwa Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Abandu boshe abo babere bamerubikwa, Yesu naye nianarubikwa. Abere ali yahema Ongo, ambingu niainakingukala, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Mutima Akomire nianamukimira ngakuno ikuku. Na mulenge nianaumpfibwa itoka mu mbingu mbu: «Iwe, we Muala wani mutsiyirwa, iwe wounanimoya kutsibu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 2:7.</char></note>.»<figure style="fig" alt="Le baptême de Jésus" file="WA03810b.tif" size="span" ref="3:22">Arerubikwa ra Yesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alubuto lwa Yesu Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu abaa na myaka aishembashemba makumi ashatu abere ali yatangira amulimo uwe. Abandu ni abaanikira mbu anaba muala wa Yosefu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:23">Ne Yosefu abaa muala wa Heli.<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Ne Heli abaa muala wa Matati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">Ne Matati abaa muala wa Lawi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">ne Lawi abaa muala wa Meliki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">ne Meliki abaa muala wa Yana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:24">ne Yana abaa muala wa Yosefu.<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Ne Yosefu abaa muala wa Matatiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">ne Matatiya abaa muala wa Amosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">ne Amosi abaa muala wa Nahumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">ne Nahumu abaa muala wa Esili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:25">ne Esili abaa muala wa Nange.<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Ne Nange muala wa Mati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">ne Mati abaa muala wa Matatiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">ne Matatiya abaa muala wa Simei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">ne Simei abaa muala wa Yoseki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:26">ne Yoseki abaa muala wa Yota.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Ne Yota abaa muala wa Yohanani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">ne Yohanani abaa muala wa Resa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">ne Resa abaa muala wa Serubabeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">ne Serubabeli abaa muala wa Sheritiyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:27">ne Sheritiyere abaa muala wa Neri, ne Neri abaa<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />muala wa Meliki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">ne Meliki abaa muala wa Ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">ne Ati abaa muala wa Kosamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">ne Kosamu abaa muala wa Elimatamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:28">ne Elimatamu abaa muala wa Eri.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ne Eri abaa muala wa Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">ne Yesu abaa muala wa Eliyasari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">ne Eliyasari abaa muala wa Yorimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">ne Yorimu abaa muala wa Matati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:29">ne Matati abaa muala wa Lawi.<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Ne Lawi abaa muala wa Simiyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">ne Simiyoni abaa muala wa Yuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">ne Yuta abaa muala wa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">ne Yosefu abaa muala wa Yonamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:30">ne Yonamu abaa muala wa Eliyakimu.<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Ne Eliyakimu abaa muala wa Meleya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">ne Meleya abaa muala wa Mena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">ne Mena abaa muala wa Matata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">ne Matata abaa muala wa Natani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:31">ne Natani abaa muala wa Ndauti.<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Ne Ndauti abaa muala wa Yese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">ne Yese abaa muala wa Obeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">ne Obeti abaa muala wa Buasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">ne Buasi ni muala wa Salimoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:32">ne Salimoni abaa muala wa Naxoni.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Ne Naxoni abaa muala wa Aminatabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">ne Aminatabu abaa muala wa Atimini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">ne Atimini abaa muala wa Arani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">ne Arani abaa muala wa Hesironi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">ne Hesironi abaa muala wa Peresi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:33">ne Peresi abaa muala wa Yuta.<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Ne Yuta abaa muala wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">ne Yakobo abaa muala wa Isake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">ne Isake, abaa muala wa Iburahimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">ne Iburahimu abaa muala wa Tera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:34">ne Tera abaa muala wa Nahori.<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Ne Nahori abaa muala wa Sherungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">ne Sherungu abaa muala wa Reu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">ne Reu abaa muala wa Peleki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">ne Peleki abaa muala wa Eberi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:35">ne Eberi abaa muala wa Sela, ne Sela abaa<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />muala wa Kainana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">ne Kainana abaa muala wa Aripakisati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">ne Aripakisati abaa muala wa Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">ne Shemu abaa muala wa Noa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:36">ne Noa abaa muala wa Lameke.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Ne Lameke abaa muala wa Metusela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">ne Metusela abaa muala wa Enoke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">ne Enoke abaa muala wa Yareti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">ne Yareti abaa muala wa Malaleli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:37">ne Malaleli abaa muala wa Kainana.<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Ne Kainana abaa muala wa Inosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">ne Inosi abaa muala wa Seti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">ne Seti abaa muala wa Atamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:38">ne Atamu abumbwaa ne Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahima amyereko ya Shitani mwa bweru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu nianatenga mwa lwichi lwe Yorotani ni auchwire aMutima Akomire. aMutima Akomire uyo nianatwala Yesu mwa bweru. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Neyo, Shitani nianamuereka mu biro makumi ane. Na mwa biro makumi ane umo, Yesu ni aihangira ilya. Abiro ibyo byabere byametsuka, nianakukutsa.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Mulo, Shitani nianamubwira mbu: «Uli wena Muala wa Ongo, kalihya arebale iri mbu linduke mukati!» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Kiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire mbu: ‹Amundu atangabaho kubwishi bwa mukati ho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Muubuko 8:3.</char></note>.›»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Inyuma kwaho, Shitani nianamutwala handu hakangamire kutsibu. Mu kashalimo, nianamubwerekya amami moshe ma kwa kihuo. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Nianamubwira mbu: «Nikakuha amaala moshe aya na buxoki bwoshe bwa mami aya. Kureba naherwe amoshe ayo, nani ningahao yonishashire. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Kunchi, ukepfukama mwa mbere sani kweniimanikira, abyoshe ibyo ni bikaba byawe.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu naye nianaxubya mbu: «Kiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire mbu: ‹Unereimanikira Ninakuwenyu Ongo nemukolera yenaweneho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Muubuko 6:13-14.</char></note>.›»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Shitani nianatwala Yesu mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu. Nianamutereka hambashiro wa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu">hekalu</char>, nemubwira mbu: «Uli wena Muala wa Ongo, uixumbitse hashi kwetenga hano, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />kureba kiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‹Ongo akakalihya <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">abamalaika</char> bewe mbu bakulange!<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Bekuheke mwa minwe sabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">kwebula mbu akishando kyawe kitatsitalaa ku ibale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 91:11-12.</char></note>.›»<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu nianamuxubyitsa mbu: «Kiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire mbu: ‹Utereereka Ninakuwenyu Ongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Muubuko 6:16.</char></note>.›»<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Shitani abere ameereka Yesu mwa nchira soshe ito, nianamusiya kasa, ihikira mu lundi lwire.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atangira amulimo uwe i Ngalilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu nianafuluka mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya ni aendibwa na maala ma Mutima Akomire. Na myatsi iwe iya ngulu mwa kyango kyoshe ikyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Abaa anaiyisa abandu mwa <char style="w">masinakoki</char> mabo. Abandu boshe ni banamusingya.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Becha i Nasareti abatinda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-56">Mat 13:53-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Lwire luuma, Yesu nianaya mwa mulungu we Nasareti wauxukiraamo. Na lwire lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char> lwabere lwaeraho, nianaingira mwa <char style="w">sinakoki</char> nga kwatula aira. Nianabatuka kwesoma aMaandiko Makomire. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Niabanamuha amubungo wa kitabo kya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char> Isaya. Abere abungulakyo, nianabonekya ho haandikirwe mbu:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«aMutima wa Ninakuwetu ali kuuma nani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Kubwishi Ongo anihakaa mapfuta kwepfulira abachene aMwatsi Mubuya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Amenituma kwepfulirao bo baminirwe ku bakaminulwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Na kwa bihumahumi arexubelola.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Na bo banubibwa, ihirabo mu luliko.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Kwepfulirao abandu ku amwaka we Ninakuwetu wakabwerekyabomo abubuya buwe, amehika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 61:1-2.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianabunga amubungo wa kitabo ikyo, nianafulukitsao amukotsi wa mwa <char style="w">sinakoki</char>, aba neikala. Abandu boshe bobabaa mwa sinakoki umo bamusita amesha. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ni yabwirabo mbu: «aMaandiko Makomire aya mo mwameumpfa niri anibasomerao, mamebererera munolwire.»<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Abandu boshe bamoera Yesu, baba neshishalira abinwa bya lukoo byabaa ereneena. Berebula mbu: «Era! Mbeni ate muala wa Yosefu uyu!»<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Nichi kwamuxonda initea kinwa mwa mushinga wabula mbu: ‹Mushake, uilamye wenawene!› Yo mukanibwira kandi mbu: ‹Twameumpfa abyoshe byowamekola i Kaperenaumu. Kunchi, ukolebyo na mwa mulungu wenyu muno.›»<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Yesu nianaxubebula mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku hate kiro <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char> yanakokerwa kushe kwa wabo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Anibabwira mwa kuli ku mwa kihuo kye Isiraeli mwabaa baxumbakatsi bangi mwa kianiro kya mutahwa Eliya. Mwa kianiro umo, Ongo atawisaa mpfula mu myaka ishatu na myetsi ndatu, kuba nchala ntsibu kwa kihuo kyoshe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 1Bami 17:1-7.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ongo atatumaa Eliya kweasikya kiro na muxumbakatsi muuma mubo. Wetuwe, anamutumaa ku muxumbakatsi muuma ho wa mwa mulungu we Sereputa, mwa kihuo kye Sitona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 1Bami 17:8-16.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />«Na kandi, mwa kihuo kye Isiraeli, mwabaa babentsi bangi mwa kianiro kya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char> Elisha. Wetuwe, hatali kiro na muuma mubo yakomibwaa ali ate Naamani ho, mwicha mwa kihuo kye Suriya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 2Bami 5:1-14.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Abandu boshe bobabaa mwa <char style="w">sinakoki</char> iyo, babere bahulikya abinwa ibyo, niabanatsibuka kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Niabanabatuka, niabanahentsa Yesu mwa mulungu, bamukurira hambashiro wa katwa ka mutsi wabo abaa ahimbirweko. Babaa niabaxonda imuhumira mwa ngubula. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianashenchera mwa kati kabo, aiyendera.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahentsa abixwatsi mwa mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mat 7:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianakimira mwa mulungu we Kaperenaumu, mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya. Alwire lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char> lwabere lwahika nianaiyisa abandu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Abandu bashishalira ameyiso mewe mo kutsibu kubwishi abinwa biwe ni biwete maala.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mwa <char style="w">sinakoki</char> umo, mwabaa mundu aundirwe na kixwatsi. Amundu uyo nianatangira iilakira kutsibu mbu: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Ee, Yesu we Nasareti! Autuxondakoki? Mbeni uhikire kwetuhwerekeretsa? Nikwichi kushe. Iwe wo Ukomire wa Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu nianakemera akixwatsi ikyo kutsibu mbu: «Tsira, ube netenga mwa mundu uyu!» Akixwatsi ikyo kikuba amundu uyo hashi mwa kati ka bandu. Niakinamutokamo, butsira imubabatsa.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Abandu boshe niabanashishala kutsibu nebutsabutsanya mbu: «Binwaki bino? Amundu uyu ahentsa abixwatsi mu maala na mu nyiki, na mwa kashangi umo ni byabanehuluka mwa mundu!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Na kwikyo, angulu mbuya ya Yesu niainashanchana mwa kyango kyoshe ikyo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya bakoni bangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu nianahuluka mwa <char style="w">sinakoki</char> umo, nianaya mwa nyumba ya Simoni. Abere mbu ahika umo nianashingana netsala wa Simoni ni alwere shishira ntsibu. Niabanahema Yesu mbu amulamye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu nianaindamirira kwa munda wa mukoni abaa aliko, nianakemera ashishira iyo, niainamutokamo. Na mwa kashangi umoho, amukatsi uyo nianabatuka, aba netangira imutekulira bilyo.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Aretsuba rabere rapfunika, baletera Yesu abakoni boshe bobabaa bali na makoni ma lwawelwawe. Yesu ni yeretereka aminwe iwe ku kintsi muuma mubo, nianalamyabo. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Abixwatsi byerehulukanga mu bandu bangi, ni abiyilakira mbu: «Iwe we Muala wa Ongo!» Wetuwe, Yesu nianakemerabyo kutsibu, atahabyo na kashangi keneena, kubwishi nibichi ku ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfula aMwatsi Mubuya mwa kyango kye Yutea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mar 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Bwabere bwakya, Yesu nianatenga mwa mulungu we Kaperenaumu nianaya handu ho hatali bandu. Abichiri bya bandu bangi niabanaya imuxonda. Babere bamemuxunga, baxonda ko bangamuleamya kwebula mbu atakisiyaabo kandi.<verse eid="LUK 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Nishushire ipfula aMwatsi Mubuya wa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char> mu indi milungu namo. Kubwishi, ikyo kyo kyatumaa Ongo anituma.»<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Yesu abaa muhanga wepfula aMwatsi Mubuya mwa <char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">masinakoki</char> ma mwa kyango kye Yuteya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alondola abemitsa bewe baxondotsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Lwire luuma, Yesu abaa aimene kwa musike wa ngetsi ye Ngenesareti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ngetsi ye Ngenesareti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">inalukwa kandi ngetsi ye Ngalilaya.</char></note>. Na bandu bangi bamutsungulako na imupfundeeresta kwexonda ihulikya akinwa kya Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Nianaxunga ku mato mabiri kwa musike wa ngetsi, abahyana ni bametenga muo kweyaxua amakira mabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Nianaurukira mu bwato buuma ku mo mabaa aho. Abwato ubo bwabaa bwa Simoni. Nianabwira Simoni mbu asheetsebo mwa ngetsi, hale hake na musike. Nianaikala mwa bwato ubo, atangira iyisa amubuanano wa bandu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Yesu abere amechikitsa iyisa abandu, nianabwira Simoni mbu: «Sheetsa abwato mwa mundubi, muume amakira menyu mwa mechi nge mwahyana fi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Oho, Mwiyisa! Twamehyana akiro kyoshe, wetuwe tutaitire kiro na kati! Kubwishi bwa kinwa kyawe, naxubeumamo amakira.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Naho, niabanaumamo amakira mabo, baba neita kikanda kinene kya fi. Na makira mabo matangira ihutukanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Kubwishi bwekyo, niabanasimira balikyabo bobabaa mwa bundi bwato mbu bahike baasikyebo. Balikyabo babere bahika, bauchutsa amato mabiri mo fi, nao mahika mu kashangi kexonda itsika.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petero abere axunga ikyo, nianapfukama mwa mbere sa Yesu. Abula mbu: «Ninakuwetu, ipfunde hale nani, kureba niri mundu wa ntsambi!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Byabaa bityo kubwishi Simoni na balikyabo boshe ni bameshishalira abungi bwa safi sobabaa bameita.<verse eid="LUK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Na baala ba Sebetayo, Yakobo ne Yohana, babaa banahyana kuuma ne Simoni. Nabo niabanashishala. Wetuwe, Yesu nianabwira Simoni mbu: «Utaubahaa! Ihuluka tsene, ukaba muhyana wa bandu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Inyuma kwaho, baxubesiika amato kwa musike wa ngetsi. Niabanasiya abyoshe nekulikira Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mubentsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Lwire luuma, Yesu abaa ali mu mulungu muuma wa mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya. Niakunapfumbuka mundu muuma auchwire bibentsi kwa mubiri woshe. Amubentsi uyo, abere axunga ku Yesu, nianapfukama mwa mbere siwe, ahikya abusu hashi. Nianaitondoola kwiye, mbu: «Ninakuwetu, uli ushashire, ungakocha inikomya.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu nianalambula aminwe, nianamupfulako, abula mbu: «Nishashire, komibwa!» Na mwa kashangi umoho abibentsi ibyo niabinakomibwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu nianamuteeka mbu: «Utalindaa wapfulirao mundu woshewoshe. Wetuwe, enda, youibwerekye kasa kwa <char style="w" lemma="Mukungu wa hekalu">mukungu wa hekalu</char> ya Ongo. Kandi, ubeneleta mutulo nga ko Musa ateekaa, kwebwerekyabo ku wamekomibwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amundu akelamibwa bibentsi, abaa anaya iibwerekya kwa bakungu kwamelama. Abaa anairatyo kwebula mbu aikiritsibwe kweikala kuuma na bandi bandu. Soma Balawi 13:45, 46; 14:1-32. </char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Wetuwe, angulu ya Yesu niainashanchabana kutsibu mwa bandu. Na mibuanano mingi ya bandu yerebuanana kwemuhulikya na kwelamibwa amakoni mabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Wetuwe, Yesu abaa anaya handu hangaba yewene, kwehema Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mukoni wa makonongola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lwire luuma, Yesu abaa aiisa abandu. <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">aBafarisayo</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">beisa ba Muomba</char> bauma babaa baikere aho. Aboshe abobabaa beretenga mwa mitsi yoshe ya kyango kye Ngalilaya na kye Yuteya na mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu. Yesu abaa erelamya amakoni mwa maala ma Ninakuwetu Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Kuhika bandu bauma ni bahete mundu wa makonongola ku mundara. Niabanaxonda ko bangamwingitsa mwa nyumba nemutereka mwa mbere sa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Wetuwe, bahusha ho bangamwingitsira kubwishi bwa bungi bwa bandu. Kubwishi bwekyo, niabanauruka kwa muutu wa nyumba iyo. Niabanatengya kwa matebura<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayahuti bauma babaa banahimba batya: ni banalambika miti iraluulu wa nyumba ngakuno kishesha, noko ni kwe batondeka amatebura nga bishakalo. Na kwa nyumba ni kunaba muurukiro. </char></note>, babanemukimitsa mwa kati ka bandu mwa mbere sa Yesu, ni anali kwa mundara uwe.<figure style="fig" alt="les amis du paralytique le fait descendre devant Jésus" file="WA03824b.tif" size="span" ref="5:19">Abera ba mukoni wa makonongola bamukimya mwa mbere sa Yesu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu abere axunga abwimire bwa bandu abo, nianabwira amundu wa makonongola uyo mbu: «Mwira wani, <char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">asantsambi</char> sawe sameshashirwa!» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" /><char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">Abeisa ba Muomba</char> na <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> batangira iibutsiritsa mbu: «Munduki uyu, yakamba Ongo? Hate mundu yangashashira asantsambi, ali ate Ongo yewene!»<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Kubwishi Yesu abaa echi amianikire yabo, nianabutsabo mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amuanikira mutyo mwa myete yenyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Kihe kyekyolo kwebwira mundu mbu: ‹<char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">Asantsambi</char> sawe sameshashirwa›, neri imubwira mbu: ‹Batuka, ube neenda?›»<verse eid="LUK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />«Tsene, anixonda mbu mumenye kwingye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>, niwete maala meshashira <char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">asantsambi</char> kwa kihuo kuno.» Niyo Yesu abwira amundu wa makonongola mbu: «Anikubwira mbu, batuka, tsimba mundara wawe ube nefuluka hamwawe.» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Na mwa kashangi umo amundu uyo, nianabatuka mwa mbere sa bandu boshe. Nianatsimba amundara wabaa aonchireko, afuluka hamwe niasingya Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Abandu boshe bashishala kutsibu babanetsimbwa na buba. Basingya Ongo mbu: «Munolwire twamexunga ku bishishalo!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abwira Lawi mbu amukulikire</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianahuluka mwa nyumba umo. Nianaxunga mufutishi muuma wa koli mbu ye Lawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lawi neri Matayo. Soma Matayo 9:9. </char></note>. Lawi uyo, abaa aikere hanafutishira akoli. Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Unikulikire!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lawi nianabatuka, nianasia abyoshe, abanekulikira Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Inyuma kwaho, Lawi nianakolera Yesu yo linye linene mwa nyumba iwe. Mwa nyumba umo, mwabaa bafutishi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa mira, aBayahuti babaa banatsimba abahoresi ba koli tikuno bahoti, kubwishi babaa banahoresa akoli kwa Bayahuti banyakyabo kwehayo aBaroma bo babaa bateekire akihuo kyabo. </char></note> bangi ba koli hauma na bandi bandu bobabaa abalya kuuma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">aBafarisayo</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">beyisa</char> babo ba Muomba babere baxunga batyo, batangira ibutsabutsanya nebwira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> ba Yesu mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amulya nexoma kuuma na bafutishi ba koli na bakotsi ba santsambi?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Abakambwe batalaa ku mushake, wetuwe, abakoni bobanamulaako. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nitawichaa ibirangira bobatunganene mwa mbere sa Ongo. Wetuwe abakotsi ba santsambi kwebula mbu <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">bahingye amiberere</char> yabo.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimola kuluenda amahemo na areihangira ilya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-15">Mat 9:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-20">Mar 2:18-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">aBafarisayo</char> abo niabanabwira Yesu mbu: «<char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">Abemitsa</char> ba Yohana na betu banaihangira ilya ngendo nyingi, bali abahema. Wetuwe abemitsa bawe, ibo, abalya nexoma.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mbeni amuanikira mbu mwangahangira ilya bobalalikirwe mwa buheruki mwa mango nina abuheruki akinali hauma nabo? Ihi! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Wetuwe kwendehika biro, nina abuheruki endetengibwa mwa kati kabo. Kubatyo, mo biromo mo bakendeihangira ilya bali abahema.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu nianaxubechirabo amushinga uyu, mbu: «Hatali mundu yangacha kiraka ku lukimba luhya kwelandirakyo ku lukimba lukulire. Yangakolatyo angaba ni ameberenga alukimba luhya, na kiraka kyosakitokako ni kitikitsimbane na lukimba lukulire. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Na kandi, hate mundu yangahira <char style="w">tifai</char> nyihya mu shaho ya luhu lukulire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">shaho ya luhu lukulire: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabaa shaho sikolirwe mu nyuhu sa mbene. aBayahuti babaa banahoera atifai mu shaho nyihya sikolirwe mu nyuhu. Kureba ni sitangabereka mwa kashangi atifai aitaka. Ni banaira batyo kubwishi asashaho siri sikulire, ni nyolonyolo, ni singabereka chuba </char></note>. Amundu akeiratyo, ni akatuma tifai nyihya iberenga asashaho ito, atifai ni yapfa busha na sa shaho ni sabiha. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Wetuwe, atifai nyihya inahirwa mu shaho nyihya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Hate na mundu yameotola ixoma ku tifai ya kwa mira yanatsiyira tifai nyihya. Kubwishi ni abula mbu: ‹Atifai ya kwa mira yoilokire kutsibu.›»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ye nina aSabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Lwire luuma lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>, Yesu abaa atsuka mu maxwa ma ngano. <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">Abemitsa</char> bewe batangira ihulula bikumba bya ngano, bapfungapfungabyo mwa minwe sabo, babanelya asambeke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa kihuo kye Isiraeli, amundu anairaa aketsuka mwixwa ali apfire nchala, abaa anapfuna kwa myaka yoieriremo nelya kuyo. Areira batyo, bwabaa bute bwitsi. Soma Muubuko 23:26.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />
    <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> bauma babutsabo mbu: «Esi! Kubwishi bwaki amukola kyokitalirene ikolwa mu lwire lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>?»<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Mbeni Mutatsamwasoma kyo mwami Ndauti akolaa mwa mango, iye na bandu babaa ali nabo ni bakukwitse? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Mbeni ataingiraa mwa nyumba ya Ongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Nyumba ya Ongo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa kianiro kya mwami Ndauti, ahekalu yabaa itatsayahimbwa mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu.</char></note>, nianatsimba mikati ya bandu babaa bametula Ongo. Mbeni atalyaayo, neha babaa ali kuuma nabo? Naho aMuomba wetu ni abwire kwa <char style="w" lemma="bakungu ba hekalu">bakungu ba hekalu</char> bonabeneho ni bobanalirene ilya ku mikati iri ngeyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 1Samwere 21:2-7; Balawi 24:9. </char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu nianabwirabo kandi mbu: «Ingye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>, ngye Nina <char style="w" lemma="Sabato">aSabato</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mundu wa makonongola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Lundi lwire lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>, Yesu nianaingira mwa <char style="w">sinakoki</char>, nianaiyisa abandu. Nomo mwabaa mulume muuma wa makonongola mwa minwe ya malyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" /><char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">Abeyisa ba Muomba</char> na <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> babaa bamuteire amesha, kwelola tikuno akalamya amulume uyo mu lwire lwa Sabato. Baira batyo kwebula mbu baate kinwa kyokyangatuma bamusongera. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Wetuwe Yesu ni echi amianikire yabo. Nianabwira amulume wa makonongola mwa minwe mbu: «Batuka, imana hakatikati ka bandu.» Amulume uyo, nianabatuka neimana hakatikati ka bandu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Tsene, Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Anibabutsa, kihe kya Muomba wetu abwire mbu kilirene ikolwa mwa lwire lwa Sabato? Mbeni ikola bibuya neri ikola bibi? Ilamya mundu neri imwita?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesu nianasindera aboshi, nianabwira amundu uyo mbu: «Lambula aminwe yawe.» Nianalambula aminwe iwe, iba nelama. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Wetuwe abeyisa ba Muombabo na Bafarisayo niabanatsibuka kutsibu. Niabanatangira ibutsabutsanya kobangaira Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondola ndumwa ikumi ne biri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mo biromo, Yesu nianauruka kwa kitwa kweya ihema Ongo. Bukya ni ahema. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Bwabere bwamekya, Yesu nianabirangira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe, alondola mubo mo ikumi na babiri, alukabo mbu <char style="w">ndumwa</char>: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni yo Yesu atolaa aretsina mbu ye Petero, ne Andereya mualabo, Yakobo, ne Yohana, ne Firipo, ne Baritolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />ne Matayo, ne Tomasi, ne Yakobo muala wa Alufayo, ne Simoni wa mwa kikanga kya baselote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abaselote: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">babaa kikanga kya Baisiraeli, kyo kyabaa kinalwa kwetengya akihuo kyabo mwa bupfubulwa bwa Baroma.</char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />ne Yuta muala wa Yakobo, ne Yuta Isikariyote yahotaa Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aiisa abandu ne lamya abakoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu nianakima ampfuli kuuma na bemitsa bewe. Abere ahika mwa kibotebote, nianaimana. Ashinganamo mubuanano munene wa <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe, na mubuanano munene kutsibu wa bandu abatoka mwa kyango kye Yuteya na mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu, na kwa munda wa milungu ye Tiro, ne Sitona, kwa musike wa ngetsi. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Abandu abo bahikaa kweumpfiritsa Yesu na kwelamibwa amakoni mabo. Na bobabaa baundirwe na bixwatsi, nabo, Yesu nianalamyabo. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Abandu boshe babaa ni abaxonda ipfula ku Yesu, kubwishi mwiye ni amutoka maala, nao ni amalamya aboshe.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngashani na lutuki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu nianasindera <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe, abwirabo mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Muashanirwe mwe bachene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">kureba <char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">abwami bwa Ongo</char> bwenyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Muashanirwe imwe momupfire nchala tsene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kureba mwendeuutyibwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Muashanirwe, imwe momulira tsene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kureba mwendesheka.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Muashanirwe, imwe, mwa mango abandu abababaa neicha kwimwe, nebakamba, nebatera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">kubwishi bwa <char style="w" lemma="Muala wa Mundu">Muala wa Mundu</char>.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Mwa mango abinwa ibyo byenderebahikira, muneremoa neshaaluka, kureba Ongo ababikirire luhembo lunene mu mbingu. Batyo ko aboshekulitsa babaa bananubya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">abatahwa</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 2Bianiro 36:16; Mikolere 7:52.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Wetuwe mulyae mwe baxoki, kureba mwaotwere chirwa mikocho yenyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mulyae mwe muuutire tsene, kureba mwendekukutsa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Mulyae mwe musheka tsene, kureba mwendeba mu kiriro netoya mixonya.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Mulyae imwe, mwa kashangi abandu boshe ababahalilitsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">kureba batyo kwa Boshekulitsa babobabaa banahalilitsa abatahwa babesi.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muneretsiira abalenda benyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Yesu nianaxuba ibula mbu: «Wetuwe, momunihulikya anibabwira mbu: ‹Muneretsiyira abalenda benyu, ni mwa kolera bibuya bobababaire. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Bobabatukanga, munerehema Ongo aashanirebo. Na bobabanubya munerehemerabo Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Amundu akekubanda luhyu kwe tema, ni wamubindulira alindi tema. Na mundu akekunyaa arekoti rawe, ni wamulika aheke na shimishi. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Mundu woshewoshe yakuhema kindu, ni wamuhakyo. Na yakunyaa abindu byawe, ni utibule mbu akufulukitsebyo.›» <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Kyomuxonda mbu abandi bandu babakolere, nemwe ni kyomwakolerabo.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />«Mukeneretsiyiraho bobabatsiyire, ni muwete simeki? Ni hatali. Banabe na bakotsi ba santsambi banatsiyira bobatsiyirebo. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ni mungaba mukerekolera kibuya bobabakolera bibuya, ni muli na simeki? Ni hatali. Na bakotsi ba santsambi banakolerana batyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Kandi, mukeneresombyaho bomwichi ku bangabapfuha, ni muli na simeki? Na bakotsi ba santsambi banerekunesombyanya ni bainihire ipfuhwa biwabo.<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />«Wetuwe, imwe, muneretsiyira abalenda benyu, nekolerabo bibuya. Ni mweresombyabo, butsira iba neene repfuhwa. Batyo, mwendehabwa luhembo lunene, mwendeba bana ba Ongo Nina-mu-mbingu. Kureba, iye, anakolera bibuya bobatasima na bakotsi ba bibi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Munerepfirana boncho ngakuno ko ixo wenyu anabapfirabo.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ni mutiereayira abandi bandu yo busha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Yesu nianaxubebula mbu: « Muterechira abandi bandu bo lubancha, nemwe ni yomuterechirwalo. Ni muterepfumaula abandi bandu, nemwe ni yomutenderepfumaulwa. Mutereanchira balikyenyu abibi, nemwe ni yomutendereanchirwabyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Munerehana, nemwe ni yomukenderehabwa. Na kyomukenderehabwa kyokyendelengwa kushe, netsindairwa, nehirianyibwa neuchutsa asashaho senyu neshesheka. Komunerelengera abandi bandu, nemwe komwenderelengerwa.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu ninaxubechirabo aundi mushinga uyu mbu: «Mbeni, akihumahumi kyangakocha iendya kindi kihumahumi? Kikekola kityo, abibiri ni bikatoera mu kiribu. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Amwiya atangalengya amwiyisa uwe. Wetuwe kintsi mwiya yashaotola iiyisibwa kushe, ni endeba ngakuno amwiyisa uwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />«Kubwishi bwaki aulola kwa kati kokali mwa lisha ra munyakyenyu, wetuwe, ni utalaire kwa ngingi ya muti yoiri mwa lisha rawe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Wangakocha ute ute ibwira munyakyenyu mbu: ‹Munyakyetu, nilike nitengye akati kokali mwa lisha rawe›, naho ni utalaire kwa ngingi ya muti yoiri mwa lisha rawe? Shetulimi tubiri iwe! Tengya kasa angingi ya muti yoiri mwa lisha rawe, ni yowangakocha ilola kushe, netengya akati kokali mwa lisha ra munyakyenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kintsi muti aneremenyerwa kwa bipfuma byao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Hatali muti mubuya wangakocha ihetako bipfuma bibi, neri muti mubi wangakocha ihetako bipfuma bibuya. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Kintsi muti anamenyerwa kwa bipfuma byao. Abandu batahanula bipfuma bya tini neri bipfuma bya musabibu ku miti ya mahwa. <figure style="fig" alt="Arbre de figue" file="hk00088b.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="6:44">Miti ya tini</figure> <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Kwonoko, amundu mubuya anereneena binwa bibuya byobitenga mwa mbikyo yiwe mbuya. Na mundu mubi naye, anereneena binwa bibi byobiuchwire mwa mbikyo yiwe nyibi. Kubwishi, abunu bwa mundu bunereneena byobiuchwire mwa mbikyo ya mwete uwe.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga wa manyumba mabiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amwereniluka mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu, Ninakuwetu›, ni mutamukola byonibabwira? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nikababwerekya amundu yaniimitsa, neumpfa abinwa byani, nekola nga kobibwire mbu: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />«ashushanyibwe na mundu yahimbaa nyumba. Nianatima kasa kutsibu nehika kwa lukanga. Na kwa lukanga uko, kwahiraa amusingi wahimbaako anyumba. Kwabere kwamewa mpfula ya kiti, alwichi nialunauchula, na ngukutsi niainaibanda kwa nyumba uko. Wetuwe, anyumba iyo itakunuka, kureba yabaa ni isimikire.» <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Wetuwe, ula yaumpfa abinwa byani butsira ikola nga kobibwire, ashushire mundu yahimbaa nyumba yiwe kwa mutaka butsira musingi. Alwichi lwabere lwameuchula, angukutsi niainaibanda kwa nyumba uko. Mu kashalimo, niainakunuka, neshambukala ayoshe.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya amupfubulwa wa mukulukulu wa basura ba Baroma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu abere ameotola ineena abinwa byoshe ibyo kwa bandu bobabaa abamuumpfiritsa, nianaya mwa mulungu we Kaperenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mwa mulungu umo mwabaa ni muli mukulukulu muuma wa basura ba Baroma. Amukulukulu uyo, ni awete mukotsi yabaa atsiyire kutsibu. Amukotsi uyo, ni mukoni, naye ni ali ku lwepfa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Amukulukulu wa basura uyo aumpfaa kwa bandu abashambala kuluenda Yesu. Nianatumira Yesu yo bangumwa bauma ba Bayahuti mbu bamubwire mbu ahike alamye amupfubulwa uwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Abangumwa abo babere bahika ho Yesu ali, niabanaitondoola kuye mbu: «Ninakuwetu, amundu uyu naye analirene umukolere kya kuhema, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kureba anatsiyira aluanda lwetu. Na kandi, yatuhimbiraa <char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">asinakoki</char> yetu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Niyo Yesu aenda kuuma na bangumwa abo. Abere ahika hofi na nyumba ya mukulukulu wa basura, amukulukulu uyo nianalika bera bewe ira mwa Yesu kwemubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, utakiitamyaa kubwishi nitalirene ikukokere mwa nyumba yani. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Na kubwishi bwekyo, shanixunga ngyewene ni nitalirene ihika youli. Wetuwe iwe, neena kinwa kiumaho na mukotsi wani akalama. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kureba nani niteekirwa na bakulukulu bani. Nani niwete ku basura boniteekire. Nikebwira muuma mbu ‹enda›, ni aenda. Nikekalihya na undi mbu ‹Wiche› naye ni awicha. Nikebwira mukotsi wani mbu: ‹Kola iki naye ni akolakyo.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu abere ahulikya abinwa ibi nianashishalira amukulukulu wa basura uyo. Nianabindukira amubuanano wa mwimitse neneena mbu: «Anibabwira ku mwa kihuo kyoshe kye Isiraeri nitatsanaxungamo mundu yali na bwimire bungana ngobu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Bo batumwaa babere bafuluka kwa mutsi, niabanashingana amupfubulwa ni amelama.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfukya amwana wa muxumbakatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianaya mu mulungu muuma walukwa mbu Naini. <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">Abemitsa</char> bewe kuuma na mubuanano munene wa bandu baimitsanya naye. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Abere axondehika hofi na lukyo lwa mupfunda wa mulungu, nianashingana bandu bobabaa bahete ndundwe ya mwana wa butsana kweya itayo. Amutsana uyo abaa mwana wa kyusha wa muxumbakatsi muuma. Bandu bangi ba kwa mutsi uko ni bahereketse amuxumbakatsi uyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ninakuwetu abere amuxunga, nianamupfira boncho bungi. Nianamubwira mbu: «Utakiliraa!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Yesu nianaipfunda hofi na sanduku nepfula kuyo na bandu bobabaa baheteyo batindira. Yesu niananeena mbu: «Wemutsana, anikubwira mbu, sisimuka!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Na mutsana yabaa amepfa, nianasisimuka. Nianaikala, abanetangira ineena. Yesu nianamufulukitsa nina.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Abandu boshe abo batsimbwa na buba, batangiresingya Ongo mbu: «<char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">Mutahwa</char> munene amehika mwa kati ketu! Ongo amehika itutabara twe bandu bewe!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Akinwa ikyo kye Yesu akolaa kishanchana mwa kihuo kyoshe kye Yuteya na mwa bindi bihuo byoshe bya mwa misike.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Murubiki alika bemitsa bewe ira mwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Abinwa byoshe ibyo, <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> ba Yohana, baya imupfulirabyo. Kubwishi bwekyo, Yohana nianabirangira babiri mwa bemitsa bewe. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Nianalikabo ho Ninakuwetu ali, kwemubutsa mbu: «Mbeni iwe we Masiya yakendewicha neri tulindire undi?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Abemitsa abo bahika ho Yesu abaa ali. Bamubwira mbu: «Yohana Murubiki shatulika kwiwe mbu tukubutse mbu mbeni we Masiya yakendewicha, neri tulindire undi?»<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mwa kashangi umo, Yesu nianalamya bandu bangi bobabaa abanubibwa na makoni, na birema na bobabaa baundirwe na bixwatsi. Nianaha bihumahumi bingi yo xumo yelola. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yesu nianaxubitsa abemitsa bobatumwaa ne Yohana mbu: «Muende, shamupfulire Yohana abinwa byoshe ibyo byomwamelolako neumpfa. Abihumahumi abilola, na bobaxuneera abaenda, na babentsi abakomibwa, na batwitwi abahulikya, na bapfu abapfùka, na bachene abapfulirwa aMwatsi Mubuya. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Aashanirwe amundu yatendehetsa abwimire buwe mwingye.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Abandu bo Yohana alikaa, niabanafuluka. Niyo Yesu atangira ibwira amubuanano wa bandu kuluenda Yohana, mbu: «Mbeni mwayaa mwa bweru kweya ixungayoki? Mbeni lusheke lolutinganyibwa na muyaa? Ihi! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Neri, inde yomwayaa ixungako? Mbeni mundu aimbere ngimba sikwirire? Ihi! Bobanaimbala ngimba skwirire na bobali mu buxoki, banaikala mwa manyumba ma bami. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Kiki kyomwayeexungako? Mbeni <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">Mutahwa</char>? Naki! Anibabwira ku abaa mutahwa, ni alengyitse na mutahwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Kuluenda Yohana uyo kokyaandikwaa mwa Maandiko Makomire mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‹Muumphe! Nalika andumwa yani mbu ikuxondolere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">kwebula mbu ikutemulire anchira.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Malaki 3:1.</char></note>.›<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />«Anibabwira imwe, ku mwa bandu boshi bobaliho kwa kihuo, mutali yalengyitse Yohana. Wetuwe amulere kutsibu mwa <char style="w">Bwami bwa Ongo</char> yanamulengyitse.»<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Abandu boshe na bafutishi ba koli bobahulikyaa amyatsi wa Yohana bamenya ku Ongo anakola byobitunganene, baba nerubikwa naye. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Wetuwe, <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">aBafarisayo</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa Muomba">beyisa ba Muomba</char>, baitindira kuluenda ibo, kye Ongo abaa axonda ikolerabo. Kubatyo, baitinda irubikwa ne Yohana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Nikashushanya abandu ba mwa biro bino nende? Nende ye bashushire? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bashushene na bana baikere mwa mbua, abaumananga binwa mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‹Twabatsihiraa murumbu, wetuwe, mutamutsinaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">twabaimbiraa nyimbo kandi sa kiriro, wetuwe, mutaliraa!›<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />«Kureba Yohana Murubiki ahikaa, abaa muhanga weihangira ilya, nexoma <char style="w">tifai</char>, nemwe ni mwerebula mbu aundirwe na kixwatsi. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" /><char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> awichaa ni alya nexoma, nemwe amubula mbu: ‹Tsene kwa mundu uyu mukuhu na mutamitsi! Na mwira wa bafutishi ba koli na bandi bakotsi ba ntsambi›. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Wetuwe abandu boshe bobaimirire abuteateanya bwa Ongo, baneremenya kwa buteateanya ubo butunganene.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ashashira mukatsi muuma wa ntsambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">Mufarisayo</char> muuma nianalalika Yesu mbu ahike alye biryo mwamwe. Yesu nianaingira mwa nyumba ya mufarisayo uyo, nianaikala netangira ilya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mwa mulungu umo mwabaa mukatsi muuma wa ntsambi. Amukatsi uyo nianaumpfao ku Yesu alya bilyo mwa nyumba ya mufarisayo. Nianaingiramo ni awete ku ngaha ye bale, yo iuchwire lungo lwa kichiro kinene.<figure style="fig" alt="'une femme essuie les pieds de Jésus avec ces cheveux" file="WA03839b.tif" size="span" ref="7:37">Mukatsi muuma akababya abishando bya Yesu mwa mpfiri siwe</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Nianaimana ira nyuma ku Yesu, hofi na bishando biwe ni alira. Na sandiro siwe seretotya abishando bya Yesu. Niyo amukatsi uyo erekababyabyo mwa mpfiri siwe. Nianakokera abishando bya Yesu nehakabyo lungo. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />aMufarisayo uyo yalalikaa Yesu abere axunga batyo, nianaibubukya mbu: «Amundu uyu ali <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char>, nge angamenyire ku uhe mukatsi yamemupfulako na wa bwokoki, nge amemenya ku amukatsi uyu mukotsi wa ntsambi.»<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu nianabwira aMufarisayo uyo mbu: «Simoni, niwete kinwa kye kubwira» Ne Simoni naye nianaxubya mbu: «Mwiyisa, neena.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu nianabula mbu: «Kwabaa bandu babiri ni baindikirwe na mundu muuma. Muuma mubo ni aindikirwe tinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Tinari: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabaa faranga. Na tinari nguma ni iringene na mushahara wa mubitsi.</char></note> maana matano. Na undi ni aindikirwe tinari makumi atano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Kubwishi abandu babiri aba babaa batawete kyepfuha, yaindikaabo nianashashira ababiri. Eo! Inde mwa bandu babiri aba, yangatsiyira kutsibu nina asatinari?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni nianaxubya mbu «Anianikira ku yashashirwaa mwinda munene.» Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Wamexubya kushe.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Niyo Yesu akebera ira amukatsi ali, nianabwira Simoni mbu: «Utatsene kwa mukatsi uyu? Shaniingira mwa mwawe muno, utashauniha mechi meoya abishando. Wetuwe, amukatsi uyu, iye, shanikarabya abishando byani mwa ndiro siwe, nekababyabyo mwa mpfiri siwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Utashaunikokera mwa mango shauniketsa. Wetuwe iye, ihuluka ho shaniingirira muno, atatangire alika ikokera abishando byani. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Utashaunihaka mapfuta kwa mutwe wani, wetuwe iye, shanihaka lungo kwa bishando byani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBayahuti babaa banakokera mueni kwe muha mechi me karaba kwa bishando, ne mukokera, ne muhaka lungo.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kyokituma nikubwira ku nakiro <char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">asantsambi</char> sa mukatsi uyu saluwa, nameshashirato. Kubatyo, amenibwerekya kwanitsiyire kutsibu. Wetuwe, yarameshashirwa bike, anatsiira like.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Nianabwira amukatsi mbu: «Namekushashira asantsambi sawe.»<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bo babaa abalya kuuma naye, niabanatangira ibutsabutsanya mbu: «Esi! Munduki uyuno, yangashashira <char style="w">ntsambi</char>?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwira amukatsi mbu: «Abwimire bwawe bwamekuufula, iendere mu buholo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Abakatsi bo babaa banahereketsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu abaa ni atsuka mwa milungu na mwa mitsi ni ahubiri nepfulira abandu aMwatsi Mubuya wa <char style="w">Bwami bwa Ongo</char>. Abaa kuuma na sandumwa siwe ikumi nebiri. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Habaa hali kandi na bakatsi bauma babaa amehentsamo bixwatsi nelamya amakoni mabo. Mwa bakatsi umo ni muli Mariya, mwicha mwa mutsi we Makitala. Ne Mariya uyo ni yo Yesu ahentsaamo abixwatsi birinda. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Ne Shani, muka Kusa. Ne Kusa uyo yabaa mwimanitsi wa bitwe bya mukulukulu Herote. Ni hali ne Susana na bandi bakatsi bangi. Abakatsi abo bobabaa banahana kwa bitwe byabo kweasikya Yesu na sandumwa siwe.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa mubibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bandu bangi babaa banatoka mwa milungu yoshe kwebuanana ho Yesu ali. Yesu nianachirabo amushinga uyu mbu: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Mundu muuma ayaa ibiba mbuto mwexwa liwe. Abere ali yabiba asambuto ito, mbuto siuma sitoera kwa musike wa nchira. Abandu balyatangato, na sanyonyi sa mwa kyanya silyato.<figure style="fig" alt="Le semeur" file="WA03841b.tif" size="span" ref="8:5">Mubibi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Sindi mbuto sitoera ku mutaka wa mabale. Sabere samexuka, siuma kubwishi ni samehusha mechi mwa mutaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Sindi mbuto niasinatoera mu biti bya mahwa. Asambuto ito sixuka kuuma na mahwa ayo maba nepfunderetsato. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Wetuwe sindi mbuto, sitoera ku mutaka wa buinu. Sixuka, nehetako bikumba. Na kintsi kikumba, ni kiriko mbeke iana.» Yesu abere ameneena ibyo, nianalehya amulenge kandi, mbu: «Yawete matwi meumpfa, aumpfe!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">Abemitsa</char> bewe niabanamubutsa mbu mbeni amushinga uyo abwire ate? <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yesu nianaxubitsyabo mbu: «Imwe muherwe xumo yaremenya abinwa byobibishirwe bya <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char>. Wetuwe, abandi bandu ibo, alihema ni nerebwirabo mu mishinga kwebula mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">‹Basindere, wetuwe batilole</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">bahulikye, wetuwe batiumpfe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 6:9. </char></note>.›»<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aanulira amushinga wa mubibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Amushinga uyo abwire atya: Ambuto, kinwa kya Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Na sambuto sosatoeraa kwa musike wa nchira sishushanyibwe na bandu bo banaumpfa akinwa kya Ongo. Inyuma kwaho, Shitani ni ahika itengyakyo mwa myete yabo, kwebula mbu bataimiriraa neufulwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Asambuto sosatoeraa kwa mutaka wa mabale, sishushanyibwe na bandu bobanaumpfa akinwa kya Ongo neangirirakyo mu lumoo. Wetuwe akinwa ikyo ni kitisimike mwa myete yabo ngakuno milya. Ni baimirirakyo mu kashangi kakeho. Na mwa mango amyereko yahikirabo, ni basiya akinwa ikyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Na sambuto sosatoeraa mu biti bya mahwa, sishushanyibwe na bandu bobanaumpfa akinwa iki kya Ongo. Wetuwe amiririkano na buxoki, na ntsiyi ya bindu bya kihuo kino, nabyo ni byerepfunderetsa akinwa ikyo mwa myete yabo. Kyokinatuma batabako bipfuma bikulire. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Asambuto sosatoeraa kwa butaka buinu, ito, sishushanyibwe na bandu bobanaumpfa akinwa kya Ongo mu mwete mubuya na watunganene. Abo, bobanalanga akinwa ikyo mu ibeera nehikira ibako bipfuma.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa retala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Yesu nianaxuba ineena mbu: «Hatali mundu yangawakya itala nepfunikiraro mu kitonga, neri kwehiraro mweshishi wa ngyingo. Wetuwe, ni ahanikaro ku kahango, kwebula mbu bo baingira mwa nyumba umo ni baxunga kwa kyaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Abinwa byoshe byobibishirwe byendemenyibwa kyenene. Na binwa byoshe byobikolwa mu nama byendebixulwa kyenene.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />«Kunchi, mukohye kwa binwa byomuhulikya mo biro muno. Kubwishi amundu yawete kindu yanahabwa kindi. Wetuwe, yatawete ku kati kasibya endenyawa na kairemba iba nako.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baala babo Yesu ne nina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Lwire luuma, baala babo Yesu ne nina baya imuxunga. Wetuwe batakocha ihika harali kubwishi bwa mubuanano wa bandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Abandu babwira Yesu mbu: «Nyoko na baala benyu baimene ha mbuwa, abaxonda ikuxunga.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Mali na baala betu, ni bo banahulikya akinwa kya Ongo nekola ngakuno ko kibwire.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atsitsa muhusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lwire luuma, Yesu nianaurukira mu bwato kuuma na <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe. Nianabwirabo mbu: «Tushabukire kwa undi mushirya wa ngetsi.» Niabanaenda. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Babere bali yo bapfuama, Yesu nianaya tulo. Mu kashalimo, muhusi munene nianaikubita kwa ngetsi. Amechi niamanatangira iingira mwa bwato, niabanaingira mu kikuba kyexonda ishenda. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Abemitsa bewe niabanaipfunda hofi naye, niabanamusisimula mbu: «Mwiyisa, Mwiyisa, twapfa!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu nianasisimuka, nianakemera amuhusi, na muhusi nianatsira na mechi nao mawika. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Niyo Yesu abutsa abemitsa bewe mbu: «Abwimire bwenyu buli hai?» Niabanatsimbwa na buba neshishala kutsibu. Niabanabutsabutsanya mbu: «Munduki uyu? Kubwishi anabe na muyaa na muhusi akemerabyo, nabyo, abikola nga kwa bula!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahentsa bixwatsi mwa mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu na bemitsa bewe bashabuka angetsi basheeka abwato bwabo kwa musike wa kihuo kya Bakerasi, kweshirya wa kyango kye Ngalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu, abere akimira hashi, mundu muuma wa mwa mulungu uyo nianaya ikorana naye. Na mundu uyo abaa aundirwe na bixwatsi. Na mu biro bingi ni atakiimbala ngimba. Ni atakiikala mu nyumba, wetuwe kwa masinda ni kwahara anaishibanira. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Amundu uyo, abere axunga Yesu, nianailakira kutsibu, neiuma mwa bishando biwe neneena mu mulenge mule mbu: «Ee! Yesu, Muala wa Ongo Nina mu mbingu, Aunixondakoki? Anikuhema, utaninubyaa!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Abulaatyo kubwishi Yesu abaa ni amemuhentsamo akixwatsi. Akixwatsi ikyo kyabaa kinamuundira ngendo nyingi. Nakiro mbu, abandu babaa banamusibika mu bulebule na mu byuma mbu atangecheshaa, wetuwe iye, ni anahutulangabyo. Na kixwatsi ikyo, kyabaa kinamutwala hohataba bandu.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu nianabutsa amundu uyo mbu: «Aretsina rawe wende?» Naye nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Aretsina rani ngye ‹Tuli bangi.›» Aneenaa batyo, kubwishi ni aundirwe na bixwatsi bingi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Abixwatsi ibyo, niabinaitondoola ku Yesu mbu atahentseraabyo mwa shehenamu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Na handu aho, habaa hali kihyo kinene kya ngulube ni abikerera kwa kitwa. Abixwatsi ibyo, niabinaitondoola ku Yesu mbu ahebyo rubu lweingira mwa biololomo. Nianahabyo rubu. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Kubatyo, abixwatsi ibyo niabinatenga mwa mundu uyo neingira mwa ngulube ito. Na kihyo kyoshe kya biololo ibyo, niakinakima chuba kwa kitwa neiuma mwa ngetsi, kiba netsika mwa mechi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Na basumba ba sangulube ito, babere bamexunga ku byobyametsuka, niabanalibita chuba mwa mulungu na mwa bihya kwepfulirao abandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Na bandu niabanaya ixunga kyokyameba. Babere bamehika ho Yesu ali, bashingana amundu yarametokamo abixwatsi ni aikere mwa bishando bya Yesu, ni ahara imbere, naye ni amefulukya abwenge. Abandu abo niabanaubaha. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Na bandu bobaixungiraa ku byobyabaa byametsuka, bapfulirao abandi kwa amundu uyo yabaa aundirwe na bixwatsi ku amelamibwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Na bandu boshe ba mwa kihuo kya Bakerasi batsimbwa na buba bungi. Na kubwishi bwekyo, babwira Yesu mbu atokerebo mwa kihuo kyabo. Niyo Yesu auruka mwa bwato, kwefuluka.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Amundu yashatokamo abixwatsi, ayitondoola ku Yesu mbu aende kuuma naye. Wetuwe, Yesu nianamufulukya, amubwira mbu: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Fuluka kwa wawe, shaupfulire abandu abyoshe byo Ongo amekukolera.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Amundu uyo, nianaenda mwa mulungu woshe ni apfulirao abandu byo Yesu amemukolera.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfukya mwali wa Yairo nelamya mukatsi muuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu abere ali yafuluka, bandu bangi bahika imukokera kubwishi aboshe babaa ni bamulindire. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Mwa mango umo, mulume muuma, yalukwa mbu ye Yairo nianahika. Ne Yairo uyo abaa mwimanitsi wa <char style="w">sinakoki</char>. Nianapfukama mwa mbere sa Yesu neitondoola kuye mbu aingire mwa mwe, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kureba mwali abaa ni ali ku lwepfa. Abaa mwana uwe wa kyusha, yashembashemba myaka ikumi nebiri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu abere ali yaya ira mwa Yairo, mubuanano munene wa bandu bereenda ni abamupfundeeretsa. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mwa mubuanano umo, mwabaa mukatsi muuma ni amebanda myaka ikumi nebiri ni alwere bukoni bwehetsa shiama. Abaa amemala abitwe biwe byoshe kwepfuha abanganga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:43 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abaa amemala abitwe biwe byoshe kwepfuha abanganga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bitabo biuma bya kwa mira bya Kikiriki bitawete abinwa ibyo. Soma Mariko 5:26.</char></note>. Wetuwe, atalamibwa na kiro na muuma mubo. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Amukatsi uyo nianapfumbuka ira nyuma ku Yesu, aba neata kwa mupfungo wa lukimba luwe. Na mwa kashangi umoho, abukoni buwe bwarehetsa ashiama niabunalama.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu nianabutsa mbu: «Inde yamenipfulako?» Abandu boshe baiana mbu batamupfulireko. Niyo Petero amubwira mbu: «Esi! Mwiyisa, utatsene kwa mubuanano wa bandu bakutsungwireko nekupfundeeretsa?» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianabula mbu: «Hali mundu yamenipfulako, kubwishi nameumpfa ngakuno amaala amahuluka mwingye.»<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Amukatsi uyo abere amexunga kwamekengulwa, nianaenda ho Yesu ali ni atitimana. Nianapfukama mwa mbere siwe. Apfulao mwa kati ka bandu boshe kyoshakituma amupfulako, na ko shalamibwa mwa kashangi umomoho. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Mwali wani, abwimire bwawe bwamekulamya. Iendere mu buholo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu abere akinali aneena, niakunahika mundu yatoka ira mwa Yairo <char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">amukulukulu wa sinakoki</char>, amubwira mbu: «Waliha, mwiisa, utakiitamyaa, hatakiriki!» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesu abere ameumpfao, abwira Yairo mbu: «Utaubahaa, unaimiriraeho, mwali wawe elama.»<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yesu nianahika ha mwa Yairo. Atatsiya mbu undi mundu aingire mwa nyumba kuuma naye, bali bate abemitsa bewe, Petero ne Yohana, ne Yakobo, na babuti ba mwana uyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Abandu boshe babaa ni abalira neikungutanga kubwishi bwa lupfu lwa mwananyere uyo. Wetuwe, Yesu nianabula mbu: «Mutaliraa, kubwishi amwananyere uyu atapfire, wetuwe, anaonchireho.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Abandu babere baumpfa ko Yesu abula batyo, niabanamusheka kubwishi ibo ni bechi kwa amwananyere uyo amekinda ipfa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Wetuwe Yesu nianatsimba kwa minwe ya mwananyere uyo, nianamubirangira mu mulenge mule mbu: «We mwananyere, sisimuka!»<verse eid="LUK 8:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Amwananyere uyo, nianaxuba ifulukya amutima, abanebatuka. Yesu nianabwira abandu mbu bahe amwananyere uyo yo bilyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ababuti ba mwananyere uyo niabanashishala kutsibu. Yesu nianakurabo amatwi mbu batendebwira mundu woshewoshe byobyametsuka.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atuma asandumwa siwe ikumi nebiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Lwire luuma, Yesu nianabuanyanya abemitsa bewe ikumi na babiri. Nianahabo maala na nyiki sehentsa abixwatsi byoshe nelamya abakoni. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Nianatumabo kwepfula amwatsi wa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char> nelamya abakoni. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Mwa luendo lwenyu, mutahekaa kiro na kindu. Mutahekaa ngóma, neri shaho, neri mbamba, neri faranga. Kintsi muuma mwime nianahekaho lukimba luuma. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Mu kinsti nyumba yomukachumbikamo, ni mwaikalamo ihikira amango momwendetoka mwa mulungu umo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Na mu kintsi mulungu womutikokerwemo, ni mwatoka muo. Wetuwe, mwa mango amutoka muo ni mwa kunguta amupfupfu wali kwa bishando byenyu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kunguta amupfupfu wali kwa bishando byenyu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni bula mbu, amundu yashatumwa, ni atakihwere, iri abandu bashatumwako bataikiritse amwatsi washaleterabo.</char></note>. Ikyo kyendeba kaliho kwa bandu abo.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Niyo asandumwa ito saenda ni asitsuka mulungu ku mulungu. Sitsuka ahoshe ni asipfula aMwatsi Mubuya nelamya abakoni boshe.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amyatsi ya Yesu yashatya abwenge bwa mwami Herote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Herote, amukulukulu wa kyango kye Ngalilaya nianaumpfa abinwa byoshe ibyo. Abwenge buwe bushata, kubwishi bandu bauma niababula mbu, Yohana Murubiki yamepfuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Na bandi niababula mbu <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">amutahwa</char> Eliya yamexuba, na bandi kandi mbu muuma mwa batahwa ba kwamira yamepfuka.<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Wetuwe, Herote nianabula mbu: «Ingye ngyenawene ngye nabulaa mbu bache amutwe wa Yohana. Tsene, inde uyu kandi yaniumpfako amyatsi yoshe iyi?» Kubwishi bwekyo, Herote nianaxonda kwangaxunga Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auutya bandu bihumbi bitano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Ndumwa">Asandumwa</char> sifuluka sitangira ipfulira Yesu abinwa byobabaa bamekola. Nianaenda nabo hale na bandu. Niabanaya kwa undi munda wa mulungu we Betesaita.<verse eid="LUK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Wetuwe abandu bacha luche kwali iyo, niabanamukulikira. Yesu nianakokerabo kushe nepfulirabo amyatsi kuluenda <char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">aBwami bwa Ongo</char>. Na bobabaa balwere, alamyabo.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Bwabere bwahara buoloba, asandumwa ikumi nebiri sa Yesu sihika harali kwemubwira mbu: «Waliha! hotuli hano hale na mutsi, kubwishi bwekyo, shaungabwirire abandu mbu bafuluke baye mwa mitsi yoiri hofi, baye na mwa bihya baxondemo maonchiro na bilyo.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mwenabene muhebo bilyo.» Nabo, baxubya mbu: «Tuweteho ku mikati itano na fi ibiri. Auxonda mbu twenabene tuulire abandu boshe aba bo bilyo?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Abandu bobabaa aho babaa abashembashemba balume bihumbi bitano. Niyo Yesu abwira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe mbu: «Muikatse abandu mu bikanga bya bandu makumi atano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Abemitsa baira ngakuno ko Yesu abwiraabo. Batyo, baikatsa abandu boshe. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu nianatsimba amikati itano na safi ibiri ito, alalamira mu mbingu, nebula mbu Ongo asinge. Inyuma kwaho, nianacha muyo, nianahayo abemitsa bewe kweabirayo abandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Abandu boshe abo niabanalya newuuta. Abemitsa niabanatolerera amisialitsa, bauchutsa bitonga ikumi na bibiri.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero abula mbu Yesu ye Kirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar 8:27-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lwire luuma, Yesu abaa ahemera Ongo mu handu ha butomo na <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe ni bali hamusike kuye. Nianabutsabo mbu: «Abandu aberebula mbu ingye ngyende?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Bauma aberebula mbu, iwe we Yohana Murubiki. Na bandi, mbu we <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char> Eliya. Na bandi kandi mbu uli muuma mwa batahwa ba kwamira yamepfuka.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Niyo Yesu abutsabo mbu: «Nemwe amwerebula mbu ingyono ngyende?» Petero nianaxubya mbu: «Iwewe we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char> we utumirwe ne Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ashambala kuluenda alupfu na repfuka liwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mar 8:30–9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu nianahangirabo kutsibu mbu batahira bakepfulira mundu woshe woshe amwatsi uyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Nianaxubebula mbu: «Ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>, nishushire inubibwa lingi, netindwa na bangumwa na <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">beisa ba Muomba</char>. Nikaitwa, na mwa lwire lwakashatu, nikapfuka.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Na kandi, Yesu nianabwira boshe mbu: «Amundu ali axonda inikulikira, ni ereiana yewene. Ni aikiritsa iheka amusalaba uwe kintsi lwire, niaba nenikulikira. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kubwishi, amundu yaxonda iufula abuingo buwe ni akahetsabo. Wetuwe, amundu yakahetsa abuingo buwe kubwishi bwangye, endeufulabo. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Na kandi, amundu akeba na buxoki boshe bwa kihuo, wetuwe akeihetsa neibihya yewene, angaba na mungurukoki? Hatali! <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Kubwishi bwekyo, amundu yakanipfira xoni, nepfira abinwa byani byo xoni, ingye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> nendemupfira xoni. Ibyo byendeba mwa mango nendehika mwa ngulu yani, nayo yo ngulu ya Tata kuuma na <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">bamalaika</char> bewe bakomire. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ko lune lutyo! Anibabwira, ku bandu bauma mu bo bali hano, batendepfa batechibaxunga kwa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusu bwa Yesu bwaihingya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Kwabere kwametsuka biro abishembashemba munane, Yesu aneenire abinwa ibyo, nianatsimba Petero, ne Yohana, ne Yakobo. Nianaurukira kwa kitwa kuuma nabo kweya ihema Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Abere ali yahema Ongo, abusu buwe buihingya na lukimba luwe luba lwa mweru kutsibu nebwengabwenga nga kisherya. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30-31" />Na mwa kyaka ikyo, mupfumbuka balume babiri, Musa ne Eliya. Abalume babiri abobabaa ni abasimola ne Yesu ku akamala amulimo uwe nepfira i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Mwa kashangi umo, Petero na balikyabo ni bahotokire na tulo. Wetuwe, basisimuka, baxunga angulu ya Yesu, na balume babiri abo ni baimene hofi naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Abalume babiri abo babere bamesiana ne Yesu, Petero nianamubwira mbu: «Mwiyisa, likwirire tuikale hano. Tuhimbeho mahema mashatu: liuma likaba rawe, na lindi likaba ra Musa, na lindi ra Eliya.» Petero abaa atechi kyabula. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petero abere akinali aneena atyo, niakunapfumbuka kipfu, kixwikabo. Abemitsa abo batsimbwa na buba kwexunga ko bamexwikwa na kipfu ikyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Na mwa kipfu ikyo niamunaumpfibwa mulenge wabula mbu: «Uyu, ye Muala wani yo namekindelondola. Muneremuumpfira<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 42:1; Luka 3:22.</char></note>!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Amulenge uyo, abere ameumpfibwa, abemitsa abo baxunga Yesu ni ameshiba yewene. Abinwa byoshe ibyo byobalolaako, niabanatsirira kubyo. Mwa biro byoshe umo, batabwirabyo kiro na mundu.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahentsa kixwatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Bwabere bwakya, Yesu na bemitsa bewe bashatu abo, bakima ampfuli. Na mubuanano munene wa bandu amuhikira. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Mwa mubuanano umo, mundu muuma niananeena mu mulenge mule mbu: «Mwiyisa, anikuhema mbu unilolere ku muala wani. Kubwishi uyuho yena mwana muuma ni weteko! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Akixwatsi akyeremuundira, ni kyamulakya, nemuhirianya kutsibu, na lufumba ni lwahuluka mwa bunu. Akixwatsi ikyo, kinamunubya kutsibu, kitabanemutokamo chuba. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nabwiraa <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bawe mbu bahentse akixwatsi ikyo, wetuwe batashabakocha.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Mwe bandu ba lubuto luno mutainihirwa, na kandi muli bandu babi kutsibu. Nexubeikala nemwe neumpfiritsa abinwa byenyu ihikira kihe kianiro? Leta muala wawe hano!»<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mwa kashangi amwana uyo abaa aipfunda hofi ne Yesu, akixwatsi kimubanda heshi, kiba nemuhirianya kutsibu. Wetuwe Yesu nianakemerakyo, alamya amwana, abanemufulukitsa ishe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Abandu boshe bashishala kwexunga amaala manene ma Ongo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu axubepfula amwatsi wa lupfu luwe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Abandu abo babere bakiri abashishalira abinwa byoshe byo Yesu abaa erekola, Yesu nianabwira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe mbu: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Mutee amatwi kushe. Muumpfe byaranixonde babwira: ‹<char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> aterekwa mwa minwe sa bandu.›» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />«Wetuwe, abinwa byo Yesu abwiraabo, batamenya ko bibwire. Kubwishi byabaa bibishirwe kubo, niabanaubaha imubutsa ko bineenire.»<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inde ye mukulukulu mwa bwami bwa Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Abemitsa ba Yesu niabanaya buhaka kwexonda imenya ngakuno inde mubo ye mukulukulu. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu abaa ni ahara echi amianikire yabo. Ikyo kituma atsimba mwana mulere, nianamuhira hofi naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Abanebwirabo mbu: «Kintsi yakokera amwana uyu mwetsina rani, ni amenikokera. Na kintsi yakanikokera, ni amekokera yanilikaa. Kureba amuke mwimwe, uyo ni ye mukulukulu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yate mulenda wenyu ni ali kwa munda wenyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mar 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Niyo Yohana abula mbu: «Mwiyisa, twaxungaa ku mulume muuma ni ahentsa abixwatsi mwe tsina rawe. Wetuwe, tumuhangira kubwishi ni ate wa mwa kikanga kyetu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mutamuhangiraa, kubwishi yate mulenda wenyu, uyo ni ali kwa munda wenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basamariya bauma batinda ikokera Yesu mwa mutsi wabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Abiro bya rekukumwa ra Yesu kweya mu mbingu byabaa byaxondehika. Kubwishi bwekyo, nianatsimba muanikire weya i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Nianalika bandu bauma kwemuxondolera. Abandu abo, niabanaenda neingira mu mutsi muuma wa <char style="w">Basamariya</char> kwemuxondera umo ichumbi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Wetuwe becha mwa mutsi umo batinda imukokera kubwishi ni ali mu luendo lweya i Yerusalemu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itokera kwa mira, aBayahuti na Basamariya babaa bataumpfana, kubwishi aBayahuti babaa banabula mbu Ongo ashushire iimanikirwa i Yerusalemu. Wetuwe, aBasamariya, ibo, babaa banabula mbu Ongo ashushire iimanikirwa kwa kitwa kye Karisimu. Kubwishi bwekyo, aBasamariya babaa batatsiya mbu aBayahuti be Ngalilaya mbu batsuke mwa kihuo kyabo kweya iimanikira Ongo i Yerusalemu. Soma Yohana 4:20.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">Abemitsa</char> bewe, Yakobo ne Yohana babere bamexunga batyo, babula mbu: «Ninakuwetu, wangatsiya mbu tuheme amuchanwa akime kwetenga mu mbingu ahwerekeretsebo?»<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu nianakebera nekemerabo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hali bindi bitabo bya kwa mira byo biongerere bindi binwa kwa mukololo uyu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yesu nianaxuba ibula kandi mbu: «Mutechi ku muli bana ba Mutima Akomire wa Ongo? Munamenya kushe ku ngye Muala wa Mundu ndahikaa kwehwerekeretsa abandu, wetuwe nahikaa kweufulabo.» </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Luka 19:10.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Mwa ntsindiro, Yesu na bemitsa bewe baya mu undi mutsi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abandu bo baxonda ikulikira Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Mwa kashangi Yesu na bemitsa bewe, babaa bakinali mwa nchira, mundu muuma nianamubwira mbu: «Nikenderekukulikira ahoshe houkendereya.»<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Amiterere iwete menda, na sanyonyi sa mwa kyanya siwete nyutu. Wetuwe <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> atawete buonchiro.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu nianabwira undi mundu mbu: «Unikulikire.» Amundu uyo naye nianabula mbu: «Ninakuwetu, unihe rubu nitange naya ita tata.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Lika abapfu bereta abapfu babo. Wetuwe iwe, enda, shaupfulire abandu amwatsi wa kuluenda <char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">aBwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Na undi mundu naye nianabula mbu: «Nenderekukulikira, wetuwe, Ninakuwetu, unihe rubu nitangenaya ilaa angumo yani.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Amundu ametangira ihinga, ni atikikebere. Yakakola atyo, ni atalirene ikolera <char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">abwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atuma bandi bemitsa makumi alinda na babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Inyuma kwaho, Ninakuwetu nianaxubelondola bandi bandu makumi alinda na babiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hali bindi bitabo byo biahwire bandu makumi alinda. </char></note>. Nianatumabo babiri babiri kwemuxondolera mu kintsi mulungu na kintsi handu habaa axonda iya yenawene. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Amyaka ierire mingi, wetuwe abaxotsi bobake. Kubwishi bwekyo, muheme nina amyaka mbu atume bandi baxotsi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Muende! Wetuwe muumpfe kasa: nabalika nga byana bya mbuli mwa kati ka sanyambwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mutahekaa faranga, neri shaho, neri bilyato. Ni mutiketse mundu mwa nchira.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />«Na mu nyumba yosheyoshe yomukaingiramo, ni mwaketsa bechamo mbu: ‹Abuholo bube mwa nyumba muno.› <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Na mwa nyumba umo, muli mundu yaxonda buholo, abuholo bwenyu ubo ni bukaba kwiye. Butsira ulo, abuholo bwenyu ubo ni bwabafulukira. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Ni mwaikalomo ni amulya nexoma byo becha umo bakabasheera, kubwishi amukotsi alirene ihabwa amushahara uwe. Ni mutitoke mu nyumba mbu mwaya mu indi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Na mu kintsi mulungu wo mukaingiramo, abandu bakebakokera, ni mwalya byo bakabasheera. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Na bakoni bomukatimana mwa mulungu umo, ni mwalamyabo. Ni mwabwira na bechamo mbu: ‹<char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">abwami bwa Ongo</char> bwahara hofi nemwe.› <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Wetuwe, kintsi mulungu womukaingiramo, bechamo batabakokere, ni mwaya mwa mbua yao neneena mbu: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‹Atubakungutira amupfupfu wa kwa mutsi wenyu washali kwa bishando byetu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Luka 9:5.</char></note>. Wetuwe kyomumenyae, aBwami bwa Ongo bwahara hofi.› <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Anibabwira ku mwa lwire lwa recha lubancha, becha mulungu uyo bendechirwa lubancha lutsibu lulengitse lwa becha mwa mulungu we Sotoma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ndangiro 19:24-28. </char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atukanga amilungu yo itamwimirire</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Mulyae mo becha mwa mulungu we Korasini! Mulyae mo becha mwa mulungu we Betesaita! Kureba, nakolire tushingishiro mwa kati kemwe. Na niri nakolaa atushingishiro uto mwa mulungu we Tiro na we Sitona, nge becha iyo, ibo, nge baimbalaa biunira neikala mu ipfu kwebwerekya ku <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">bamehingya amiberere</char> yabo. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Kubwishi bwekyo, mwa lwire Ongo endechira abandu bo lubancha, becha Tiro ne Sitona bendechirwa lubancha lwangu irengya lwa becha Korasini ne Betesaita. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na mwe becha mwa mulungu we Kaperenaumu, amuanikira mbu mwendeurukibwa mu mbingu? Ihi! Mwendekimibwa i kutsimu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Na kandi, Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Amundu yabaumpfira, ingye ni ngye aumpfira. Wetuwe, yamebatinda, ingye ni ngyametinda. Na yamenitinda ingye, ni ametinda Ongo yanilikaa.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abemitsa makumi alinda na babiri bafuluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Hanyuma, abemitsa makumi alinda na babiri abo bafuluka ni bamoire kutsibu. Babula mbu: «Ninakuwetu, binabe na bixwatsi, twabere tuli atuhentsabyo mwe tsina rawe, ni byakola nga ko shatubwirabyo.» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Kubatyo, Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Shanixunga Shitani ni atoa kwetenga mu mbingu ngakuno kisherya. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Muumpfe kushe! Nabahere maala mehima Shitani. Kunchi, mwa maala ayo munerelyatanga nchoka na biratsi. Hatakiri kindu kyo kyendebaira kubi kandi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Wetuwe mutamoaa kubwishi abixwatsi abikola byamubwirabyo. Wetuwe, mumoe kubwishi amatsina menyu mamekinda iandikwa mu mbingu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mwa kashangi umomoho, Yesu nianamoa kutsibu mwa maala ma Mutima Akomire. Niananeena mbu: «Tata, iwe we Nina ambingu! Na kihuo, anikusingya kubwishi abinwa ibyo wabishaabyo kwa bateateanya na basomi. Wetuwe, wamexwikulirabyo abana. Naki Tata, obyoshe ibi bitengire mweshasha rawe.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />«Tata amehira abindu byoshe mwa minwe sani. Hatali mundu yanichi ingye, ngye Muala, ali ateho Tata. Hatali na mundu yechi Tata ali ate ingye ngye Muala, na mundu woshewoshe yonixonda mbu amumenye.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Niyo Yesu akebera ya <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe bali, nebwirabo bonabene mbu: «Amesha momaxunga ku byomulolako maashanirwe! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Anibabwira <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> bangi na bami bangi bashashaa ixunga kwa binwa ibyo byomuxungako, wetuwe bataxungaa kubyo. Babanexonda iumpfa ku byo muumpfa ibi wetuwe bataumpfa kubyo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mushinga wa Musamariya mubuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Inyuma kwaho, <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa Muomba">mwiisa muuma wa Muomba</char> nianabatuka kweereka Yesu. Nianamubutsa mbu: «Mwiyisa, niirende kwebula mbu nibe na buingo bwa biro byoshe?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Bate ko baandikire mwa <char style="w">Muomba</char>? Unereumpfao ute mwa mango ausomao?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Amwiyisa wa Muomba uyo nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Uneretsiyira Ninakuwetu Ongo mwa mutima wawe woshe, na mwa mwete wawe woshe, na mwa nyiki sawe soshe, na mwa bwenge bwawe boshe. Uneretsiyira kandi na muhuwene wawe ngakuno kounaitsiyira wonawene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Muubuko 6:5; Balawi 19:18. </char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Niyo Yesu amubwira mbu: «Wamexubya kushe! Unerekola nga ko wameneena, nawe wendebaho.»<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Wetuwe, amwiisa uyo wa Muomba abaa axonda iibwerekya ku ayaitse. Niyo abutsa Yesu mbu: «Nende ye mulikyetu?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Mundu muuma atengaa i Yerusalemu kwekimira mwa mulungu we Yeriko. Abere akinali mwa nchira nianahendwa na bashamutsi. Abashamutsi abo bamunyaa abyoshe byabaa aweteko, niabanamuhirako mihumbo, baiendera, bamusia ni ali ku lwepfa.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />«Niakunapfumbuka <char style="w" lemma="Mukungu wa hekalu">mukungu</char> muuma wa hekalu ni akima mwa nchira iyo. Abere axunga kwa mundu uyo yashahumbwa, nianatsuka hamusike kuye, neiendera.<verse eid="LUK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />«<char style="w" lemma="Balawi">Mulawi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mulawi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBalawi babaa bandu ba lubuto lwa Israeli bo babaa banaasikya shebakungu kwa mulimo wa hekalu ra Ongo. Soma Muancho 3:1-13.</char></note> muuma naye nianahika. Abere axunga kwa mundu yashahumbwa, nianatsuka hamusike kuye aba neyiendera.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />«Mwa ntsindiro, niakunahika <char style="w" lemma="Basamariya">Musamariya</char> muuma naye ni ali mu luendo. aMusamariya uyo ninahika ha mundu yashahumbwa ali. Abere amuxunga, nianamupfira bwoncho kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Nianaipfunda hofi naye, nianamushakirira abihulu kwepfubulirako <char style="w">tifai</char> na mapfuta, abanefukirabyo. Nianamukukumira kwa punda iwe nemutwala mwa nyumba ya reonchitsamo abaeni kwemulanga umo.<figure style="fig" alt="Le bon Samaritain bande les plaies de la personne qui a ete frappee" file="WA03863b.tif" size="span" ref="10:34">Musamariya Mubuya afukira abihulu bya mundu yashahumbwaa</figure> <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Bwabere bwakya, nianahulukya tinari ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Tinari ibiri: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sabaa faranga sepfuha mukotsi mushahara wa mibitsi ibiri.</char></note>, nianahato nina anyumba aba nemubwira mbu: ‹Langa amundu uyu. Na sindi tinari seukaongerera kwemulanga, nendekupfuhato nafuluka.›»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Niyo Yesu abutsa amwiisa wa Muomba mbu: «Mwa bandu bashatu aba, inde yauxunga ku yabaa mulikyabo amundu uyo yarahumbwaa na bashamutsi?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Na mwiisa uyo wa Muomba uyo nianaxubya mbu: «Yamupfiraa abwoncho.» Niyo Yesu amubwira mbu: «Enda, nawe unerekola utyo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atangula Marita ne Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Mwa mango Yesu na bemitsa bewe babere bakinali mwa luendo, niabanaingira mu mutsi muuma. Mukatsi muuma mbu ye Marita, nianamukokera mwa nyumba iwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Marita uyo abaa na mwali wabo yalukwa mbu ye Mariya. Mariya uyo nianaikala hamusike wa bishando bya Ninakuwetu ni ahulikya akinwa kiwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Wetuwe Marita, iye abaa ni ahekeranya amirimo ya mwa nyumba. Nianahikira Yesu, amubutsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, Arenisiira amulimo wo mwali wetu mulere anisiirire litalikubwiraki? Umubwire ahike aniasikye.»<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ninakuwetu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Eh Marita! Auhekeranya neitamya na mirimo mingi. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Wetuwe, kindu kiumaho kibuya kyo kirengitse abyoshe. Ne Mariya, iye, ameixowa kindu kyo kikwirire kutsibu, nekyo atibanyawekyo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aiyisa abemitsa bewe ko bangahema Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lwire luuma, Yesu abaa handu hauma ni ahema Ongo. Abere ameotola ihema, muuma mwa <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe nianamubwira mbu: «Yohana aiyisaa abemitsa bewe ihema Ongo. Nawe, Ninakuwetu, utuiyise netwe kotwangahema Ongo.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Mwa kashangi mwahema Ongo, ni mwabula mutya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‹Tata, abandu boshe bamenye kwiwe we Ongo, we ukomire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Abwami bwawe buwiche.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Uneretuha abilyo byetu bya kintsi lwire.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Uneretushashira <char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">asantsambi</char> setu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">nga kotunashashira netwe bobanatukolera abibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Uteretuhira mwa myereko.›»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu nianabwira abemitsa bewe kandi mbu: «Tuanikire amushinga uno: Hangaba mundu muuma mwimwe ni awete mwira uwe. Na mwira uwe uyo angamuhikira mu kati ka kiro, ni amubwira mbu: ‹Ee mwira wani, unisombye mikati ishatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />kubwishi mwira wani muuma amenihikira ni atoka mu luendo, nani ndawete biryo byemuha.› <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Na yarali mwa nyumba akemuxubitsa mbu: ‹Utaniiraako burunga, mberanikingire alutsi. Ingye na bana bani twahara tuonchire. Ndangakibatuka mbu nikuhe mikati.› <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Anibabwira ku nakiro atindebatuka kwemuha amikati, kureba iye mwira uwe, ni akanabatuka nemuha byaralaireko kubwishi bwareiminga liwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />«Nani anibabwira mbu munerehema, nemwe mukerehabwa. Munerexonda, nemwe mukerebonekya. Munerekongota kwa lutsi, nemwe mukerekingulirwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kureba kintsi mundu yanerehema yanerehabwa. Na yanerexonda yanerebonekya. Na yanerekongota yanerekingulirwa alutsi. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Inde ishe mwa kati kemwe, muala akemuhema fi ni akamuha nchoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Neri, muala akemuhema iyi ni akamuha kiratsi? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Mwe bandu babi, muli, mwichi iha abana benyu bo bindu bikwirire. Kalengyo Ixo yali mu mbingu, mbeni ni atihe aMutima Akomire bobanamuhemao?»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahentsa kixwatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mar 3:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lwire luuma, Yesu abaa ni ahentsa kixwatsi kyokyatumaa mundu muuma aba mutsiru. Akixwatsi kyabere kyametoka mwa mundu uyo, mu kashalimo, amundu uyo nianatangira ineena. Na bandu boshe niabanashishala kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Wetuwe, bauma mwa bandu abo, babula mbu: «Belisebuli, amukulukulu wa bixwatsi, yaha amundu uyu amaala marehentsabyo!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Na bandi ni abaxonda imuereka. Kubwishi bwekyo, niabanamuhema mbu abwerekyebo kalolero katengire mu mbingu.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Wetuwe, Yesu ni ahara echi amianikire yabo. Nianabwirabo mbu: «Bandu ba mu bwami buuma, bakerelwa bonabene ku bonabene, abwami ubo ni bwameshambukala. Na bandu ba mu kipfunga kiuma, nabo bali bangalwa bonabene ku bonabene, akipfunga ikyo ni kikashambukala. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Eo, Shitani naye akeilwisa yenawene, abwami buwe ni bwendesimika bute? Anibabwira ikyo, kureba imwe amubula mbu anihentsa abixwatsi mwa maala ma Belisebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Niri anihentsa abixwatsi mwa maala ma Belisebuli, na bana benyu banahentsabyo mu maala mande? Kubwishi bwekyo, Kwikyo banyakyenyu abapfulao ku mutayaitse! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Wetuwe ingye, niri anihentsa abixwatsi mwa maala ma Ongo, ni bula mbu <char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">abwami bwa Ongo</char> bwameotola iwicha mwa kati kenyu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />«Mwa kashangi mundu wa nyiki awete ku biruu alanga anyumba yiwe, abindu biwe ni bikanalangwa mu buholo. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Wetuwe, undi mundu yali na nyiki silengitse sa nina nyumba iyo, akehika imuhenda nemuhima, amundu wa sanyiki uyo, ni akamunyaa abiruu biwe byoshe byabaa ainihire, neaba abindu byamemunyaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />«Yatali kwa munda wani ni mulenda wani. Na yataniasikya kwetuma, ishancha ni rashancha.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arefuluka ra bixwatsi mwa mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Mwa mango akixwatsi kineretoka mwa mundu, kineretsungulanga hohatali bandu kweya ixonda hokikatamukira. Nakyo kitabonekitseho, ni kyabula mbu: ‹Nikafuluka mwa nyumba yani yonatengaamo.› <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Kyahika mwa nyumba iyo, ni kyatimanamo ni yamebitsibwa netondekwa kushe. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Kubatyo, ni kyaya ibinga bindi bixwatsi birinda bibi kutsibu ilengyakyo. Abixwatsi byoshe ibyo ni byaingiramo, neikalamo. Na miberere mitsindu ya mundu uyo ni yaba mibi kutsibu ilengya amibere.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngashani ya kuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu abere ali aneena abinwa ibyo, mukatsi muuma mwa mubuanano wa bandu, nianalehya amulenge, abula mbu: «Amukatsi yakubutaa ne nekuongya, aashanirwe!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Bobaashanirwe kushe, ni bobahulikya akinwa kya Ongo nekola nga kokibwire.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abandu abahema Yesu mbu abwerekyebo kalolero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Na bandu bangi babere bamebuanana hofi ne Yesu, Yesu nianabula mbu: «Abandu ba kianiro kino bandu babi! Abaxonda mbu babwerekibwe kalolero. Wetuwe, batikyendehabwa kandi kalolero kali kate akalolero ka mutahwa Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Amutahwa Yona abaa kalolero ku becha i Ninawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Yona 3:5.</char></note>. Nani, kwonoko, ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>, konendeba kalolero kwa bandu ba kianiro kino.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />«Mwa lwire Ongo endechira abandu bo lubancha, amwamikatsi yatokaa ibunyetako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma 1Bami 10:1-10.</char></note> endepfuka kuuma na mo bandu ba kianiro kino kwebasongera. Kubwishi iye, atokaa kihuo mbinga kwehulikya abinwa bya buteateanya bwa mwami Salomo. Na yali hano ye mukulukulu ku mwami Salomo.<verse eid="LUK 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />«Alwire lo Ongo endechiramo alubancha, lwendeba lwahika, becha mwa mulungu we Ninawi bendepfuka kuuma nemwe mo bandu ba kianiro kino, kwebachira lubancha. Kureba, ibo, babere bahulikya binwa byo Yona ahubiriibo, <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">bahingye amiberere</char> yabo. Tsene, na yali hano ye mukulukulu ku Yona!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amesha retala ra mubiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Hatali mundu yangawakya itala nebisharo, neri nepfunikiraro mu kitonga. Wetuwe, anerehanikaro ku kahango, kwebula mbu abandu bobaingira mwa nyumba balole kwa kyaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Amesha retala ra mubiri wawe. Amesha mawe mali matalwere, amubiri wawe woshe ni akaba mu kyaka. Wetuwe, amesha mawe mali malwere, amubiri wawe woshe ni akaba mu mutsimya. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Kubwishi bwekyo, unakohya akyaka kyokiri mwiwe kitangebinduka mutsimya. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Tsene, amubiri wawe woshe akeba mu kyaka, butsira kitambo kyokiri mu mutsimya, amubiri wawe woshe ni akaba mu kyaka kya kuli, ngakuno ko aretala linakukoletsa mwa kyaka kyaro.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amiberere mibi ya Bafarisayo na beyisa ba Muomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu abere amemala ineena abinwa ibyo, <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">Mufarisayo</char> muuma nianamubwira mbu ahike alye ku bilyo mwamwe. Yesu nianaingira mwa nyumba, aikala atangira ilya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />aMufarisayo uyo nianashishala kwexunga ko Yesu alya butsirekaraba kwa minwe, nga kwa ndungo yabo yabaa ibwire.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ninakuwetu amubwira mbu: «Mo <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> imwe, munakomya ira nyuma wa lungu na mbale. Wetuwe, mwa myete yenyu ni muuchwire kalabwa ka bwitsi na bundi bubi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Imwe, muli biashaasha! Mutechi ku Ongo yabumbaa byobiri ira nyuma, yanabumbaa na byobiri mwa kati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Munereasikya abachene mwa bindu byo biri mwa lungu neri byobiri mwa mbale. Na batyo, abindi bindu byoshe ni bikahotsibwa kwimwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Mulyae mo <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> Munerehana muhango muuma we kumi wa biti byobihumura kushe na munyeere neri wa sindi nini, wetuwe, muneresuntsuura ikola kyokitunganene, ni mwaba nesuntsuura itsiyira Ongo. Naho, ikyo ni kyomulirene ikola, butsira ilika ihana amuhango muuma we kumi wa bindi bindu ibyo.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Mulyae mo <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> muneretsiyira iikala kwa bipfumbi byera buxondotsi mwa <char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">masinakoki</char>. Na kandi muneretsiyira iketsibwa mu lubaho mwa mibuanano. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Mulyae momushushene na masinda momatangakimenyibwa ho mali, na ma bandu banatsukako butsira imenya!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Muuma mwa <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa Muomba">beyisa ba Muomba</char> nianabwira Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, kuluenda kouneena utyo, ni itukamba reutukamba!»<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Mulyae nemwe mo <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa Muomba">beyisa ba Muomba</char>! Munerehekya abandu bo mitsio mitsito, naho imwe mutalinda muhira kuyo kwa myolota yenyu kuluenda areasikya abandu abo.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />«Mulyae imwe! Kubwishi amwerehimbira <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">abatahwa</char> bo masinda, naho boxokulitsa ni bobaitaabo. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Nemwe kweira mutyo, ni mwameba tuliho kushe neikiritsa bya boxokulitsa bakolaa. Kureba ibo, bobabaa banereita abatahwa, nemwe, momuhimbirabo amasinda! <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kubwishi bwekyo, Ongo mwa buteateanya buwe aneenaa mbu: ‹Nikendetumirabo batahwa na <char style="w">ndumwa</char>. Wetuwe bakendeita bauma mubo, na bandi bendenubyabo.› <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Kubwishi bwekyo, ashiama ya batahwa boshe bobaitwaa, ihuluka arebumbwa ra kihuo, abandu ba kianiro kino, bendehwayo. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Abwiti ubo bwatangiraa ku Aberi ihikira ku Sakariya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sakariya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa Ndaane ya kwa Mira, aBayahuti ibo babaa bechiho kwa mundu mubere yaitwaa abaa ni Aberi na mutsindu ni Sakaria. Soma Ndangiro 4:8; Muubuko 24:20-22.</char></note> yaitirwaa mwa hekalu hakatikati ka <char style="w" lemma="butanda bwa mitulo">butanda bwa mitulo</char> na handu hohakomire kutsibu. Anibabwira imwe, ashiama ya bandu boshe abo, abandu ba kianiro kino, bendehwayo.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Mulyae mo <char style="w" lemma="beyisa ba Muomba">beyisa ba Muomba</char>! Munerebisha abandi bandu alufunguro kwebula mbu bataingiraa hohaiyisibwa kuluenda aremenya Ongo. Mwenabene munerexonda iingiraho, na bobaxonda iingiraho amuhangirabo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu abere amehuluka mwa nyumba umo, <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">abeisa ba Muomba</char> na <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> niabanamutsibukira kutsibu nemubutsa binwa bingi. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Babaa abaxonda imutea kinwa kwebula mbu baate kinwa kyemusongera.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahangira abitingo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mwa mango umo, mbumbi na mbumbi sa bandu niabanakorana ho Yesu ali, ihikira luero lwelyatana. Yesu nianatangira ineena kasa na <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe mbu: «Munerekohya kwa <char style="w">chachu</char> ya <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char>, nayo ni abitingo byabo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Hatali kyokibishirwe kyokitendebixulwa. Na kandi hatali na nama yoitendemenyibwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kubwishi bwekyo, abyoshe byomwaneenaa mwa mutsimya, byendehulikibwa mu kati ka mwishi. Na byomwamebuhererana kwe kwitwi mwa kaheto, byendepfulwa mu mulenge mule kwa muutu wa nyumba.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yashushire iubahwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Yesu nianaxubebula mbu: «Anibabwira mo bera bani mbu: Ni mutiubahe bobangaita amubiri, nenyuma wa reitao, ni batangakikocha ikola kindi kinwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nikababwerekya ula yalirene iubahwa: Munereubaha Ongo yawete maala meuma mundu i <char style="w">kutsimu</char> inyuma wa lupfu. Naki, anibabwira mbu, uyoyo yomunereubaha.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />«Mwichi kwa bixwi bitano binautsibwaho bichere bibiri bya faranga. Naho, hatali kiro na kiuma mubyo kyokiibirirwe mwa mbere sa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Sinabe na sampfiri sosiri kwa mitwe yenyu, Ongo echi amuancho wato. Kunchi, mutereubaha kubwishi, imwe muli na munguruko munene alengitse wa bixwi bingi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iikiritsa neri iiana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Mat 10:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Anibabwira mbu kintsi mundu yaniikiritsa mwa mbere sa bandu, <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>, endemuikiritsa mwa mbere sa <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">bamalaika</char> ba Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Wetuwe, kintsi mundu yangayiana ingye mwa mbere sa bandu, nani nendeyianaye mwa mbere sa bamalaika ba Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Na kintsi mundu yakendeneena kinwa kibi ku Muala wa Mundu endeshashirwa. Wetuwe kintsi mundu yakendekamba aMutima Akomire, iye atibashashirwe kiro na hake.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Mwa mango benderebatwala kweburana mwa <char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">masinakoki</char> neri mwa mbere sa bachamancha, neri mwa mbere sa bakulukulu, ni mutereiririkana komukahura na komukaneena. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kubwishi mwa kashangi umoho, aMutima Akomire ni akabaiyisa abinwa byomulirene ineena.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa muxoki kiashaasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mundu muuma mwa kichiri kya bandu nianabutsa Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, unibwirire muala wetu mbu tuabane amwandu wo tata atusiiraa.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Mbe mwira! Inde yaniiraa muchamancha neri muabi wa bitwe byenyu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianabwira abandu boshe mbu: «Munerekohya kwa kalabwa ka bitwe, kubwishi abuingo bwa mundu butahulukire kwa bungi bwa bitwe byali nabyo, nakiro mbu angaba muxoki kutsibu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Mwa ntsindiro, Yesu nianachirabo amushinga uyu mbu: «Kwabaa muxoki muuma, mwa maxwa mewe ni muerire myaka mingi kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Nianatangira ianikira neibutsa mbu: ‹Niirende? Amyaka yani yoshe iyi, ndawete handu heningahunikayo!› <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ni yaneena mbu: ‹Neira nitya: Nikashambula abitunda byani bibere, nehimba bindi biali. Nomo monikahunika amyaka na bindi bitwe byani. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Inyuma kwaho, nikaibwira mbu: “Mbera niibikirire bitwe bingi byo byangabanda myaka mingi. Kunchi, mbera nangatamuka, nilye, nixome, nibenemoa!”›<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />«Wetuwe Ongo nianamubwira mbu: ‹We kiashaasha iwe! Mwe kiro munoho, wepfa. Kubatyo, abindu byoshe byo wabaa wameibikira byeba byande?›» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu nianaxubebula mbu: «Ibyo byobinahikira mundu yanerexonda iihunikirako buxoki bungi, wetuwe ni ate muxoki mwa mbere sa Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Areinihira Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Mwa ntsindiro, Yesu nianabwira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe mbu: «Ikyo kyoshakituma nibabwira mbu mutereiririkana kubwishi bwa buingo bwenyu mbu mbeni mukalyaki. Neri mutereiririkana kubwishi bwa mibiri yenyu mbu mbeni mukaimbalaki. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kureba abuingo bwenyu bulengyitse abilyo, na mubiri alengyitse asangimba. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mulolere kwa bichoa. Bitabyala, neri bitanaxola, bitawete kitunda kyehunikiramo. Wetuwe Ongo anerelisabyo. Munamenya kwimwe mulengyitse asanyonyi kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Na kandi inde mwimwe yangakocha iongerera lwire luuma kwa buingo buwe, itsukira amiririkano yiwe? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Muli mutangakocha ikola kindu kike kiri ngekyo, ni amuiririkaniraki kubwishi bwa bindu?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />«Muanikire kasa kwa mauwa manaxuka, matakola, matailandira na ngimba. Wetuwe, anibabwira ku anabe na mwami Salomo, mwa ngulu yiwe yoshe, atatangire aimbala lukimba lukwirire ngakuno iuma liuma mwaya. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ongo ali anaimbakya atyo abiti byobinaxungwako munolwire na mungya ni byendeumwa mu muchanwa, mbeni ni atilengeretse ibaimbakya kushe, imwe mwe bandu ba bwimire buke? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Mutereiririkana kwexonda byomukalya neri byomukaxoma. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kureba abandu ba kwa kihuo kuno, abapakani, bobanerexonda abindu byoshe ibyo butsira itamo. Wetuwe imwe, muwete Tata yechi ku mulaire kwa bindu ibyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Wetuwe imwe, munerexonda kasa aBwami bwa Ongo, naye ni yakendebaongerera abindi bindu byoshe ibyo.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />«Mutereubahamwe kihyo kike! Kureba Ixo wenyu amexunga ku likwirire abahe abwami buwe.»<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tubike abuxoki bwetu mu mbingu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Yesu nianaxubebula mbu: «Muutse abindu byenyu, na safaranga somukautsabyo, muasikye muto abachene. Muikolere mbikyo sositangakunguha. Munereibikira mu mbingu abuxoki bobutendehwa. Kubwishi iyeyoho, ha mwitsi atangahika kweibaho, na nundu hoitangabihya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kubwishi ha mbikyo yenyu iri, ni ha myete yenyu ikereba.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abapfuku bo bakereresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yesu nianabula kandi mbu: «Munereba ni mu iringirirenye kwekola amulimo, na matala menyu ni amawaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mube ngakuno bapfubulwa bo balindire ninakuwabo yafuluka itoka mu buheruki. Mwa kashangi akahika nekongota kwa lutsi, ni bamukingulira mwa kashangi umo ho. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Bameashanirwa abapfubulwa abo mwa mango ninakuwabo endeshinganabo ni bamulindire kwa hika! Mwa kuli, anibabwira imwe, ninakuwabo uyo endeimbala ngimba sa mulimo, ni abirangirabo mbu bahike balye kwa biryo ni aikalaho ni atekulirabo. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Bameashanirwa abapfubulwabo mwa kianiro ninakuwabo endehika mu kati ka kiro neri bwaxondekya ni bakinakereresa.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />«Munamenya kushe ku nina nyumba angamenyire akashangi ka mwitsi angahikamo, nge atangasiire abetsi abo mbu batobole anyumba iwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Nemwe, munereikala ni amuianya, kubwishi ingye ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> nendehika mu kashangi ko mutamuanikira.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amupfuku yainihirwe na yatainihirwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Niyo Petero abutsa Yesu mbu: «Ninakuwetu, amushinga wo wamecha uyo, mbeni wametuchirao, neri wamechirao abandu boshe?»<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ninakuwetu nianaxubya mbu: «Inde ye mupfuku yangainihirwa na kandi awete bwenge? Mupfukwali ngoyo, ninakuwabo angamuira mwimanitsi wa nyumba iwe. Amupfuku uyo, iye, enderelamya abapfuku balikyabo nehabo bilyo mu kashangi kabyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ameashanirwa amupfuku uyo, yo ninakuwabo endeba afuluka, ni amushingana ni akinakola amulimo uyo! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Mwa kuli anibabwira mbu, ninakuwabo endeira amupfuku uyo yo mwimanitsi wa bitwe biwe byoshe.<verse eid="LUK 12:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />«Wetuwe, amukotsi uyo akeneena mwa mutima uwe mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu ameleama ifuluka.› Kubatyo nianatangira ihumbanga abapfuku balikyabo balume na bakatsi, nelya, nexoma, nepfao. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Ninakuwabo ni endehika mu lwire lwa mupfuku uyo ataanikire, na mu kashangi katechi. Niyo ninakuwabo endemukolera kubi kitsibu nemutsimba nga mundu yatangainihirwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />«Amupfuku yechi areshasha ra ninakuwabo, wetuwe aketinda iiringiriranya nekola nga ko ninakuwabo ashashire, ni endehumbwa ngonyi nyingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Wetuwe, amupfuku yatechi areshasha ra ninakuwabo, akekola kyokingatuma ahumbwa, uyo, iye, ni endehumbwa ngonyi nyike. Amupfuku yahabwaa bingi, endebutsibwa na bingi. Na yabikibwaa bingi kutsibu endebutsibwa bindu bingi kutsibu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ameleta amilikalikano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yesu niananeena kandi mbu: «Nahikaa iuma muchanwa kwa kihuo. Nangatsiire kutsibu ixunga amuchanwa uyo ni amekindewaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Niri na mutsio wa minubo wo nishushire iheka. Na kwikyo, aninuba kutsibu mwa mwete wani ihikira alwire lwa minubo iyo yendebererera.<verse eid="LUK 12:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />«Amuanikira mbu ingye nihikire ileta buholo kwa kihuo? Ihi! Milikalikano yonahikaa ileta. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ihuluka tsene, bandu batano ba nyumba nguma bendeabana, bashatu bendebaa babiri, na babiri bendebaa bashatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Na mwana wa butsana ne ishe bendelikalikana. Na mwananyere ne nina bendelikalikana. Na mwatsana ne netsala bendelikalikana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mika 7:6. </char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ixonchomola atulolero twa kianiro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu nianabwira amubuanano wa bandu mbu: «Mwa kashangi munerexunga kipfu ali akihuluka imalengetsuba, munabula mbu: ‹Ampfula ikawa.› Ampfula ni yanawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Na mwa kashangi amuyaa atoka ibunyetako, ni mwabula mbu: ‹Kukaba kyuka kingi›. Na kyuka ni kyanaba kingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Muli boshetulimi tubiri! Mwichi ilinganya akianiro kya kwa kihuo na kya mwa kyanya. Kubwishi bwaki mutangakocha ixonchomola abinwa byobitsuka mwa biro muno?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Areikiritsanya na mulenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Yesu niananeena kandi mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki mutangaichira lubancha lwa binwa bitunganene byo mushushirekola? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Mwa kashangi waenda iburana na mulenda wawe, ni waxonda kweungarongana naye ni mukinali mwa nchira yareya kwa kibu. Lutabere lutyo, ni akakusongera nekutwala ku mucha-mancha, na mucha-mancha uyo, ni akakutwala ku musura, na musura uyo, ni akakukabula mu nyumba ya muliki. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Anikubwira, ku ni utitenge umo utatsawapfuha alufaranga lutsindu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Amunguruko wa rehingya amicho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mwa kashangi umo, kuhika bandu bauma, bapfulirao Yesu kuluenda aBangalilaya bo Pilato aitisaa ni abatula Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Mbeni amuanikira mbu aBangalilaya abo baitwaa kubwishi ibo bo banabaa bakotsi ba ntsambi ilengya abandi Bangalilaya boshe? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ihi! Anibabwira ku nemwe <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">mutahingyitse amiberere</char> yenyu, ni mukendepfa ngakuno ibo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Mbeni, amuanikira ku abandu ikumi na munane bobapfaa ni bametererwa na nyumba nyire ye Silowamu, mbu bobabaa babi ilengya becha i Yerusalemu boshe? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ihi! Wetuwe anibabwira, nemwe, mutahingyitse amiberere yenyu, ni mwendepfa mwe boshe ngakuno ibo.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa muti wateko bipfuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Na kandi Yesu nianachirabo amushinga uyu mbu: «Mundu muuma abaa ahingire muti wa tini mwexwa liwe ra <char style="w" lemma="Musabibu">misabibu</char>. Lwire luuma nianahika kwexondako bipfuma. Mu xumo nyibi atabonekyakoki. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Kubwishi bwekyo, nianabwira mukotsi uwe wa rexwa iro mbu: ‹Utatsene! Myaka ishatu iyi ni aninahika hano kwexonda bipfuma kwa muti uku, ni ndanibonekyakoki. Kondao, kubwishi abihya amutaka wo busha.› <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Wetuwe, amukotsi uyo nianaxubya mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu, tangawalikao kandi amwaka unoho, nikashekererao, neongerera mutaka muinu mwa kisina kyao. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Kuti anganendehetako bipfuma kwa mwaka wahika. Na ali atahetireko bipfuma, niyo wabula mbu akondwe.›»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mukatsi mu lwire lwa Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lwire luuma lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>, Yesu abaa ni aiisa mu <char style="w">sinakoki</char>. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Nomo ni muli mukatsi muuma. Amukatsi uyo abaa amebanda myaka ikumi na munane ni aundirwe na kixwatsi. Akixwatsi ikyo ni kyamemuonda amuongo, naye ni atangakikocha iindamuka kiro na hake. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu abere amuxunga, nianamubirangira, amubwira mbu: «We mukatsi iwe, wamelamibwa abukoni bwawe!» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Niyo Yesu amuhirako asaminwe. Mwa kashangi umo, amukatsi uyo nianaindamuka, aba nesingya Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Wetuwe, <char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">amukulukulu wa sinakoki</char>, iye, atsibuka kubwishi Yesu ni amelamya mundu mu lwire lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>. Nianabwira amubuanano woshe mbu: «Mutahabire ku mweinga munaba biro ndatu bya mulimo. Kunchi, munerehika ilamibwa mo biromo, wetuwe ni mute mwa lwire lwa Sabato.» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Wetuwe, Ninakuwetu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Muli boshetulimi tubiri! Mbeni kintsi muuma mwimwe atanaabula anga iwe neri apunda iwe kwa kisibo mu lwire lwa Sabato kweya ilisayo mechi? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Eono, kwa mukatsi uyu naye, wa mwa lubuto lwa Iburahimu amebanda myaka kumi na munane ni aminirwe ne Shitani. Mbeni nge naye atanganaminulwa mu lwire lwa Sabato?»<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yesu abere ameneena atyo, aboshe bobabaa abakubirisanya naye baxubuka. Wetuwe, abandu boshe bobabaa mwa mubuanano, ibo bamoa kubwishi bwa binwa bibuya kutsibu bwabaa erekola.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashushani ya bwami bwa Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu nianaxubeneena mbu: «<char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">aBwami bwa Ongo</char> bushushireki? Nikashushanyabo naki? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Bushushene na kaheke ka haratali, ko mundu muuma ayaa ibiba mwa ixwa liwe. Akaheke ako kaxuka, kabinduka muti munene, na sanyonyi sitoka mwa kyanya, sihimba asanyutu sato mwa ndabi sao.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu axubeneena kandi mbu: «Nikalinganya <char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">aBwami bwa Ongo</char> naki? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Bushushene na <char style="w">chachu</char> ya mukatsi muuma atsimbaa, nianahirayo hauma na bilo makumi abiri na bitano bya shano ya ngano, nayo ikaka.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alutsi lwa mwa bwami bwa Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-22">21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu, abere ali ya urukira i Yerusalemu, nianatsuka mu milungu na mu mitsi ni aiisa. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mundu muuma amubutsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, mbeni bandu bakeho bo bendeufulwa?» Yesu amuxubitsa mbu: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Munereitsibuhiritsa kweingira mwa lukyo lupfunda. Kubwishi, anibabwira imwe, ku bandu bangi bendexonda iingira mulo, wetuwe batendekocha.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Mwa kashangi nina anyumba endebatuka nekinga alutsi, imwe mwendeimana hambua ni amukongota nebula mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu, utukingulire.› Naye endebaxubitsa mbu: ‹Ndechi homutenga!› <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Nemwe mwendetangira ineena mbu: ‹Esi! Tutalyaa nexoma kuuma nawe? Wabaa neiyisa mwa mitanga ya mwa mitsi yetu?› <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Wetuwe, naye endebaxubitsa mbu: ‹Ndechi ha mutenga. Mutengeho, mo bakotsi ba ntsambi!›<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />«Mo lwire umo, mwendexunga Iburahimu ne Isake, ne Yakobo na <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> boshe, mwa <char style="w">Bwami bwa Ongo</char>, wetuwe imwe, ni mwamekabulwa hambuwa. Aho, homwendelira neshiya meno. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Abandu bendetenga mwa Mahuluke-tsuba na i Malenge-tsuba, ne i bunya-luulu na bunye-tako ni baya mwa linye ra Bwami bwa Ongo. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Muumpfe! Bandu bauma mwa batsindu bendeba baxondotsi, na baxondotsi bendeba batsindu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu airirikana kubwishi bwa mulungu we Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mwa kashangi umo ho, <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> bauma bahikira Yesu, ba mubwira mbu: «Uitokere hano, uye handi, kubwishi mwami Herote axonda ikuitisa.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Wetuwe Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Shamubwire amuterere uyo mbu nikinahentsa abixwatsi nelamya abakoni munolwire na mungya. Na mwa bwakya mo nendemaliritsa amulimo wani. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Nishushire iba ku luendo munolwire na mungya, na mwa bwakya, kubwishi <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">amutahwa</char> atangaitirwa handi, iri ite i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Mo becha i Yerusalemu, mo becha i Yerusalemu! <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">Abatahwa</char> na bandu be Ongo amebatumira mo munaitabo mu ikabulabo mabale! Namexonda ibabuanyanya ngendo nyingi, ngakuno kwa ngoko inabuanyanya abwalutse mwa bibaba byayo. Wetuwe, mutinda! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Muumpfe! Anyumba yenyu yeshiba mushaka. Anibabwira, imwe, mutikiendenixunga kandi ihikira kashangi ko mwendeneenamo mbu: ‹Asingibwe ya hika mwe tsina ra Ninakuwetu.›»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya mukoni mu lwire lwa Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Mu lwire luuma lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char>, Yesu nianaingira mu nyumba ya mukulukulu muuma wa <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> kwelya biryo. Abandu bobabaa bali mwa nyumba umo niabanasita Yesu yo mesha kwelola ngakuno akakolaki. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Tsene, na mwa mbere sa Yesu ni muli mundu muuma ahahire amubiri. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu nianabutsa <char style="w" lemma="beyisa ba Muomba">abeyisa ba Muomba</char> na Bafarisayo mbu: «Kuluenda aMuomba wetu, mbeni atuhere rubu neri ihi, ilamya mundu mu lwire lwa Sabato?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Wetuwe niabanaitsirira. Tsene, Yesu nianapfula kwa mukoni uyo, nemulamya, nianamubwira mbu iendere. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Yesu nianabutsabo kandi mbu: «Inde mwimwe amwana uwe neri anga iwe ingaba iketoera mu kiribu, mbeni angatinda ilibita itosayomo chuba nakiro mbu mu lwire lwa Sabato?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Batakocha imuxubitsa kinwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Areiurukya na reihohya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu nianakengula kwa bandu bobabaa balalikirwe abaixoa abipfumbi bya ira buxondotsi. Kubwishi bwekyo, ni yahanabo mu mushinga mbu: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Mwa kashangi mundu mulebe akekulalika mu buheruki ni utiereikala kwa bipfumbi bya ira buxondotsi. Kubwishi mwa bandu bo balalikirwe mungaba mundu yapfirwe xoni ikulengya. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Amundu yapfirwe xoni uyo akehika, yashabalalika mwe babiri, ni akakubwira mbu: ‹Siira amundu uyu yo buali.› Aho, ni ukaxubuka kweya ikala kwa kipfumbi kye ira nyuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Wetuwe mwa mango wamelalikwa, ni waikala kwa kipfumbi kye ira nyuma. Kubwishi mwa kashangi yashakulalika akahika ni akakubwira mbu: ‹Mwirani, ipfunde ira buxondotsi ino.› Aho, ni ukapfibwa xoni na bandu boshe bo balya kuuma nawe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kureba kintsi mundu yandaiurukya, yakendekimibwa. Wetuwe yandaihohya iye, yakendeurukibwa.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianabwira amundu yashamulalika mbu: «Mwa mango auteka bilyo bya linye, bibe bya mu kati ka mwishi, neri bya mu luoloolo, ni utilalikeho bera bawe, neri banyakyenyu, neri ababuti bawe, neri abahuwenwe bawe baxoki. Kwebula mbu nabo bangendekulalika ni waba nga wamefulukitsibwa byo wakoleraabo. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Wetuwe mwa mango auteka biryo bya linye, ni werelalika abachene, na birema na bo baxuneera, na bihumamahumi. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Batyo, ni ukaashanirwa, kubwishi abandu abo batawete kyo bangakufulukitsa. Ongo endekupfuha mwa mango endepfukya abandu bo banakola byo bitunganene.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa linye ra mwa bwami bwa Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Mundu muuma mu bobabaa abalya kuuma ne Yesu, abere ahulikya abinwebyo, nianabwira Yesu mbu: «Ameashanirwa amundu yakendelya kwa mbia ya mwa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char>!»<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa itsukira amushinga uyu mbu: «Mundu muuma atekaa biryo bingi bya linye nelalika bandu bangi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Akashangi ka relya kabere kaeraho, nianalika amupfuku uwe kwebwira babaa amelalika mbu: ‹Muhike, tsene abindu byoshe byaharaho.› <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Wetuwe aboshe abo, kintsi muuma mubo nianatangira ineena kyo kituma atahika. Amubere nianamubwira mbu: ‹Nameula ixwa, nishushire itangularo. Anikuhema unishashire.›<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />«Na undi naye nianabula mbu: ‹Naulaa bimasa ikumi bye nikerekolesa kwehinga, naya ierekabyo nga bingakola. Anikuhema unishashire.› <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Na undi kandi nianabula mbu: ‹Nikinali mwa kiutu. Kubwishi bwekyo, ndangahika.›<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />«Amupfuku uyo abere afuluka nianapfulira ninakuwabo abinwa byoshe ibyo. Aho, ninakuwabo abere aumpfa abinwa ibyo, nianatsibuka. Nianabwira amupfuku uwe mbu: ‹Enda chuba mwa mbua na mwa mitanga ya mwa mulungu, nge waniletera muno abachene, na birema na bihumamahumi, na bo baxuneera.› <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Inyuma kwaho, amupfuku nianafuluka nebula mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu, byoshaunikalihya, namekolabyo. Wetuwe, hakinali buali›.<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />«Niyo ninakuwabo abwira amupfuku uyo mbu: ‹Uye mwa nchira sa mwa bihya na sa mwa mikiki ya maxwa. Abandu boukatimana, unamingabo mbu baingire mwa mwani nge anyumba yani yauchula. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku hatali kiro na muuma mu bonalalikaa yakendelya kwa mbia yani!›»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Areimitsa Yesu nesiya abyoshe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lwire luuma, bandu bangi niabanaenda kuuma ne Yesu. Nianakebera, nebwirabo mbu: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Amundu ali axonda inikulikira ni anitsiyira ilengya ishe, ne nina, ne mukatsi uwe, na bana bewe, na baala babo, na bali babo. Na kandi ni anitsiyira ilengya abuingo buwe. Atakolire atyo, ni atangaba <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">mwimitsa</char> wani. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Na yatangaheka amusalaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yatangaheka amusalaba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Luka 9:23.</char></note> uwe nenikulikira, atalirene iba mwimitsa wani.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />«Mwa mango mundu muuma mwimwe axondehimba nyumba nyire, ni angaikere kasa kwelola ngakuno angabonekya bitwe byakakola nabyo kwekinda amulimo uyo. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Wetuwe, ali angahimba amusingi nefundwa iuchutsa anyumba iyo, aho abandu boshe bo bakerexunga anyumba iyo ni bakeremusheka mbu: <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />‹Amundu uyu atangiraa ihimba nyumba iyi, wetuwe amelemwa iuchutsayo!›<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />«Mwa mango mwami mulebe axonda ilwa bita na undi mwami, ni sashushire iikala kasa kwelola ngakuno kuuma na basura bewe bihumbi ikumi angalwa nehima aundi mwami ya hika na basura bihumbi makumi abiri. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Akexunga ku atangalwa na mwami mulikyabo uyo, angamulikako ndumwa akinali hale kwexonda nchira ya buholo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Nemwe kwonoko, hatali mundu mwimwe yangaba <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">mwimitsa</char> wani ali atangasia abyoshe byaraweteko.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amunyu waratalaitse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Yesu niananeena kandi mbu: «Amunyu kindu kibuya. Wetuwe, amunyu ni angaba akehetsa abuloke bwao, ni mungahirwaki kandi kwebula mbu atwe? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Amunyu uyo, ni atakilaitse kwa butaka na kwa mboleo. Analekerwa hambuwa. Yawete matwi meumpfa, aumpfe!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa mbuli yo yaheraa iboneka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lwire luuma, abafutishi ba koli na bandi bakotsi ba ntsambi aboshe niabanaipfunda hofi ne Yesu kweumpfa byaneena. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">aBafarisayo</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">beisa ba Muomba</char> niabanabubula mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amundu uyu akokera abakotsi ba santsambi nelya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa Bayahuti, mundu abaa anahala akelya ku biryo bya mundu ahalire. </char></note> kuuma nabo?»<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Kubwishi bwekyo, Yesu nianachirabo amushinga'yu mbu: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Inde mwimwe, ni angaba ali na mbuli iana, akehetsamo nguma, mbeni atangasia alwenda na mwenda kwa bisibo neya ixonda ambuli nguma yo iherire ihikira akishangi kyakendebonekyayo? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Amebonekyayo ni ahekayo mu lumoo kwa bitio biwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Na mwehika liwe ira ka, ni akongya bera bewe na bahuwene bewe, ni abwirabo mbu: ‹Mumoe kuuma nani, kureba ambuli yani yoyaheraa, namebonekyayo.› <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Anibabwira ku Ongo na bamalaika baneremoa kubwishi bwa mukotsi muuma wa ntsambi, <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">yamehingya amiberere</char> iwe, irengya bandu lwenda na mwenda bo baixunga ku batunganene, bo batakiri na muhita wehingya amiberere yabo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa kichere kyo kyaheraa kiboneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Neri, uhe mukatsi yangaba ali na bichere biwe ikumi bya faranga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">bichere biwe ikumi bya faranga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa bianiro bya Yesu, kichere kiuma kya faranga kyabaa mushahara wa mubitsi muuma wa mulimo.</char></note>, akehetsamo kiuma, mbeni atangawakya aretala nebitsa anyumba nexonderetsakyo kushe ihikira akishangi kya kabonekyakyo? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Na mwa mango amebonekyakyo, ni abirangira aberakatsi bewe na bahuwenwe bewe nebwirabo mbu: ‹Mumoe kuuma nani, kubwishi akichere kyani kyo kyaheraa namebonekyakyo!› <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Anibabwirandya, ku na <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">bamalaika</char> ba Ongo baneremoa mwa kashangi mukotsi muuma ho wa ntsambi, <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">anahingya amiberere</char> iwe.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa mwana yaheraa aboneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu nianaxube chirabo amushinga uyu mbu: «Kwabaa mulume muuma, ni awete ku baala bewe babiri. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Amulere mubo nianabwira ishe mbu: ‹Tata, unihe amuhango wani wa mwandu wa kwa bitwe byawe.› Ishe nianaabira baala babiri abitwe biwe.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />«Kwabere kwametsuka biro bike, amulere uyo, nianautsa amwandu uwe nianaya mu kihuo kya hale. Iyo, nianaba'yo mu nchira sa buxuma nemala abitwe biwe byoshe. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Abere amemala abitwe biwe byoshe, mwa kihuo umo niamunatoa bulio butsibu ihikira mu luero lwetangira ihusha kangatoetsa mwa nda. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Kubwishi bwekyo, nianaya ikolera mundu muuma wa mwa kihuo umo. Amundu uyo nianamutuma mwa maxwa mewe kwelanga ngulube.<figure style="fig" alt="l'enfant prodigue gardé les cochons" file="DN00484b.tif" size="span" ref="15:15">Amwana yaheraa alanga biololo</figure> <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Amutabana uyo, abaa anaxumira ilya kwa bixuu bya sangulube<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ngulube: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwa Bayahuti angulube kipfuano kibi, batalyayo, ne ata kuyo. Xoni kutsibu kwa Muyahuti kwe pfua ngulube.</char></note> sinalya. Wetuwe, ni batatsiya mbu alye kubyo.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />«Kubwishi bwekyo, nianatangira iibubukya mbu: ‹Oho! Abakotsi ba tata banashata mwa biryo, wetuwe ingye hano anchala yanikonola. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nikafuluka ira mwa tata nemubwira mbu: “Tata, <char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">nakolire ntsambi</char> mwa mbere sa Ongo na mwa mbere sawe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ndangakilukwa kandi mbu ndi muala wawe. Tsene, uniire ngakuno muuma wa mwa bakotsi bawe.”›<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />«Amutabana uyo, nianabatuka, nianafuluka ira mwa ishe. Abere akinali hale hake na mwa mwabo, ishe nianamuxunga aba nemupfira boncho bungi. Nianamulibitira nemukokera. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Wetuwe muala amubwira mbu: ‹Tata <char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">nakolire ntsambi</char> mwa mbere sa Ongo na mwa mbere sawe. Kubwishi bwekyo, ndangakilukwa mbu ndi muala wawe.› <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Wetuwe, ishe nianabwira abakotsi bewe mbu: ‹Mulete chuba kantsu kabuya kutsibu, mube nemuimbakyako. Mumuimbakye kashee kwa mwolota na bilyato kwa bishando. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Mube neleta anyana yo inunire muiteyo nge twakolamo linye, nemoa. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kubwishi muala wani uyu abaa ni apfire, wetuwe amepfuka. Abaa ni aherire, wetuwe ameboneka.› Niabanatangira ikola linye.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Mwa kashangi umo afula ya mundu uyo yabaa ni ikinali mwa maxwa. Mwefuluka liwe, abere ahara hofi na mutsi, nianaumpfa kwa ngoma aixumbira na kwa bandu abatsina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Nianabirangira muuma mwa bakotsi nemubutsa, kyo kiri iyo. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Amukotsi nianamuxubitsa mbu: ‹Mulumuna wawe amehika. Ne ixo ameita anyana yo inunire, kubwishi amexunga muala ni mukambwe.›<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />«Amutabana uyo, nianatsibuka aba netinda iingira mwa nyumba. Ishe nianahuluka kweitondoola kuye mbu aingire mwa nyumba. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Muala nianamuxubitsa mbu: ‹Umpfa, myaka mingi yametsuka ni anikukolera butsira itenguha mateeko mawe. Naho utatangire waniha kiro na kihalabute mbu nikole mukyo mo linye na bera bani. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Wetuwe mwa kashangi muala wawe uyu yamalaa abitwe byawe mwa lusingi amehika, iye wamemwitira anyana yo inunire.›<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />«Ishe nianamuxubitsa mbu: ‹We mwanani, unaba kuuma nani abiro byoshe, na byoshe byoniweteko, binaba byawe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Shatunashushire ikola linye nemoa, kureba muala wenyu uyu abaa ni apfire, wetuwe amepfuka. Abaa ni aherire, wetuwe ameboneka.›»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa mwimanitsi mukalange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu nianachira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe amushinga uyu mbu: «Kwabaa muxoki muuma, naye ni ali na mwimanitsi wa bitwe biwe. Lwire luuma abandu niabanaya isongera amwimanitsi uyo ira mwa ninakuwabo mbu ashanchashancha abitwe biwe. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Niyo amuxoki uyo, abirangira amwimanitsi uyo, nemubutsa mbu: ‹Mbeni mwatsiki wo nerekuhulikyako? Tsene, utikibe mwimanitsi wa bitwe byani. Kubatyo, kola amuancho wabyo.›<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />«Amwimanitsi uyo nianaibwira mwa mutima uwe mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu uyu axondenitengya kwa mulimo. Ngairande? Areyehinga ndangakocharo, na rehemeretsa naro nikapfiraro xoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ahaa! Namemenya kyo nikakola mwa kashangi nikatengibwa kwa mulimo kwebula mbu niyo abandu bangerenikokera mwa manyumba mabo!›<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />«Amwimanitsi uyo, nianabirangira kintsi mundu yabaa aliko mwinda wa ninakuwabo. Nianabutsa amuxondotsi mbu: ‹Uliko mwinda wa binduki bya ninakuwetu?› <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Nianamuxubitsa mbu: ‹Niriko mwinda wa ngunguru iana sa mapfuta.› Amwimanitsi uyo, nianamubwira mbu: ‹Ikala hashi, leta chuba amaruba mawe ma mwinda, andikako makumi atano.›<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />«Inyuma kwaho, nianabutsa aundi mbu: ‹Naweno, uliko mwinda wa binduki bya ninakuwetu?› Nianaxubya mbu: ‹Niriko mwinda wa mifuko iana ya ngano.› Amwimanitsi uyo, nianamubwira mbu: ‹Leta amaruba mawe ma mwinda andikako lunane.›<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />«Kubatyo ninakuwabo nianasima amwimanitsi mubi uyo kubwishi akolaa mu bwenge. Kureba, abandu ba kihuo kino banerekola abindu byabo mu bukalange kutsibu kwetunganyanya abinwa byabo na balikyabo irengya abandu ba kyaka.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu nianaxuba ineena mbu: «Nani anibabwira mbu munerekolesa abitwe bya bitingo bya kwa kihuo kino kwenyana mubyo. Kubwishi bwekyo, byendeba byamehwa ni mwendekokerwa mwa bwikalo bwa biro byoshe.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />«Na mundu woshewoshe yangainihirwa mu bindu bike kutsibu, yanganaxube inihirwa mu bindu bingi. Na kintsi mundu yatangaba mubi mu bindu bike, niatanganaba na mubi mu bindu bingi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ku batyo, imwe muli mutangainihirwa mwa bitwe bya bitingo bya kihuo kino, inde ni yakendebaha abitwe bya kuli? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Muli mutainihirwa kwelanga bindu bya undi mundu, hatali mundu yangabaha byenyu.<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Hatali mukotsi yangakocha ikolera bo ninakuwabo babiri, ni akabaa muuma netsiyira aundi. Neri ni akanaba ku munda wa muuma nenena aundi. Mutangakocha ikolera Ongo nekolera bitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu axubitsa aBafarisayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mwa mango <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">aBafarisayo</char> babere bali yobaumpfa abinwa byoshe byo Yesu abaa aneena, beremunena kubwishi ni banatsiira abitwe kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Imwe munaxonda iibwerekya mwa mbere sa bandu ku mo mutunganene mwa mbere sabo. Wetuwe Ongo anamenya amitima yenyu. Kureba kya bandu abaxunga ku kibuya mwa mbere sabo, Ongo, iye, anabaakyo kutsibu.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />«<char style="w" lemma="Muomba">aMuomba</char> wa Musa na Bitabo bya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char>, byabaaho ihikira akianiro kya Yohana Murubiki. Ihuluka akianiro ikyo, aMwatsi Mubuya wa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char> wanapfulwa. Na kintsi mundu anaihangana kweingira mwa Bwami ubo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Wetuwe, lichire chuba ambingu na kihuo kwesintsibana, wetuwe kwa Muomba kutendetoka kiro na ndomo nguma.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«Amulume akesiyana ne mukatsi uwe, nehikya undi ni asingira. Na yashahikya amukatsi yashahentsibwa na mulume uwe naye ni asingira.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuxoki ne Lasaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yesu nianacha kandi undi mushinga mbu: «Kwabaa muxoki muuma ni anereimbala ngimba sikwirire, na sa kichiro kinene. Nianaba mu mukene abiro byoshe. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ni hali na muchene muuma aretsina liwe ni ye Lasaro. Ne Lasaro uyo, amubiri uwe woshe ni auchwire binyoho. Na kandi ni ereonchitsibwa halukyo lwa muxoki uyo. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Abaa anerexumira ilya ku byobitoanga kwa mesa ma muxoki uyo. Asambwa nato serehika kwekombakomba abinyoho biwe.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />«Lwire luuma, Lasaro nianapfa. <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">Abamalaika</char> bahika, bamutwala mu mbingu hofi ne Iburahimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Luka 13:28.</char></note>. Na muxoki naye nianapfa, niabanamuta. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Abere ali yanuba kutsibu mwa i kutsimu, nianabatula mesha mewe, axunga Iburahimu hale naye ne Lasaro ni ali hamusike kuye. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Nianailakira mbu: ‹Eh tata Iburahimu, Unipfire bwoncho! Aninuba kutsibu mwa muchanwa muno. Unitumire Lasaro atobetse amutwe wa mwolota uwe mwa mechi anitoetse itondi linibobole alulimi.›<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />«Wetuwe, Iburahimu nianamuxubitsa mbu: ‹We mwana wani, iwe, ubuka ku mwa buingo bwawe wabaa muxoki kutsibu, ne Lasaro ni ali bulio. Tsene, Lasaro iye, achirwa mikocho, nawe aunuba. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Na kandi, hakati ketu nemwe hali kiribu kire. Kubwishi bwekyo, bobali hotuli ino munda, bali abaxonda iya yomuli, litsibu. Na bobali yomuli, nabo litsibu kwehika hano hotuli.› <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Amuxoki nianabwira Iburahimu mbu: ‹Unishashire, tata Iburahimu, lika Lasaro mwa mwetu. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Ko niwete baala betu batano, aende yatonderebo, nabo batangechehika ahandu ha minubo hano.› <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Wetuwe, Iburahimu nianamuxubitsa mbu: ‹Baala benyu bawete kwa Bitabo bya Musa na bya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> kwetonderabo. Banereumpfa ngakuno ko bibwire.› <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Amuxoki aneena mbu: ‹Ihi, mbe tata Iburahimu ikyo kyonakyene kitalingirirene. Wetuwe, ali mupfu muuma angaba akepfuka neya yo bali, <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">bangahingya amiberere</char> yabo.›<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />«Wetuwe, Iburahimu amuxubitsa mbu: ‹Baala benyu bali batahulikitse ko abitabo bya Musa na bya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> bibwire, ni batangaimirira mundu nakiro mbu shatoka mwa bapfu.›»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aiisa kuluenda asantsambi na sashashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mar 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu nianabwira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe mbu: «Abinwa byaretsitatsa abandu kwekola ntsambi, bikanenderebaho. Wetuwe, alyae amundu yangaletabyo. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Kyangakwirire amundu uyo aminwe lushyo lunene mweosi, nekabulwa mwa nyancha kwebula mbu atasheeretsaa muuma mwa balere aba ikola ntsambi.<verse eid="LUK 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />«Kunchi, munakohya! Munyakyenyu akekola bubi, ni wamukemera. Naye <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">akehingya amiberere</char> iwe, ni wamushashira. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Naye akekukolera kubi ngendo sirinda mu lwire luuma, na akekuhikira ngendo sirinda kwekuhema shashi, ni wamushashira.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aiisa kuluenda abwimire</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:19-20">Mat 17:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Lwire luuma, <char style="w" lemma="Ndumwa">asandumwa</char> sibwira Ninakuwetu mbu: «Waliha, utuongerere abwimire.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Ninakuwetu nianaxubya mbu: «Muli mwangabere na bwimire buke, bungana nga mbeke ya haratali, mwangabwirire amuti uyu mbu: ‹Uikule neibyala mwa nyancha.› Nao ni akakola nga ko shamubwirao.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amupfuku ashushire ikolera ninakuwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yesu nianaxube bwirabo mbu: «Mundu muuma mwimwe angawata ku mupfuku uwe yamuhingira neri yamusumbira kihyo. Mwa mango amupfuku uyo amefuluka mwexwa, mbeni ninakuwabo angamubwira mbu wiche chuba ulye? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ihi! Ni akamubwira mbu: ‹Unitekere bilyo, ube neimbala alukimba lwawe lolukwirire, niyo wanitekulira, ihikira akashangi kenikalira nexoma. Neba nameotola ilya, nawe niyo walya nexoma.› <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Mbeni amupfuku uyo, ninakuwabo akamusima kubwishi amekola nga ko shamukalihya? Ihi! <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Nemwe kwonoko: mwamekola abyoshe byo Ongo shabakalihya mbu mukole, ni mwerebula mbu: ‹Itwe tuli bapfukuho, byotwamekola, byoshatunalirene ikola.›»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya babentsi ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Mwa kashangi Yesu abaa aya i Yerusalemu, nianatsuka mwa kihati kya kyango kye Samariya ne Ngalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Abere axondeingira mu mutsi muuma, babentsi ikumi baya ikorana naye. Niabanaimana hale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwe kulikira ku aMuomba wa Musa abwire, amundu ali abembire, ni atashushire iipfunda hofi na bandi bandu bo batabembire. Soma Balawi 13:45-46.</char></note> naye, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />nelehya amirenge mbu: «Yesu, Ninakuwetu, utupfire bwoncho!»<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesu abere amexungabo, nianabwirabo mbu: «Muende, shamuyibwerekye kwa <char style="w" lemma="bakungu ba hekalu">bakungu ba hekalu</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Balawi 14:2-3.</char></note>» Nabo babere bakinali mwa nchira ya reyayo, niabanakomibwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Muuma mubo abere amexunga ku amelama nianafuluka ira nyuma ni asingya Ongo mu mulenge mule. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Amundu uyo abaa <char style="w" lemma="Basamariya">Musamariya</char>. Nianapfukama na busu hashi mwa mbere sa Yesu, nianamusima. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Aho, Yesu nianabula mbu: «Mbeni bate ababentsi ikumi boshanikomya! Abandi mwenda, bali hai? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Hatali kiro mundu muuma mubo ya mefuluka kwesima Ongo, ali ate amundu uyu yate Muyahuti?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Niyo Yesu abwira aMusamariya uyo mbu: «Batuka, uende, abwimire bwawe bwamekuufula.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arehika ra bwami bwa Ongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">aBafarisayo</char> babutsa Yesu mbu: «<char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">abwami bwa Ongo</char>, bukendehika mangoki?» Yesu axubitsabo mbu: «abwami bwa Ongo butendehika ngakuno kindu kitsenweko. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Abandu batendeneena mbu: ‹Bo buno buli hano!› neri ‹Bo bulaa buli halaa.› Mumenyae, ku abwami bwa Ongo ubo bwahara buli mwa kati kenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Na kandi, Yesu nianabwira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe mbu: «Kwehika biro byo mukalaa inixungako ingye, ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> na munabe na mu lwire luuma, wetuwe ni mutinixungeko. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Abandu bendebabwira mbu: ‹Tamulole, kwali halaa!› Neri: ‹Tamulole, kwali hano!› Wetuwe, ni mutiyeyo, ni mutibe neimitsabo. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kureba, ingye, ngye Muala wa Mundu nendeba nafuluka, nendexungwa ngakuno kwa kisherya kinerexungwa kwa mbingu nekoletsa kwa kihuo kyoshe. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Wetuwe, nishushire ninatanga na nubibwa lingi netindwa na bandu ba kianiro kino.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />«Nga ko byabaa mwa kianiro kya Noa, ko bikanendexubeba mwa kashangi ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> nendebanafuluka. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Mwa kianiromo, abandu babaa banerelya nexoma, babaa banaherukya neheruka, ihikira mwa lwire lo Noa aingiraa mwa mashuwa. Inyuma kwaho, niakunatsuka ngukutsi, niainaotola abandu boshe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ndangiro 6:9–7:24</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />«Ko lukanendeba lutyo ngakuno ko lwabaa mwa kianiro kya Loti. Abandu babaa banerelya nexoma, ni banereula neutsa, ni banerehinga nehimba. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Wetuwe, mwa lwire lwe Loti atokaa mwa mulungu we Sotoma, Ongo awisamo muchanwa ali ngakuno mpfula ya lutwa aitoka mu mbingu. Amuchanwa uyo, aotolaa abandu boshe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Ndangiro 18:20-33; 19:1-25.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Batyo ko lukanendaba mwa lwire ingye, ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> nikendefuluka.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />«Mo lwire umo, yakendeba kwa muutu wa nyumba iwe, ni atikikime kwebingamo abindu biwe. Na yakendeba mwexwa ni atikifuluke kwa mutsi kandi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Muubuke byo byahikiraa muka Loti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ongo abwiraa Loti ne mwichemwe mbu bashae amulungu we Sotomo mo babaa bali, nibatikebere iranyuma. Wetuwe, amukatsi wa Loti akebera iranyuma mwa kashangi babaa abashaa kubwishi abaa aanikira abindu byabaa amesiyamo. Ongo amuchira kihano kye mubindula ngutso ya munyu. Soma Ndangiro 19:26.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Ula yakaxonda iufula abuingo buwe, endehetsabo. Wetuwe, ula yakendehetsabo, endeufulabo. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Anibabwira imwe, mwe kiro umo, bandu babiri bendeba ni baonchire hauma, muuma endehekwa na undi endesiwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bakatsi babiri bendeba ni abashera hauma, muuma endehekwa, na undi endesiwa. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Bandu babiri bendeba ni abakolera mwixwa, muuma endehekwa, na undi endesiwa.]»<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Abemitsa ba Yesu, bamubutsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, abinwa ibi byendebererera hai?» Nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Hakipfu kinaba, aho hasantsu sinatumana.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa muchamancha na muxumbakatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianachira abemitsa bewe amushinga uyu, kwebwerekyabo ku bashushire ihema Ongo abiro byoshe butsira itama. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Nianabula mbu: «Mu mulungu muuma mwabaa muchamancha. Amuchamancha uyo, ni ataubahire Ongo, ni atanapfire na mundu yo xoni. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Na mwa mulungu umo kandi, ni munaba muxumbakatsi muuma. Amuxumbakatsi uyo abaa muhanga weendera amunchamancha uyo, nemuhema mbu: ‹Unichire kushe alubancha lo ninaba nalo na mulenda wani.›<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />«Wetuwe, kutsuka biro bingi amuchamancha uyo ni atindire imunchiralo. Mwa ntsindiro, nianayibwira mwa mutima uwe mbu: ‹Ingye ndaubaha Ongo, ndapfa na mundu yo xoni. <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Wetuwe kwa muxumbakatsi uyu amenilungyalungya, nihera nikamuchira alubancha luwe lo kushe. Nikakola batyo, kubwishi ni yatikiendexuba hano kwenilungyalungya.›»<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Niyo, Ninakuwetu aneena mbu: «Muumpfe kushe kya muchamancha mubi aneena! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Abandu bo Ongo naye alondolaa, bobanamulirira kiro na mwishi, endechirabo lubancha lukwirire. Atendeba neleama kweasikyabo. <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Anibabwira, endechirabo lubancha chuba. Wetuwe, mwa kashangi <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> endefuluka, mbeni endetimana kwa kihuo kuno ni kuli bandu bobali na bwimire?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa Mufarisayo na muhoresi wa koli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Nianachirabo kandi amushinga uyu kubwishi bwa bandu bo baixunga ku baimirire netunganana mwa mbere sa Ongo, nesuntsuura abandi bandu mbu: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Lwire luuma, bandu babiri baya ihema Ongo mwa <char style="w" lemma="hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char>. Amuuma abaa <char style="w" lemma="Bafarisayo">Mufarisayo</char>, na undi ni mufutishi wa koli. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />aMufarisayo uyo, nianaimana nehematya mwa mutima uwe mbu: ‹Ongo, anikusima kubwishi nitali ngakuno abandi bandu. Ibo betsi, na babi, na basingitsi. Anikusima kandi kubwishi nitali ngakuno amufutishi wa koli uyu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ninakola mahemo meihangira ilya kabiri kweinga. Ninerekutula muhango muuma wekumi wa bitwe byani byoshe byo ninabonekya.›<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />«Wetuwe amufutishi wa koli, iye, nianaimana hale, atalinda iereka ibatula amesha kwelalamira mu mbingu. Nianaibandanga kwa kipfuba kubwishi bwa buyongwa nehema shashi mbu: ‹Ee Ongo, unipfire bwoncho, ngye mukotsi wa santsambi!›»<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yesu nianaxubebula mbu: «Anibabwira kwa muhoresi wa koli uyu, afulukaa mwamwe Ongo niamemuxunga nga mundu atunganene. Wetuwe aMufarisayo uyo, ihi. Kubwishi kintsi mundu yandaiurukya endekimibwa. Wetuwe yandaihohya, iye, endeurukibwa.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aashanira ncholyana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bandu bauma niabanaletera Yesu sinabe na sancholyana kwebula mbu ahire kuto asaminwe. <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">Abemitsa</char> bewe babere bamexunga batyo, niabanakemera abandu abo.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus accueille les petits enfants" file="WA03880b.tif" size="span" ref="18:15">Yesu akokera abana balere</figure> <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianabula mbu bamuletere abanabo. Nianabula kandi mbu: «Mulike abana bahike ho niri! Mutahangiraabo, kubwisi abandu bo bali ngakuno ibo, bo becha <char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">abwami bwa Ongo</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku yataangirire abwami bwa Ongo nga mwana, atibaingire mubo kiro na hake.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuxoki na buingo bwa biro byoshe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mukulukulu muuma nianabutsa Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa mubuya, nishushire ikolaki kwebula mbu nibe na buingo bwa biro byoshe?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki wameniluka mubuya? Hataba mundu mubuya ali ate Ongo yewene. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Uhabire kwa mateeko ma Ongo mabwire mbu: ‹Uteresingira, utereita, utereiba, uterebehera mundu, werepfa ababuti bawe bo xoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 20:12-16; Muubuko 5:16-20.</char></note>.›»<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Amundu uyo, nianaxubya mbu: «Amateeko moshe ayo, ninakola nga ko mabwire, ihuluka abwana bwani.»<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu abere aumpfatyo, nianamubwira mbu: «Ukinahushire kindu kiuma: Yauutse abyoshe byo uli nabyo, na bitwe bya bindu ibyo bikapfa, uabirebyo abachene. Ukeirotyo ni ukaba na buxoki mu mbingu. Inyuma kwaho, hika, unikulikire.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Wetuwe amundu uyo abere aumpfatyo, nianayongwa kutsibu kubwishi abaa muxoki kutsibu.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu abere amexunga ku ameyongwa kutsibu, niananeena mbu: «Litsibu kwa baxoki kweingira mwa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char>! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Litsibuhire kwa ngamiya kwetsuka mwa lisha ra nandi. Wetuwe, likaramire kandi kutsibu kwa muxoki kweingira mwa bwami bwa Ongo.»<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Na bandu bo bahulikyaa abinwebyo, niyo baneena mbu: «Alikye! Nende ni yangaufulwano?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu nianaxubya mbu: «Kya bandu batangakocha, Ongo, iye, angakochakyo.»<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Niyo Petero abula mbu: «Ninakuwetu lola, itwe twasiire abyoshe byo twabaa tuweteko nekukulikira!»<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Anibabwira mwa kuli, ku kintsi mundu akesia anyumba iwe, neri mukatsi uwe, neri baala babo, neri ababuti bewe, neri abana bewe, kubwishi bwa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char>, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />endebonekya bingi mwa kianiro kino akinali kwa kihuo. Na mwa biro byo byendehika, endehabwa abuingo bwa biro byoshe.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfula amwatsi wa repfa na repfuka liwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianaisiika na sandumwa siwe ikumi nebiri nianabwirato mbu: «Muumpfe! Twebano, twaurukira mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu. Mwa mulungu umo, mo mukabererera abyoshe bya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> baandikaa kubwishi bwa ingye, ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Nikahirwa mwa minwe sa bandu ba sindi nganda. Bakanisheka, nenikamba nenichirako mate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bendenihirako mihumbo nenita, na mwa lwire lwa kashatu nikapfuka.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Wetuwe, asandumwa sitamenyaa kwa binwa ibyo byabaa bibwire, kubwishi byabaa bibishirwe kubo. Niyo batamenya ku Yesu asimola kuluendaki.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamya kihumahumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Mwa mangomo Yesu abaa ahara hofi nehika kwa mulungu we Yeriko. Habaa mundu muuma ahumire ni aikere kwa musike wa nchira, ni ahemeretsa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Na mundu uyo, abere ahulikya amirenge ya muoba wa bandu bo batsuka, nianabutsa mbu: «Kiki kyono?» <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Yesu we Nasareti yatsuka.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Nianalehya amulenge mbu: «Yesu, Muala wa Ndauti, mpfire bwoncho!»<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Abandu bobabaa ira buxondotsi bamukemera mbu atsire. Wetuwe, iye, nianalengeretsa mwelehya amulenge mbu: «Muala wa Ndauti, mpfire bwoncho!»<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu nianatindira nebula mbu bamuletere amundu uyo. Abere aipfunda hofi, Yesu nianamubutsa mbu: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Auxonda mbu nikukolereki?» Naye nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu, anixonda mbu nixube nilole.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ne Yesu nianamubwira mbu: «Xubelola! Abwimire bwawe bwamekulamya.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Na mwa kashangi umomoho, amundu uyo nianaxubelola. Nianakulikira Yesu ni asingya Ongo. Na bandu boshe babere bamexunga kwikyo, nabo, basingya Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu achumbika mwa Sakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Mwa mango Yesu ahikaa mwa mulungu we Yeriko, abaa abalanganana muo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Na mwa mulungu umo, mwabaa muli mundu muuma ni analukwa mbu ye Sakayo. Sakayo uyo, abaa mukulukulu wa bahoresi ba koli, na kandi abaa muxoki. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Abaa axondelola nga Yesu yende. Wetuwe, kubwishi abaa mufi, niatangakocha imulolako kubwishi bwa mubuanano wa bandu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Nianalibitira ira buxondotsi. Nianauruka ku muti kwekocha ixunga ku Yesu, kubwishi mwa nchira umo ni mo Yesu akatsuka.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Mwa mango Yesu ahikaa ahandu aho, nianabatula amesha, nebwira Sakayo mbu: «Kima chuba, kubwishi nishushire ichumbika mwa mwawe munolwire.»<figure style="fig" alt="Zachee est monte sur un arbre pour qu'il voit Jesus" file="WA03891b.tif" size="span" ref="19:5">Sakayo aurukire ku muti kwelola ku Yesu</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Sakayo nianakima chuba, nianakokera Yesu mulumoo lunene.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Abandu boshe bo baxungaa kwa binwa ibyo, niabanatangira ineena mbu: «Oho! Amundu uyu ameya ichumbi mu nyumba ya mukotsi wa ntsambi!»<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Wetuwe, Sakayo nianaimana mwa mbere sa Ninakuwetu neneena mbu: «Umpfa Ninakuwetu! Nikaha abachene kiche kya kwa bitwe byani. Na niri na nyaaa mundu kindu mubuxuma, nikamufulukitsakyo kane.»<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Niyo Yesu amubwira mbu: «Munolwire Ongo ameufula abandu ba nyumba ino, kureba nawe uli wa mwa lubuto lwa Iburahimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kureba ingye, ngye, <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>, nahikaa kwexonda neufula bo baherire.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa bapfuku ikumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Abandu babaa bakinahulikya abinwa byo Yesu abaa aneena. Na kwabaa aharaxonda iingira mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu, abandu baanikira mbu <char style="w" lemma="bwami bwa Ongo">abwami bwa Ongo</char> bwahika mwa kashangi umo. Aho, Yesu nianaxube chirabo amushinga uyu mbu: <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />«Habaa murutsi muuma nianaenda mu kihuo mbinga kweimikwa nexubefuluka mwa kihuo kiwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Buxondotsi aende, nianabirangira bandu ikumi mwa bapfuku bewe. Nianaha kintsi mundu yo kichere kiuma kya noro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kichere: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">byabaa bitwe byobingakolerwa mibitsi'kumi.</char></note>, abanebwirabo mbu: ‹Mutunde mwa bitwe ibi ihikira lwire lwa refuluka rani.› <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Wetuwe, abandu ba mwa kihuo kiwe babaa bamubaire. Kubwishi bwekyo, bamukulikitsa bandu kwebula mbu batabamuxonda mbu abe mwami wabo.<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />«Wetuwe amurutsi uyo, nianaimikwa nefuluka mwa kihuo kiwe. Abere amefuluka, nianabula mbu bamubirangirire abapfuku bewe ikumi bahaa abitwe biwe kubwishi abaa axonda imenya amunguruko wo babonekyaa.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />«Amupfuku mubere nianahika aneena mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu, akichere kyowanihaa naungurukaa mukyo mo bichere ikumi.› <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Ninakuwabo nianamubwira mbu: ‹Wamekola kushe! Uli mupfuku mubuya. Ko wabaa mundu we inihirwa mu bindu bike, nakuira mukulukulu wa milungu ikumi.›<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />«Amupfuku wa kabiri naye nianahika aneena mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu, akichere kyo wanihaa naungurukaa mukyo mo bichere bitano.› <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Ninakuwabo nianamubwira mbu: ‹Nawe, nakuira mwimanitsi wa milungu itano.›<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />«Inyuma kwaho, na undi naye nianahika niananeena mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu, akichere kyawe kyeki! Nabishaakyo mu mutete wa lukimba. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nabaa nikuubahire, kubwishi unaba mundu mutsibu. Iwe uneretsimba byoutabikaa, na kandi unerexola byo utabyalaa.› <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Ninakuwabo nianamubwira mbu: ‹Iwe uli mupfuku mubi! Nekuchira lubancha kweimitsanya na mineenere yawe. Wamenyaa kwingye niri mundu mutsibu, nineretola kyo ndabikaa, nexola kyo ndabyalaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kubwishi bwaki utahiraa abitwe byani mu nyumba yelangiramo bitwe? Na mwefuluka rani nge nikatengyabyomo na munguruko wabyo!›<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />«Niyo amwami uyo abwira abandu bobabaa bali aho mbu: ‹Amupfuku uyu, mumunyae abitwe ibyo, nehabyo yarali na bichere ikumi!› <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Niabanamubwira mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu, ulaa ahara awete ku bichere ikumi!› <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Ninakuwabo uyo niananeena mbu: ‹Anibabwira ku yawete ku kindu, yakendehabwa kindi. Wetuwe, yataweteki edenyawa na kairembire iba nako. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Wetuwe, abalenda bani bobataxondaa mbu nibe mwami wabo, muletebo hano, mukerebo mwa mbere sani!›»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aingira mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu mu lubaho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu abere ameotola ineena abinwa ibyo, nianaxondolera amuoba kweurukira i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Nianahika hofi na mutsi we Betifake na we Betaniya, kwa munda wa kitwa kya Miseyituni. Nianatuma babiri mwa <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Muende mwa mutsi yali ira buxondotsi. Mukaba mwahikamo, mukashingana kyana kya punda kiabikirwe, nakyo kitetsi kya urukwako na mundu. Muabulekyo, nenireleterakyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Na hakeba mundu ya babutsa mbu amuabulirakyoki? Ni mwa muxubitsa mbu: ‹Ninakuwetu yalaire kukyo.›»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Abemitsa bo batumwaa niabanaenda. Bashingana abinwa ni biri ngakuno ko Yesu shabwirabo. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Babere bali yobaabula akyana kya punda ikyo, bechakyo niabanabutsabo mbu: «Era! Amuabula akyana kya punda kubwishi bwaki?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Niabanaxubya mbu: «Ninakuwetu yalaire kukyo.»<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Inyuma kwaho, niabanaletera Yesu akyana kya punda ikyo. Ni abanashesha kukyo asangimba sabo, niabanaurukya Yesu kukyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Abere ali yaenda, abandu bereshesha asangimba sabo mwa nchira<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aBayahuti babaa banere kokera abakulukulu babo mwe shesha asangimba sabo mwa nchira kwe bwerekya ku bapfirebo xoni.</char></note>.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus entre à Jérusalem" file="WA03895b.tif" size="span" ref="19:36">Yesu aingira i Yerusalemu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yesu abere ahara hofi ne Yerusalemu, aharakima kwa kitwa kye Miseituni, amuoba woshe wa <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe bereenda ni abamoa kutsibu. Batangira isingya Ongo mu mulenge mule kubwishi bwa tushingishiro toshe to babaa bamelolako. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bereneena mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«Aashanirwe Amwami yahika mwetsina ra Ninakuwetu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Abuholo bube mu mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">ne Ongo ahabwe ngulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 118:26.</char></note>!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />
    <char style="w">Bafarisayo</char> bauma mu bobabaa kwa muoba wa bandu, babwira Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, kemera <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bawe mbu batsire!»<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Anibabwira mbu, aba bangaba baketsira, amabale ni makalehya amilenge!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alirira amulungu we Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Mwa mango Yesu abaa ahara hofi na mulungu we Yerusalemu, abere axungao, nianalirirao. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Nianabula mbu: «Iri iwe, munolwire ungamenyire kyo kingakuletera abuholo! Wetuwe, ikikyo kibishirwe tsene, utangaxungakyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kureba, kwendehika biro abalenda bawe bendekutsungulako kwebula mbu bakulwise. Mwa mango bendeba bamehimba mupfunda weikikiritsa hofi nawe, bendekusimekeretsa kwa nyunda yoshe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bendekushambula neita abandu bawe. Batendekusiira kiro ne bale literekirwe ku lindi mwiwe, kureba utamenyaa akashangi ke Ongo ahikaamo kwekutabara!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahentsa abachurutsi mwa hekalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesu nianaingira mwa mbuwa ya <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char>. Mwa mango aingiraamo, nianatangira ihentsa bobabaa abakoleramo abutundi. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Kiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire mbu: ‹Anyumba yani yendeba nyumba ye hemeramo Ongo.› Wetuwe imwe, mwamebindulayo buali bwa bashamutsi kwebuananiramo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 56:7; Yeremiya 7:11.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Abiro byoshe, Yesu abaa anaiisa abandu mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char>. <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> ba hekalu, na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">beisa ba Muomba</char> na batambobabaa abaxonda imwita. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Wetuwe, bahusha nchira ye mwita, kubwishi abandu boshe ni abamuumpfira kushe.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Amaala ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lwire luuma, Yesu abaa ali mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char> ni aiisa abandu nepfulirabo aMwatsi Mubuya. <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">beisa ba Muomba</char>, kuuma na bangumwa, niabanamuhikira. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Utubwire ngakuno mu rubu lwande mweukola abinwa ibi? Neri, inde ya kuha amaala ma rekolabyo?»<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Nani, anibabutsa kinwa kiuma. Munibwire: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Hai ho Yohana abonekyaa amaala ma rerubika abandu? Mbeni matokaa ira mwa Ongo, neri kwa bandu?»<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Niabanatangira ibutsabutsanya mbu: «Tukemuxubitsa mbu matokaa ira mwa Ongo, naye niakatubutsa mbu: ‹Kubwishi bwaki, mutamwimiriraa?› <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Na tukemuxubitsa mbu matokaa ku bandu, abandu boshe bo bali hano ni bakatwita mwetukabulanga mabale. Kubwishi aboshe baimirire kushe ku Yohana abaa <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char>.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Mwa ntsindiro niabanaxubya mbu: «Tutechi ha maala ma Yohana matokaa.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu naye nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Nani kwonoko, ndibabwire tikuno anerekola ibi mu maala mande.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amushinga wa bahingi babi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianachira abandu amushinga uyu mbu: «Habaa mundu muuma yabyalaa ixwa liwe ra <char style="w">Misabibu</char>. Amundu uyo, nianabwekya arexwa liwe ku bahingi bauma nebwirabo mbu bakenderemuha muhango wa myaka mwa mango bamexola. Nianaenda mu kihuo mbinga biro bingi. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Akianiro kya rexola kyabere kyaeraho, nianatuma muuma mwa bapfuku bewe kwa bahingi abo, mbu bamuhe amuhango uwe wa kwa myaka ya mwexwa liwe ra misabibu. Wetuwe, abahingi abo, niabanamuhumba, baba nemufulukya minwe misha. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Nina rexwa nianaxube tumirabo undi mupfuku. Uyo naye, niabanamuhumba nemukambanga. Bamuhentsa nemufulukya minwe misha. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nianatuma kandi mupfuku wa kashatu. Uyo naye, niabanamukomanga nemuhentsa mwa ixwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Niyo nina rexwa ra Misabibu aibutsa mbu: ‹Niirende tsene? Nikatumirabo muala wani, mutsiyirwa, kuti iye, bangamupfa xoni.› <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Wetuwe, abahingi babere baxunga muala uwe uyo, niabanabwirana mbu: ‹Talola! Uyu yakendelya amwandu wa rexwa iri. Tumwite, nge twaishibira naro.› <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Niabanamuhentsa mwexwa, nemwita.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Niyo Yesu abutsa abandu mbu: «Nina rexwa endekolera abahingi abo yoki? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Endehika, nehwerekeretsabo. Naho, endeha arexwa iro ro bandi bahingi.» Mwa mango abandu baumpfaa abinwa ibyo, niabananeena mbu: «Binwa biri ngebi, bitendetuhikira kiro na hake!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianasitabo amesha, nebwirabo mbu: «aMaandiko Makomire aya mabwire mate?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‹Arebale ra bahimbi batindaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">iro rorameba ibale rinene ra kwa musingi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 118:22.</char></note> wa nyumba.›<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />«Kintsi mundu yakendetoera kwe bale uko, endepfunikanga, na kintsi ula likendetoerako, rendemupfungulanga.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Mwa mango <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">abeisa ba Muomba</char> na <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> babere bahulikya batyo, niabanakengula ku Yesu sacha amushinga uyu kubwishi bwabo. Kubwishi bwekyo, mwa kashangi umoho, niabanabula mbu bamutsimbe, wetuwe, baubaha abandu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arefuta koli ya Kaisari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Abakulukulu ba Bayahuti abo, niabanatangira ihulilitsa Yesu. Batuma bandu baitsimbire nga bandu batunganene, kwebula mbu bamutee kinwa. Bairaa batyo, kubwishi babaa baxonda imuhira mwa minwe sa bakulukulu ba kihuo. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Abandu abo niabanamubutsa mbu: «Mwiyisa, twichi ku unereneena neiyisa binwa bya kuli. Na kandi, utalaa ku bukulukulu bwa mundu, wetuwe, unereiyisa abandu miberere yo Ongo atsiyire. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Kunchi utubwire: Mbeni aMuomba wetu atuikiritse neri atuhangire ifuta koli ya <char style="w">Kaisari</char>?»<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianakengula ku bamemutea kinwa. Nianabwirabo mbu: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Munibwerekye kichere kya lufaranga.» Nianabutsabo mbu: «Ashushani na retsina byobiriko byande?» Niabanaxubya mbu: «Bya <char style="w">Kaisari</char>.»<figure style="fig" alt="Les pièces d'argent avec la tête de l'empereur" file="hk00166c.tif" size="col" ref="20:24">Abichere bya safaranga so siriko ashushani ya Kaisari</figure> <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Niyo Yesu axubitsabo mbu: «Bya Kaisari, munerehabyo Kaisari. Na bya Ongo, munerehabyo Ongo.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Abandu abo, batakocha imutsimwako kinwa kyoshekyoshe kyemutea mwa mbere sa bandu, wetuwe bashishalira amuxubyo uwe, babanetsira.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">aBasandukayo na repfuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Inyuma kwaho, <char style="w">Basandukayo</char> bauma bahikira Yesu. Abo, bo banerebula mbu abapfu batendepfuka. Niabanamubutsa mbu: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Mwiyisa, Musa atuteekaa mbu mulume ahikitse akepfa atabutire mwana, muala wabo ni aingira amuxumbakatsi uyo, kwebutira wali mukulu uwe yo bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Aho, habaa balume balinda ba bula buuma. Afula niainahikya mukatsi. Niainapfa butsira mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Muala wabo wa kabiri niaingira amuxumbakatsi uyo, wetuwe naye nianapfa butsira mwana kwa muxumbakatsi uyo. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Nialunaba lutyo na ku muala wabo wa kashatu naye. Aboshe ko babaa balinda, banapfa butsira imubutako kiro na mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Mwa ntsindiro, amuxumbakatsi uyo, naye, nianapfa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Tsene, mwepfuka, amukatsi uyo, endeba mukande? Kubwishi abalinda boshe bamuhikyaa.»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Abandu ba kwa kihuo kuno banaherukya neheruka. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Wetuwe, abandu be Ongo akendexunga ku bashushire ipfuka kweingira mwa kihuo kyo kyendehika, batendeherukya neri iheruka. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Batikyendepfa, bendeba nga bamalaika. Abo bo bana ba Ongo, kubwishi Ongo apfukyaabo. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Musa axungaa kushe ku abapfu bendepfuka. Aneena kwikyo, wetuwe aMaandiko mewe amabula kubwishi bwa kitundi kyokyabaa akiulumira. Aho, aluka Ninakuwetu mbu: ‹Ongo wa Iburahimu, Ongo wa Isake ne Ongo wa Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mafuluko 3:2-6. </char></note>.›» <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yesu nianaxubebula mbu: «Ongo ye Ongo wa bandu bobaliho, wetuwe ate Ongo wa bapfu. Kureba aboshe baliho kwiye.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">Beisa</char> bauma ba Muomba niabanabwira Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, wameneena kushe.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Bataxuba iereka imubutsa kindi kinwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kirisitu ne Ndauti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu nianabutsa abandu mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki abandu ababula mbu <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char> Muala wa Ndauti? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ndauti yewene aneena mwa kitabo kya Saburi mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‹Ninakuwetu Ongo abwiraa Ninakuwetu mbu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Ikala kwa munda wani wa malyo,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />ihikira honikendehira abalenda bawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">hatako wa bishando byawe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 110:1.</char></note>.”›<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />«Ali mwami Ndauti aluka Kirisitu mbu Ninakuwabo, bateno ko Kirisitu uyo, angaxubeba Muala wa Ndauti?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutereba ngakuno abeisa ba Muomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:37-40">Mar 12:37-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Abandu boshe babere bakinahulikya, Yesu nianabwira <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe mbu: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Mutereba ngakuno <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">abeyisa ba Muomba</char>. Ibo, banatsiyira itamba ni baimbere twantsu tuletule. Na kandi banatsiyira iketsibwa ahandu ha mibuanano, neikala kwa bipfumbi bya ira buxondotsi mwa <char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">masinakoki</char> na hohalibwa linye. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Banerenyaa abyoshe bya baxumbakatsi baweteko, ni abahema Ongo mu kishangi kire kwebula mbu nge baxungwa na bandu. Abandu abo bendechirwa lubancha lutsibu irengya abandi bandu.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Amutulo wa muxumbakatsi muchene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu abaa mwa hekalu, nianatsungutsa amesha mwa bandu kwexunga kwa baxoki abatula mwa kitonga kya mitulo. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Na kandi, nianaxunga ku muxumbakatsi muuma muchene, naye ni atoetsamo tuchere tubiri twa faranga. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Niyo Yesu aneena mbu: «Mwa kuli, anibabwira ku amuxumbakatsi muchene uyu yametula bingi irengya abandi bandu boshe. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kureba abandi boshe aba bemetula bitwe byobitalaitse kubo. Wetuwe, amuxumbakatsi uyu, iye, mwa buchene buwe, ametula abyoshe byashaweteko mwebaho liwe.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfula amwatsi wa reshambulwa ra hekalu ye Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bandu bauma babaa abashambala kuluenda <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char>. Niabashambala kwa hekalu iyo, ihimbirwe kushe mu mabale makwirire na bindi bindu bikwirire bya bandu batulaa Ongo. Wetuwe Yesu niananeena mbu: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Abindu byo mutseneko ibi, kwendehika biro byo mutendexunga ibale literekirwe ku lindi. Abyoshe byendeshambulwa.»<figure style="fig" alt="Le Temple de Jerusalem" file="lb00250b.tif" size="span" ref="21:6">aHekalu ye Yerusalemu</figure><verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abinwa byo byendehika lubere lwa ntsindiro ya kihuo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-8">Mat 24:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-8">Mar 13:3-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Niyo abandu babutsa Yesu mbu: «Mwiyisa, abinwa ibyo byendehika mangoki? Tukendemenya tute ku byaxondehika?»<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Munakohya, muteretingwa! Kubwishi bandu bangi bendehika mwetsina rani, benderebula mbu: ‹Ingye, ngye Kirisitu. Akianiro kyameeraho.› Wetuwe ni mutikulikirebo. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Mwa mango mwenderehulikya abandu abaneena kuluenda lwa bita na kahinchangano, ni mutiereubaha. Kureba abinwa ibyo binashushire ihika kasa, wetuwe, mo kishangi umo ho, ni itetsi yaba yo ntsindiro ya kihuo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Luanda lwendelwa na lundi. Na bwami bwendelwa na bundi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kwendetsuka tulingiti tutsibu. Na handu hangi, hendeba bulio butsibu na kicha kitsibu. Na kwa mbingu kwendeba tushingishiro tutsibu to twendeubahya abandu.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />«Wetuwe lubere abyoshe ibyo biwiche, mwendetsimbwa nenubibwa. Benderebatwala kwehura mwa <char style="w" lemma="Sinakoki">masinakoki</char> nebauma mu muliki. Na kandi benderebatwala mwa mbere sa bami na mwa mbere sa bakulukulu ba kihuo kubwishi bwa ngye. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Mwa nchira umo momukenderepfula kyomwichi kwingye. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Tsene, kyomungamenyire mwa mitima yenyu ni kyeki: mwa kashangi mwenderehura, ni mutereibutsiritsa lubere mbu mbeni mukahura mute. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Kubwishi ingye ngyenawene, ngyenikendebaha binwa byabuteateanya, ihikira ha balenda benyu batendekocha ibalwisa neri ibakubisa. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Na babuti benyu, na baala benyu, na kipfunga kyenyu, na bera benyu nabo, bendebaleta mwa mbere sa bakulukulu. Na bauma mwimwe benderechirwa lubancha lwa lupfu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Na bandu boshe benderebabaa kubwishi bwa ingye. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Wetuwe, hate kiro na lupfiri lwa kwa mitwe yenyu lo lwendehera. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Munerebeera, kureba mwa nchira umo, mo mwendeufula abuingo bwenyu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Areshambulwa ra mulungu we Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mar 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Yesu nianaxubeneena mbu: «Mwa kashangi mwendexunga amulungu we Yerusalemu ametsungulwako na basura, ni mwamenya kwa reshambulwa rao lihara hofi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Abandu bo bakendeba mwa kyango kye Yuteya ni bashaira mwa bitwa. Na bo bakendeba mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu ni batokamo. Na bo bakendeba mwa bihya, ni batikixube mwa mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />«Kubwishi abiro ibyo byendeba biro byo Ongo endechira abandu bo lubancha, kwebula mbu abyoshe byo biandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire bibererere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Oseya 9:7.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Abiro ibyo, byendeba biro bya buhanya kwa bakule na bo baongya! Kubwishi mwa kihuo, mwendeba minubo mingi, ne Ongo endebwerekya abutsibuke buwe kwa luanda ulo. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bandu bauma bendeitwa mu buhombo, na bandi bendeperekwa mwa bindi bihuo byoshe. Na bandu ba sindi nganda bendelyatanga amulungu we Yerusalemu ihikira arebererera ra kianiro kyabo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arehika ra Muala wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Ahilolero hyendexungwa mwetsuba, na mwa mwetsi na mwa nyenyetsi. Na mwa kihuo muno abandu bendehita mushiki nepfa buba kubwishi bwa burunga bungi bwa milaba ya nyancha. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bandu bangi benderewa kihumu kubwishi bwa buba, kweanikira ku byo byahika kwa kihuo, kureba abyoshe byo biwete amaala mu mbingu byedetinganyibwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Aho, bendenixunga ingye, ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> nianihika mwa bipfu kuuma na maala na ngulu nyingi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Mwa mango abinwa ibi byendetangira ixungwa, mubatuke, musikye amyete, kureba areufulwa renyu ni rahara hofi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">abwami bwa Ongo buli hofi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianachirabo amushinga uno, mbu: «Mulolere kwa muti wa tini na indi miti yoshe: <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Mwa kashangi munerexunga kwa bisani byao abixoa, muneremenya ku akianiro kibuya kyahika. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Konoko, na mwa lwire mwendexunga abinwa ibi byahika, ni mwamenya kwa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char> buli hofi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira, abinwa ibi byendebererera, bandu bauma ba biro bino, ni batechi bapfa. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Ambingu na kihuo byendetsuka. Wetuwe, abinwa byani ibyo, bitendetsuka kiro na hake.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arefuluka ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Yesu nianaxuba ineena mbu: «Munakohya! Mutaitamiritsaa mwexonda ilya bingi kutsibu netamira. Mutainubyaa kubwishi bwa buingo bwenyu. Ali lute lutyo, alwire lo arefuluka ra Kirisitu lwendehika mu kindibukira, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />ngakuno kwa muteo anaxuta. Kubwishi akiro ikyo, kyendehikira abandu boshe ba mwa kihuo. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Munerekohya, ni amuhema Ongo mu kintsi kashangi. Niyo mwendewata nyiki sehima abyoshe ibyo byobingahika, neixunguxula mwa mbere sani, ingye, ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Yesu abaa anereshiba mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char> ni aiisa abandu. Na mwe kiro, abaa anaya ionchira kwa kitwa kye Miseituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Na bandu boshe babaa banalamukira mwa hekalu mwe lutumbi kwemuhulikya.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Anama yareita Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Alwire lukulu lwa mikati yoitemo chachu, lolunerelukwa mbu <char style="w">Pasaka</char>, ni aluxonda ihika. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" /><char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">beisa ba Muomba</char> babaa berexonda ko bangaita Yesu. Wetuwe babaa ni baubahire abandu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuta aikiritsa ihotera Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Shitani nianaingira mu Yuta yabaa alukwa mbu ye Isikariyote. Yuta uyo abaa muuma mwa ndumwa ikumi nebiri sa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Nianaenda isimola na <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na bakulukulu ba balangi ba hekalu, kweumpfiritsanya nabo kwangahota Yesu kubo. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Niabanamoa kutsibu, niabanalaana ku bakamuha faranga. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuta nianaimira, nianatangira ixonda kashangi kabuya kwa ngahabo Yesu butsira abandu imenya.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akalihya abiryo bya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-26">Mar 14:12-26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Alwire lukulu lwa mikati itemo chachu luhika. Nalo ni lo lwire lobalirene ixootamo abyana bya-buli, kubwishi bwa bilyo bya <char style="w">Pasaka</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu nianalika Petero ne Yohana mbu: «Muende mututekere biryo bya <char style="w">Pasaka</char> nge twalyabyo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Auxonda mbu tutekerebyo hai?»<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Muumpfe: mweba mwaingira mwa mulungu, mwekorana na mulume ni ahete kibindi kya mechi. Amulume uyo, ni mwamukulikira mwa nyumba yakaingiramo. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Ni mwabwira nina anyumba iyo mbu: ‹Mwiyisa akubutsa mbu mbeni liri hai arechumbi rakaliramo abilyo bya <char style="w">Pasaka</char> kuuma na <char style="w">bemitsa</char> bewe.› <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Naye akababwerekya ichumbi liali ra kwa korofa, lirimo abyoshe byobilaitse. Umo momukatekera abiryo bya Pasaka.»<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Abemitsa bewe abo niabanaenda, batimana abyoshe ni binali nga ko Yesu shabwirabo. Ba baneteka abiryo bya <char style="w">Pasaka</char>.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biryo bya muubuko wa Ninakuwetu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Bakor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Akashangi kabere kaeraho, Yesu nianaikala kwelya kuuma na <char style="w" lemma="Ndumwa">sandumwa</char> siwe. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus mange la Paque avec ses apotres" file="WA03910b.tif" size="span" ref="22:14">Yesu alya biryo bya Pasaka kuuma na sandumwa siwe</figure> <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Nianabwirato mbu: «Nalabwaa kutsibu ilya abiryo bya <char style="w">Pasaka</char> iyi kuuma nemwe, buxondotsi ninubibwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Mwa kuli anibabwira ku ndikendelya kiro na hake ku Pasaka, ihikira lwire lonikendelya ku yoibererere mwa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianatsimba alungu, nianasima Ongo, abula mbu: «Mutsimbe alungu ulu, mushangirelo. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Mwa kuli, anibabwira kwetangira akashangi kano nitikendexoma kandi tifai ino kiro na hake ihikira alwire lwa <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char> bwendehika.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianatsimba amukati, nianasima Ongo, nianacha muo, nianahao abemitsa bewe. Aneena mbu: «Uno wo mubiri wani wametulwa kubwishi bwemwe. Munerekola mutyo kweniubuka.»<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Babere bameotola ilya, Yesu nianatsimba alungu lwa tifai, nianahalobo neneena mbu: «Alungu luno yo <char style="w">Ndaane</char> Nyihya kwetsukira mwa shiama yani yoikashesheka kubwishi bwemwe.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />«Wetuwe mulole, amundu yakanihotera ali hano, abobetsa kuuma nani mwa mbale. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" /><char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> akapfa ngakuno kwe Ongo atondekaa. Wetuwe, alyae amundu yakamuhotera.» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Abemitsa bewe niabanatangira ibutsanya mbu mbeni inde mubo yakakola akinwa ikyo?<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inde ye mukulukulu ku mulikyabo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Inyuma kwaho, mwa kati ka bemitsa bewe niamunahuluka buhaka butsibu bwa remenya mbu mbeni inde ye mukulukulu ku balikyabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Abandu ba sindi nganda, abami babo banaimanirabo mu maala. Na bobali na maala kubo banereiluka mbu: ‹Bakotsi ba bibuya›. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Wetuwe imwe, muterekola mutyo. Amukulukulu mwimwe, ni yaba nga ye mulere. Na yaimanirire abandi ni yaba ngakuno ye mupfuku. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Kubwishi bwekyo, inde ye mukulukulu ku mulikyabo? Mbeni yaikere ni alya, neri yakola? Mbeni ate yaikere ni alya ye mukulukulu? Wetuwe nakiro mbu batyo, ingye niri mwa kati kenyu ngakuno mupfuku.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />«Imwe mo mwamebeera kuuma nani mwa myereko yani. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Kubwishi bwekyo, ngakuno ko Tata anihaa abwami nani ko nabahabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Mwendelya nexoma mutyo kuuma nani mwa bwami bwani. Nemwe mwemukendeikala kwa ndebe sa bwami kwechira lubancha asanganda ikumi nebiri sa Baisiraeli.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfulao ko Petero akayianaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-34">Mat 26:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesu nianabwira Simoni mbu: «Simoni, Simoni, umpfa! Kwebaereka, Shitani amehabwa rubu lwebaulula ngakuno ko banaulula abulo. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Wetuwe, ingye namekuhemera kwebula mbu utasiyaa abwimire bwawe. Nawe, mwa mango ukanifulukira kandi, ni watsibuhiritsa banyakyenyu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petero nianamubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, ingye niikiritse iya mwa muliki, linabe na repfa kuuma nawe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Petero, anikubwira ku munolwire, lubere axongole ikokobike, ukaba ni wameiana ingye ngendo ishatu mbu utanichi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abwira abemitsa mbu bailweko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianabutsa abemitsa bewe mbu: «Mwa mango na batumaa butsira faranga, neri shaho, neri bilyato, mbeni hali kindu kyo mwahushaa?» Niabanaxubya mbu: «Ihi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Wetuwe tsene, yawete ku faranga atsimbe kuto, na yawete ku shaho atsimbe kuyo. Na yatawete ku buhombo, autse arekoti liwe aule buuma. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Anibabwira kwa binwa ibyo, byobiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire bishushire inihikira mbu: ‹Aanchwaa mwa bandu babi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 53:12. </char></note>.› Kubwishi abinwa byobinitsene biri hofi nehika kwa ntsindiro yabyo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Abemitsa bamubwira mbu: «Ninakuwetu, talola ku hano tuliho na mahombo mabiri.» Naye nianaxubya mbu: «Muendere aho!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahema Ongo kwa kitwa kya Miseituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu nianatengaho, nianaurukira kwa kitwa kya Miseituni nga kwabaa atula aira. <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">Abemitsa</char> bewe niabanamukulikira. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Abere amehikako, nianabwira abemitsa bewe mbu: «Muheme Ongo, kwebula mbu mube na maala mehima amyereko.»<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Inyuma kwaho, nianasiabo ku buende bwa retala bale lingatoera liri shalikabulwa. Nianashinga amapfi, nianatangira ihema Ongo mbu: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Tata, ukeshasha, alungu lwa minubo ulu tsukyalo hale nani! Wetuwe, na kiro lwaba lutyo, litabaa nga ko nishashire, wetuwe areshasha rawe rolikolwae.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:42">[ <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Niyo malaika atoka mu mbingu amukimira kwemuha nyiki. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesu nianatsimbwa na kindowa, abanelengeretsa kwehema Ongo. Asandubano sosabaa asimuchikako siba ngakuno matondi ma shiama mo matoangira hashi.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Abere amekinda ihema, nianabatuka, nianaxuba hashasiya <char style="w" lemma="Bemitsa">abemitsa</char> bewe. Nianashinganabo ni bameya tulo, kubwishi ni bahotokire kwa buyongwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Nianabutsabo mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amuya tulo? Mubatuke, muheme Ongo niyo mukaba na nyiki sa rehima amyereko.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atsimbwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu abere akinali aneena, mu kashalimo niakunapfumbuka muoba wa bandu. Ne Yuta, muuma mwa ndumwa ikumi nebiri sa Yesu ni yaxondolerebo. Nianasheera hofi ne Yesu kwemukokera. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yesu nianamubutsa mbu: «Yuta, mbeni mwenikokera mo wanihotera ngye <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char>?»<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Abemitsa ba Yesu babere baxunga ku byobikatsuka, niabanamubutsa mbu: «Ninakuwetu mbeni tukomangebo mu buhombo?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Mu kashalimo, muuma mubo nianakomanga amupfuku wa <char style="w">shebakungu</char>, nemucha arekwitwi ra kwa malyo. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Wetuwe, Yesu niananeena mbu: «Muendere aho!» Nianapfula kwe kwitwi ra mupfuku uyo, nemufumyaro.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Inyuma kwaho, Yesu nianabwira <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na bakulukulu ba balangi ba <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu</char> na bangumwa ba Bayahuti boshabahika kwemutsimba mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki mwamenihikira ni muhete mahombo, na ngonyi, ngakuno ndi munyai? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Abiro byoshe nabaa kuuma nemwe mwa hekalu, wetuwe mutanitsimba. Wetuwe, kano ko kashangi kenyu, kandi kashangi ka maala ma bubi mo makola mu mutsimya.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petero ayiana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoh 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Inyuma kwaho, abandu abo niabanatsimba Yesu, niabanamutwala nemuhikya mwa nyumba ya <char style="w">shebakungu</char>. Petero nianamukulikira kashando bunono.<verse eid="LUK 22:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Niabanachana muchanwa mwa kati ka mbuwa ya shebakungu, Petero nianaikala hauma nabo kweanyukala. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mwa mango mucha muuma axungaa ku Petero ni aikere hamusike wa muchanwa, nianamusita amesha, abula mbu: «Amundu uyu naye abaa kuuma ne Yesu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Wetuwe Petero nianaiana, abula mbu: «We mukatsi! Ndechi amundu uyo!» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Hanyuma wa kishangi kike, undi mundu naye nianaxunga ku Petero, nianamubwira mbu: «Iwe nawe, uli muuma nabo!» Wetuwe Petero nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Ingye nde muuma nabo!»<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kwabere kwametsuka nga saa nguma, undi mundu nianaiminga ku Petero nebula mbu: «Mwa kuli, amundu uyu abaa kuuma ne Yesu, kubwishi naye mwicha i Ngalilaya.»<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Wetuwe Petero nianaxubya mbu: «We mulume! Ndechi kyo uxondeneena.» Mwa kashangi umo, Petero akinaneena, axongole niainakokobika. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Ninakuwetu nianakebera nesindera Petero. Aho, Petero nianakengula ku Yesu amemuxunga. Nianaubuka abinwa byamubwiraa mbu: «Munolwire, buxondotsi axongole ikokobike, weba ni wameiana ingye kashatu ku utanichi!» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petero nianahuluka hambua, nianatangira ilira mu buyongwa butsibu.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abasura bakolera Yesu yo muchechu ne muhumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Abandu bobabaa abalanga Yesu babaa bamusheka nemuhumba. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bamuxwika abusu, nemubutsa mbu: «Kola butahwa! Inde yamekuhumba?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Niabanamubwira bindi binwa byemukamba.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahura mwa Bushenge Bukulu bwa Bayahuti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Bwabere bwamekya, abangumwa ba Bayahuti, na <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">beisa ba Muomba</char> niabanakorana. Niabanaleta Yesu mwa <char style="w" lemma="Bushenge Bukulu bwa Bayuta">Bushenge Bukulu</char> bwabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Niabanamubutsa mbu: «Mbeni we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char>? Utubwire!» Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Nakiro na babwira mbu ngye iye, mutiniimirire. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Na kandi nikebabutsa kinwa, mutinixubitse. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Wetuwe, ihuluka tsene <char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> akaikala kwa malyo ma Ongo Nina Maala.»<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Aho, aboshe niyo bamubutsa mbu: «Rebula mbu iwe we Muala wa Ongo?» Yesu nianaxubitsabo mbu: «Byo mwamebula byenebyo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Mwa ntsindiro, niabanabula mbu: «Tutakilaire ku kaliho! Twenabene twameiumpfira byameneena yewene.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahura mwa mbere sa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Inyuma kwaho, abandu boshe bobabaa mwa Bushenge Bukulu bwa Bayahuti niabanabatuka netwala Yesu mwa mbere sa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Niabanatangira imusongera mbu: «Twashinganaa amundu uyu ni asheeretsa abandu ba mwa luanda lwetu. Erehangirabo mbu batafutaa koli ya <char style="w">Kaisari</char>. Na kandi ereihalilitsa mbu ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char> Mwami.»<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato nianabutsa Yesu mbu: «Mbeni we Mwami wa Bayahuti?» Yesu amuxubitsa mbu: «Kyowamebula kyenekyo!» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Niyo Pilato abwira <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na mubuanano wa bandu mbu: «Ingye, ndanixunga kyo kyangatuma amundu uyu achirwa lubancha lwepfa.»<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Wetuwe, ibo baiminga kutsibu mbu: «Asheeretsa abandu mwa meiso mewe mwa kyango kyoshe kye Yuteya. Atangiriraao mwa kyango kye Ngalilaya, tsene yoyu amehika nao kuno.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahura mwa mbere sa Herote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Mwa kashangi Pilato ahulikyaa abinwa ibyo, nianabutsa mbu: «Mbeni Yesu mwicha i Ngalilaya? <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Abere amemenya ku Yesu mwicha i Ngalilaya ye Herote abaa ateekirwe, Pilato nianatuma Yesu ira mwa Herote, kubwishi Herote abaa ali i Yerusalemu mwa biro umo.»<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herote abere axunga ku Yesu, nianamoa kutsibu. Ihuluka biro bingi abaa anaipfutsa imuxunga kubwishi abaa anereumpfa abandu ni abashambala kuluenda iye. Kalengyo abaa axonda ixunga ku Yesu niakola kashingishiro. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Nianamubutsa binwa bingi. Wetuwe, Yesu atamuxubitsa kiro na kinwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />
    <char style="w" lemma="boshebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na <char style="w" lemma="Mwiyisa wa muomba">Beisa ba Muomba</char> bobabaa aho, nianahambala mwesongera Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Herote na basura bewe bashekenyula Yesu nemunena. Niabanamuimbakya lukimba lukwirire, nemufulukya ira mwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Mwa lubere, Herote ne Pilato babaa balenda. Wetuwe, itangira alwire ulo, babinduka bera.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato ahana rubu lwareita Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoh 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Aho, Pilato nianakongya <char style="w" lemma="Shebakungu">boshebakungu</char>, na bakulukulu ba Bayahuti na bandu. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Mwameniletera amundu uyu mbu asheeretsa abandu. Kubwishi bwekyo, namemubutsa kuluenda abinwebyo mwa mbere senyu, wetuwe ndamuxungireko kinwa kibi mwa binwa byomumusongerako. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Ne Herote kwonoko, naye, atamuxungireko bubi bosheboshe. Nekyo kyo kyametuma anifulukitsaye. Tsene muumpfe, amundu uyu hatali bubi bosheboshe bwakolire bo bungatuma aitwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Kubwishi bwekyo, nikamuhumbisa, niyo namuminula.» [ <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Mu kintsi lwire lukulu lwa Pasaka, Pilato abaa analikulira abandu bo mundu muuma wa muliki.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Wetuwe, abandu boshe niabanalehya amirenge kuuma mbu: «Ita mundu uyu! Utuboholere Baraba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Ne Baraba uyo, abaa aminirwe kubwishi bwa kahinchangano ka bandu bakolaa mwa mulungu na kandi kubwishi aitaa mundu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato abaa axonda ibohola Yesu. Kubwishi bwekyo, nianaxubeneene na bandu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Wetuwe, abandu niabanalehya kandi amirenge mbu: «Umuhangike ku musalaba! Umuhangike ku musalaba!»<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato nianaxubebutsa abandu ngendo ya kashatu mbu: «Akolire bubiki? Ingye ndaxungire kibi kyoshekyoshe kyokyangatuma aitwa. Kubwishi byekyo, nikamuhumbisa mu ngonyi niyo namubohola.»<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Wetuwe, abandu baiminga kutsibu, balehya amirenge mbu Yesu ahangikwe ku musalaba. Pilato nianahimwa kubwishi bwa burunga bwa bandu. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Niyo Pilato akola nga kwa bandu abobabaa abamuhema. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Nianaboholerabo amundu yo babaa abahema. Naho amundu uyo, ni aminwaa kubwishi bwa kainchangano mwa mulungu na kandi abaa ameita mundu. Niyo Pilato ahabo Yesu mbu bamuire ngakuno ko bashashire.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahangikwa kwa musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Abasura niabanatwala Yesu ho bakamuhangika kwa musalaba. Niabanakorana na mundu muuma mbu ye Simoni ni afuluka mwexwa. Simoni uyo, abaa mwicha mwa mulungu we Kurene. Niabanamutsimba, bamuhekya amusalaba wa Yesu mu nyiki. Nianakulikira Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Muoba wa bandu bangi nianakulikira Yesu. Mubo ni muli bakatsi bo bamulirira, neiririkana kubwishi bwaye. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu nianakebera ira bali, nianabwirabo mbu: «Mo bakatsi be Yerusalemu, mutaniliriraa, wetuwe muililire mwenabene na bana benyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kubwishi, kwendehika biro bya bandu bendebula mbu: ‹Baashanirwe abakatsi ngumba bo batatangire babuta na bo batatangire baongya!› <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Mo biromo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">abandu bendetangira ibwira abitwa mbu: ‹Mutukunukire!›</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">Na tutwa mbu: ‹Mutubishe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Oseya 10:8. </char></note>!›<verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />«Kubwishi, bali banganikolerekyo ingye, ngye niri ngakuno muti mubishi, bate ko bakendebakolera imwe mo muli ngakuno miti myumu?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Habaa na balume babiri bakotsi ba bibi bo baletwaa kwehangikwa kuuma ne Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Babere bahika ho hanalukwa mbu: «Kahangatsi», bahangika Yesu ku musalaba. Niabanahangika na bakotsi babiri ba bibi abo, muuma kwa malyo ma Yesu, na undi kwa malembe mewe.<figure style="fig" alt="La crucifixion" file="WA03926b.tif" size="span" ref="23:33">Arehangikwa kwa musalaba</figure> <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />[Aho, Yesu niananeena mbu: «Tata, ushashirebo, kubwishi batechi kyobakola.»]</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Abasura niabanaabana asangimba sa Yesu mwikubirato mbayi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Abandu bobabaa baimene aho ni abasindera. Abakulukulu ba Bayahuti bamushekenyula mbu: «Aufulaa abandi. Tsene aiufule yewene ali ye <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char>, yalondolwaa ne Ongo!»<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Abasura nabo bakolera Yesu yo muchechu. Baipfunda hofi naye kwemuletera <char style="w">tifai</char> ya ngala. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Niabanamubwira mbu: «Iwe uli we Mwami wa Bayahuti, uiufule wenawene!»<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Hambashiro wa mutwe uwe habaa kashai kaandikirweko mbu: «Uyu ye Mwami wa Bayahuti.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Muuma mwa bakotsi ba bibi abo bobabaa bahangikirwe kuuma naye kwa misalaba, nianakamba Yesu mbu: «Mbeni, ute we <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char>? Utibaiufule, netwe uketuufula!»<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Wetuwe, mulikyabo nianamukemera, mbu: «Utaubahire Ongo nakiro mbu uchirirwe lubancha lwepfa ngakuno amundu uyu? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Itwe alubancha lotuchirirwe lwa butunganane, kubwishi twamechirwalo kweimitsanya na bibi byotwakolaa. Wetuwe amundu uyu, iye hate kiro na kibi kyakolaa.»<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ni yabula mbu: «Yesu, unaniubuka mwa mango wendehika kwe wima.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Mwa kuli, anikubwira ku munolwire ukaba kuuma nani mwa <char style="w">Paratiso</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alupfu lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />Bwabere bwaxondeba kati ka mwishi, aretsuba litsima. Kubwishi bwekyo, amutsimya axwika akihuo kyoshe, ihikira mu saa mwenda. Na pasiya yo yabaa ihanikirwe mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu ya Ongo">hekalu ya Ongo</char> iberekera mwa katikati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:44-45 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">pasiya yo yabaa ihanikirwe mwa hekalu ya Ongo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yabaa lukimba lwe kikiritsa mwa hekalu ahandu Hohakomire na Hohakomire Kutsibu. Shebakungu ho yabaa anahulukana mwa pasiya umo kweya ikorana ne Ongo. Niyo Ongo aberenga apasiya iyo, kwebula mbu kintsi mundu ahara angaipfunda hofi naye. Soma Mafuluko 26:31-33; Baeburaniya 10:19-22.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu nianailakira kutsibu mbu: «Tata, natereka amutima wani mwa minwe sawe.» Abere ameneena abinwa ibyo, nianatoa mutima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Saburi 31:6.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Amukulukulu wa basura, abere axunga byobyametsuka, nianasingya Ongo mbu: «Mwa kuli, amundu uyu abaa atunganene!»<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Abandu boshe bo bahikaa kwexunga byobyameba, niabanafuluka, neenda niabaibandanga kwa bipfuba kubwishi bwa buyongya. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Abandu boshe bobabaa bechi Yesu, na bakatsi bo bamukulikiraa ihuluka i Ngalilaya niabanaimana hale kwelola ku byo byabaa abitsuka.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aretabwa ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Habaa mundu muuma aretsina liwe ni ye Yosefu, wa mwa mulungu we Arimatayo, mwa kyango kye Yutea. Yosefu uyo, abaa mundu mubuya kandi ni atunganene. Abaa alindilire alehika ra <char style="w">bwami bwa Ongo</char>. Na kandi abaa muuma wa mwa Bushenge Bukulu bwa Bayahuti. Wetuwe iye, abaa ataikiritsenye na balikyabo mwa luhota lwabo lwa reita Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Nianaendera Pilato kwemuhema andundwe ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Nianabula mbu bakimyeyo kwa musalaba, nianabungirayo mu mushangi akwirire, netayo mwesinda rorabaa litimirwe mu lukanga. Na resinda iro, ni litatsaratabwamo kiro na mundu.<figure style="fig" alt="Le tombeau" file="WA03929b.tif" size="span" ref="23:53">Aresinda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Alwire ulo, lwabaa lwakatano mwe luoloolo, na <char style="w">Sabato</char> yabaa aixonda itangira.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Abakatsi abo bobabaa bahereketse Yesu ihuluka i Ngalilaya bakulikira Yosefu. Baxunga aresinda na kwa ndundwe ya Yesu yaterekwaamo.<verse eid="LUK 23:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Inyuma kwaho, niabanafuluka kweya ikola lungo na mapfuta mehaka andundwe ya Yesu. Na mwa lwire lwa <char style="w">Sabato</char> niabanatamuka nga kwa Muomba aherebo rubu.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Arepfuka ra Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Mwe lutumbi lwa lwire lwa reinga, abakatsi abo, niabanalamukira kwesinda ni bahete mapfuta ma lungo mobabaa bameoxola. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Niabanashingana arebale rorabaa lihirirwe kwa lukyo lwa resinda ni ramehingiritibwa hale na resinda. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Niabanaingira mwesinda, wetuwe batashinganamo andundwe ya Ninakuwetu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Babere bakiri abashishala kubwishi bwa kinwa ikyo, mwa kishangi umo ho, bandu babiri niabanapfumbukira kubo. Abandu abo ni baimbere ngimba asibwenga kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Kubwishi bwa buba, abakatsi abo niabanabanda mesha hashi. Wetuwe abandu abo, niabanabutsabo mbu: «Kubwishi bwaki amuxondera yaliho mwa bapfu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Atakiri hano, apfukire. Munaubuka abinwa bya babwiraa mwa mango abaa akinali i Ngalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Muhabire kwa babwiraa mbu: ‹<char style="w">Muala wa Mundu</char> lirena ihirwa mwa minwe sa bandu ba santsambi. Bakamuhangika ku musalaba, wetuwe mwa lwire lwa kashatu akapfuka.›»<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Niyo abakatsi abo, baubuka abinwa byo Yesu abwiraabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Niabanatenga kwesinda. Abinwa byoshe ibyo byo balolaako baya ipfulirabyo asandumwa ikumi na nguma na bandi bandu.<verse eid="LUK 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Na bakatsi abo bobayaa ipfulira <char style="w" lemma="Ndumwa">asandumwa</char> amwatsi uyo babaa ni bobano: Mariya mwicha i Makitala, ne Shani, ne Mariya nina wa Yakobo, na bandi bakatsi bobabaa kuuma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Wetuwe asandumwa ito sixunga amwatsi wa bakatsi nga wa bushabusha, sitabaneimirirao.<verse eid="LUK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Wetuwe Petero, iye, nianabatuka alibitira kwesinda. Abere ahika iyo, nianaindamirira, nianaxungamoho abiremba ya sangimba yoyabaa ibungirwe kwa ndundwe ya Yesu. Nianafuluka ira mwe ni ashishala kutsibu kubwishi bwa binwa byobyametsuka.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfumbukira kwa bemitsa babiri mwa nchira ye Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Mwa lwire umoho, bemitsa babiri ba Yesu babaa baya mu mutsi muuma mbu we Emausi. Amutsi uyo abaa ni ali ku buende abushembashemba bilometere ikumi na kiuma na mulungu we Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Babaa abaenda ni abashambala kuluenda abyoshe byobyabaa byametsuka. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Babere bakinali abashambala nebutsanya, Yesu yewene nianahika hofi nabo neenda kuuma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Babaa bamutseneko, wetuwe, amesha mabo mahuma kwebula mbu batamumenyaa.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu nianabutsabo mbu: «Amusimola binwaki ni amuenda?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Abemitsa abo niabanaimana ni bali na buyongwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Muuma mubo mbu ye Kileopa, nianamuxubitsa mbu: «Abandu boshe ba mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu bechi abinwa byobyametsuka muo mo biromu! Wenaweneho weutanechi abinwa ibyo?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu naye nianabutsabo mbu: «Mbeni binwaki ibyo?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Niabanamuxubitsa mbu: «Abinwa byobyahikiraa Yesu we Nasareti! Abaa <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">mutahwa</char> mukulu. Abaa awete maala mwa mineenere na mwekola atushingishiro mwa mbere sa Ongo na mwa mbere sa bandu boshe. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Niyo <char style="w" lemma="Shebakungu">boshebakungu</char> na bakulukulu betu bamuhana kwebula mbu achirwe lubancha lwa lupfu. Inyuma kwaho, niabanamuhangika ku musalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Itwe twabaa tuinihire kwiye yakendeufula aBaisiraeri. Wetuwe, lwahara lwire lwa kashatu luno, abinwa ibyo bitsukire. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Na kandi bakatsi bauma ba mwa kikanga kyetu nabo, batushishetse. Abakatsi abo shabaya kwesinda mwe lutumbi, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />wetuwe, batatimene andundwe iwe. Niyo bafuluka kwetupfulira amwatsi ku <char style="w" lemma="Malaika">abamalaika</char> shabapfumbukira kubo nebwirabo mbu Yesu aliho. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Inyuma kwaho, bauma mwitwe nabo shabaya kwesinda, bashingana abinwa byoshe ni binali nga kwa bakatsi abo shababula. Ibo nabo, batashabaxunga andundwe ya Yesu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Niyo Yesu abwirabo mbu: «Imwe muli bandu batawete bwenge! Na myete yenyu itaiimirira chuba abinwa byoshi bya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> babulaa! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" /><char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char> abaa anashushire inubibwa atyo kasa, ni yaingira mwa ngulu iwe.» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Niyo Yesu axonchomolerabo abinwa byoshe byobiandikirwe kuluende iye mwa Maandiko Makomire. Nianatangira kwa bitabo bya Musa, ihikira kwa bitabo byoshe bya batahwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Babere bahika hofi na mutsi wobabaa abayamo, Yesu ninaba ngakuno ahulukana. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Wetuwe, abemitsa abo niabanaitondoola kuye mbu: «Shiba netwe, kubwishi lwahara luoloolo, na butuku buno bwaxonda ikura.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">Kubwishi bwekyo, nianaingira mwa nyumba kweba kuuma nabo.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Nianaikala kwelya kuuma nabo. Nianatsimba amukati, nianasima Ongo nianachamuo nehaobo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Amesha mabo mahumukala, niyo bamumenya. Wetuwe, Yesu nianaliribana, bataxubemuxunga. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Kubwishi bwekyo, babwirana mbu: «Mwa kuli, shaba ali yaneena netwe mwa nchira netuxonchomolera aMaandiko Makomire, amyete yetu shaiuchwire lumoo!»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Niabanabatuka mwa kashangi umoho nefuluka i Yerusalemu. Niabanatimana asandumwa ikumi na nguma ni sibuanene kuuma na balikyabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Bobabaa babuanene, nianabwira abemitsa babiri abo mbu: «Mwa kuli, Ninakuwetu apfukire! Shapfumbukira ku Simoni! Ne Simoni shamuxunga.»<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Abemitsa babiri abo nabo, niabanapfulira balikyabo abinwa byoshabitsuka mwa nchira, na koshabamenya Yesu mwa kashangi shacha mwa mukati.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apfumbukira kwa bemitsa bewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mikol 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Abemitsa babere bakinaneena kuluenda abinwa ibyo, mu kashalimo Yesu nianaimana mwa kati kabo. Nianabwirabo mbu: «Mube na buholo!»<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Niabanaishalima neubaha kutsibu, kubwishi baanitsaa mbu bamexunga ku mutsimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Wetuwe, Yesu nianabwirabo mbu: «Amuiririkana kuki? Na kubwishi bwaki amutikatika mwa myete yenyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mulole kwa biancha byani na kwa bishando byani kwemenya kushe kwingye ngye uno! Munipfuleko nenilolako. Amutsimu atabako minyopfu na mapfuha. Wetuwe ingye mutsene ku niwete kubyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu abulaatyo, kwe bula mbu balole kwa ngopfu sa misumari kwa biancha na kwa bishando biwe. Batyo niyo bakamenya kushe kweya iyo yeyeho. </char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Na mwa kishangi Yesu aneenaatyo, nianabwerekyabo abiancha na bishando biwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Abemitsa babaa batechi baimira kubwishi bwa lumoo na reshishala. Niyo Yesu abutsabo mbu: «Muwete ku kalyo hano?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Niabanamuha kiche kya fi kiokitse. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Nianatsimbakyo abanelyakyo mwa mesha mabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Niyo abwirabo mbu: «Mwa mango nabaa kuuma nemwe nababwiraa mbu: ‹Abinwa byoshe byo biandikirwe kuluenda ingye mwa <char style="w">Muomba</char> wa Musa na mwa bitabo bya <char style="w" lemma="Mutahwa, Mutahwakatsi">batahwa</char> na mwa Saburi byabaa bishushire ibererera.›»<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Niyo Yesu abohola amenge mabo kwebula mbu bamenye ko aMaandiko Makomire maneenire. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Nianabwirabo mbu: «Kiandikirwe mwa Maandiko Makomire ku <char style="w" lemma="Kirisitu, Masiya, Muufutsi">Kirisitu</char> abaa analirene ni anubibwa, nepfuka mwa bapfu mwa lwire lwa kashatu inyuma ya repfa liwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Isaya 53; Oseya 6:2.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Na mwe tsina liwe mo bendepfulirao abandu ba sanganda soshe, ihuluka ku Yerusalemu mbu <char style="w" lemma="Ihingya miberere">bahingye amiberere</char> yabo kwebula mbu Ongo ashashirebo <char style="w" lemma="Ntsambi">asantsambi</char> sabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Imwe, mwendereba tuliho twa binwa ibi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Nani ngyewene nendebatumira amanihisa mo Tata abalaa mbu endebatumira. Wetuwe mulindirire mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu, ihikira alwire lomwendebonekyamo amaala momatenga ira mwa Ongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soma Mikolere 1:4-5. </char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akukumwa mu mbingu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mikol 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Mwa ntsindiro, Yesu nianatenga mwa mulungu we Yerusalemu kuuma na bemitsa bewe kwetwalabo hofi na mutsi we Betaniya. Babere bahika iyo, nianabatula asaminwe siwe kweaashanirabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Abere akinali aashanirabo, nianailikalikanya nabo, nianakukumwa mu mbingu.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus est fait monter au ciel" file="WA03935b.tif" size="span" ref="24:51">Yesu akukumwa mu mbingu</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Bamuimanikira, nefuluka i Yerusalemu ni bamoire kutsibu. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Abiro byoshe babaa banaikala mwa <char style="w" lemma="Hekalu">hekalu</char> ya Ongo ni abasingya Ongo.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>